window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3801,"title":"Chapter 3801: Northern Yan (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3801: Northern Yan (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","When she looked again, she saw that there was no obstruction.","Just then, Feng Wu heard a voice.","“Hey, are you here to try your luck, too?”","Feng Wu couldn’t help but turn around when she heard the voice. A handsome teenager stood in front of her and looked at her in amazement.","“Try my luck?” Feng Wu was confused.","“That’s right. Aren’t you here to try your luck and hope that you can break in and meet the grandmaster?” The teenager glanced at Feng Wu, convinced that she was pretending.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","“You have a point. Everyone wants to be favored by the grandmaster, and everyone wants to try their luck. What if they succeed? Don’t you think so?” The teenager grinned at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu chuckled. She still didn’t get it.","Crossing his hands behind his back, the teenager sighed. “I’ve seen a lot of kids like you. See? Over there is my refinery shop. I can see people trying their luck here every day.","“Look at this tablet. It says: If fate wills it, I’ll give something to you as a gift.","“It’s from the patriarch of the Huyan family.","“He used to be an emperor for a day, so he deserved to be called ‘His Majesty’.","Moreover, he was the top alchemist back then.”","The teenager gave Feng Wu a gloating look and spoke in a tone that suggested he had been there before. “Therefore, over the years, many capable cultivators have come here and either tried to force their way in or prostrate on the ground. They all want to meet him.","“But no.” The teenager waved his hand. “For years, I’ve never seen anyone go in. ”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “You’re too young to make that claim.”","The teenager snorted. “I have my dad and my grandpa. Neither of them has seen anyone go in or come out. I don’t know if our patriarch is still there...’","“Yichen!” A cold, authoritative voice rang out.","It was the voice of an old man.","“Yes, Grandpa, I’m here! I’ll be right there!”","The teenager called Yichen turned around and called out to the old man in the room. He then turned back to Feng Wu with a casual smile on his face. “Young lady, you’re so unlucky, aren’t you? The stone tablet hasn’t moved, which means that you’re not the chosen one either.”","Huyan Yichen grinned at Feng Wu and patted her on the shoulder to comfort her, but he was very pleased with himself.","Feng Wu ignored him, for all her attention was on the inscription on the tablet.","Nothing had happened, which meant that she hadn’t been able to remove the barrier.","Maybe she could try it with her own blood?","Feng Wu was still thinking that way when she sensed a strange gaze on her.","She was very acute. Even with her current cultivation level, she could still easily sense that she was being followed.","As expected...","The next moment, Little Phoenix told Feng Wu, “A pair of eyes are staring at us from the old tree to the northeast.’","Feng Wu looked in that direction involuntarily.","Sensing Feng Wu’s gaze, Huyan Yichen looked in that direction as well.","He murmured to himself, “Wait, they’re still here.. Why are they still watching"]},{"number":3802,"title":"Chapter 3802: Northern Yan (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3802: Northern Yan (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu asked, “Do you know who they are?”","Huyan Yichen smiled. “Of course I do. They’re from the princess’s residence.”","An idea struck Feng Wu, but she feigned a confused look. “Why are the people of the princess’s residence here?”","Huyan Yichen gave it some thought and waved at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu moved closer curiously.","Huyan Yichen asked, “Do you really want to know?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.” Huyan Yichen said, “Since you’re that eager, I’ll tell you. Actually...”","“Huyan Yichen!”","A short distance away, the old man’s voice rang out again.","“Grandpa, I’m coming. You don’t have to rush me like this,” Huyan Yichen said grumpily. He then turned to Feng Wu. “Since you have nothing better to do, why don’t you come have some tea at my place?”","Feng Wu asked, “Am I disturbing you too much?”","Huyan Yichen waved his hand. “No, it’s not like that. My grandpa is the most hospitable person. It’s so rare to find such a lovely girl who knows nothing. You have to play with me. Come with me.”","Huyan Yichen led the way, and Feng Wu followed him with Little Phoenix.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and Little Phoenix exchanged looks. The two of them were communicating in their heads.","“This Huyan Yichen is an interesting character,” Little Phoenix said.","Feng Wu asked, ‘You saw it?”","Little Phoenix nodded. “He has the fire and metal attributes, and they’re very pure. He’s a great weapon refiner, but he’s still living here. It must have something to do with Yanbo.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is your little Yanbo really the best weapon refiner?”","Little Phoenix glanced at Feng Wu. “Of course not! That has to be your master! But little Yanbo was a metal cultivator back then, and he was quite good at forging weapons.","“Someone’s watching. I’ll sneak in tonight. If little Yanbo is there, I can ask him for the Primary Heaven Pill.”","Recalling that Little Phoenix hadn’t heard the conversation between the maids,","Feng Wu told it what had happened.","WHAT?!","Little Phoenix almost exploded.","“Little Yanbo is going to give that pill to that princess?!","“That can’t be! That pill is meant for you!","“Didn’t your master forbid you from refining your body? When the time comes, you’ll take the pill, which will make you better than other geniuses who have worked hard for decades.","“What princess? Are you kidding me?!”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”","Little Phoenix ran around in circles in the ring. “Has little Yanbo turned rogue?","He shouldn’t have. He was the most honest man back then. He was so quiet that he was easily bullied. All he ever did was forge weapons. Does he want to keep the pill for himself and give it to his offspring? I’m so mad!”","Seeing that Little Phoenix was so anxious that its eyes were bloodshot red, Feng Wu said, “It’s only a rumor, not the truth. Don’t worry. Princess Rao hasn’t obtained the pill yet.”","Little Phoenix said, “No, I’ll go have a look. I have to reason with Huyan","Yanbo!”","After that, Little Phoenix dashed off, despite Feng Wu’s intervention.","Feng Wu sighed in resignation.","She hoped that Little Phoenix was alright. She hoped that Senior Brother Huyan hadn’t changed.","“Kiddo, why are you sighing?”"]},{"number":3803,"title":"Chapter 3803: Stingy Shop (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3803: Stingy Shop (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hearing Feng Wu’s sigh, the teenager couldn’t help but laugh. “Do you find my shop too shabby?”","Feng Wu was woken up by Huyan Yichen’s voice. When she came back to herself, she saw that they were outside his shop.","“Singy Shop?”","Feng Wu looked back at Huyan Yichen and wanted to laugh. That name...","Huyan Yichen rolled his eyes at Feng Wu. “Laugh all you want. Don’t hold it back.”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Huyan Yichen shrugged. “I don’t know why the old master gave us that name. It sounds so petty, and it doesn’t mean well. My grandpa said that our patriarch came up with the name. I’m sure that’s not true.”","“What are you talking about?”","A slim, handsome old man strolled out of the shop. He glanced at Huyan Yichen, then glanced at Feng Wu out of the corner of his eye. He couldn’t help but glance at her again.","But that was it.","He wasn’t interested in her after that.","Huyan Yichen greeted Feng Wu warmly. “Come in and have a seat.”","His grandfather glanced at him. “Who’s that?”","Huyan Yichen gave the old man a warning glance.","The old man pulled Huyan Yichen to the side and whispered to him.","He frowned. “Can that scrawny girl do it?”","Huyan Yichen said, “Although she’s a scrawny girl, she looks full of vigor.","Maybe she’ll do.”","Old Huyan was still frowning.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was studying the shop with her hands behind her back.","In short, it was a blacksmith’s shop with all the necessary furnishings. Moreover, Feng Wu saw a few pieces of dark iron in a corner.","wait!","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","Just then, Huyan Yichen walked up to Feng Wu and saw that she was interested in the iron in the corner of the wall. He said grumpily, “These are just pieces of junk. It’ll be a shame to throw them away, but they won’t make anything useful. They’re useless.”","Feng Wu turned around and looked at Huyan Yichen in bewilderment.","The look gave Huyan Yichen the creeps. “Why are you looking at me like that?”","Feng Wu stared at Huyan Yichen again. “A piece of junk?”","Huyan Yichen nodded. “Of course it’s junk. If it really was dark iron, we would have used it to build weapons already. You know what? Although our shop is known as Stingy Shop, all the weapons we build are for influential people.","“Even the commander-in-chief of the empire’s military uses weapons that My grandfather made.”","Feng Wu glanced at Huyan Yichen, indicating that she didn’t believe him.","“Hey, why won’t you believe me? Our shop is one of the most famous shops in Northern Yan. Why won’t you believe me?”","Huyan Yichen caught up with her and saw that Feng Wu was staring at the pieces in the corner again. He was speechless. “You don’t know anything. Why are you staring at that junk?”","“Have you heard of Lord Timeless?” Huyan Yichen glanced at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu? had never heard of that title until a few days ago.","“Lord Timeless? You mean Gui Qulai?” Feng Wu asked indifferently.","“That’s right! It’s him! He’s the best swordsman in Northern Yan! We made his sword!”","Feng Wu frowned a little. “That’s a peak sage-level weapon, right?”","“You don’t say.” Huyan Yichen was elated to see that Feng Wu knew what it was. “I saw my grandpa make Strike One when I was little. Do you know how amazing our shop is now?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. “I missed the part where that’s my problem?”","Huyan Yichen grinned.","Feng Wu frowned. “What do you want?”","She saw the cunning smile on Huyan Yichen’s face.","Huyan Yichen didn’t answer Feng Wu’s question. Instead, he asked casually, “Now that you’ve mentioned it, may I ask where you’re from and what’s your name?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Is this a household register?”","Huyan Yichen was confused. “Miss, what’s that?”","Feng Wu waved her hand indifferently. “I’m only joking. It’s nothing. My surname is... Feng, as in the wind that blows through water without leaving a trace.”","“Feng isn’t a big surname in Northern Yan, but it’s a major surname in the Junwu Empire. Feng Xiangnan, the Northern Feng General, is a well-known figure in the Junwu Empire. I wonder if you’ve met him before?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Huyan Yichen was disappointed. “You have a point. The general is so superior, and I can tell that you’re just an ordinary girl. It’s only normal that you haven’t met him. As for Feng Xun, I’m sure you haven’t met him either.”","Feng Xun?","Feng Wu glanced at Huyan Yichen. “Feng Nun? As in the son of Northern Feng Mansion?","“You don’t say. That’s him! Feng Xun! Do you know him?” Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu thought, “You didn’t tell me if Feng Xun is your friend or an enemy. How am I supposed to know if I know him?”","Hence, Feng Wu didn’t answer.","The silence was the best answer.","As expected, Huyan Yichen thought that Feng Wu didn’t know who that was. He snorted. “He set me up a long time ago, and I haven’t had a chance to make trouble for him yet!”","Feng Wu was glad that she didn’t reveal her relationship to Feng Xun.","She wiped away her cold sweat and smiled at Huyan Yichen. “He tricked you? What did he do?”","For as long as Feng Wu could remember, Feng Xun had been driven mad by Jun Linyuan and her, but she had never seen him setting anyone up.","Huyan Yichen snorted. “See those pieces of scrap metal in the corner? He sold them to me! He said they were sacred iron and could make a top-grade sacred weapon! I thought I could make another sword like Strike on, so of course I bought them!","“And with the iron, he gave me a drawing, saying that I could build a sacred-level Arm of Commandment. I believed him then!","“Do you know how much I paid for it?”","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","“A million! I spent a million Yan coins to get back from someone else. I thought I could forge the arm, but I...","“I only realized later that the iron was fake! There was only a layer of dark iron on the outside, but it was fake on the inside!”","Huyan Yichen was so frustrated that he almost stomped his foot.","Feng Wu glanced at him. The fact that he was still so angry showed how much he hated Feng Xun.","“When did it happen?” Feng Wu asked curiously. Huyan Yi said, “When we were ten!”","Feng Wu was speechless. It had been years.","However, ten years ago, Huyan Yichen was able to make a deal with Feng Xun, and he was the buyer..."]},{"number":3804,"title":"Chapter 3804: Stingy Shop (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3804: Stingy Shop (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, Huyan Yichen was able to make a deal with Feng Xun ten years ago, not to mention that he was Feng Xun’s buyer. That was proof enough of Huyan Yichen’s background.","That made sense. Not everyone could address Huyan Yanbo as their patriarch.","Huyan Yichen was still angry. He led Feng Wu to the pile of stones and said grumpily, “Look, look at these pieces of junk. Do you know why I kept them here instead of throwing them away?","“You can’t bring yourself to part with them?” Feng Wu tried to provoke him.","“Of course not!” The teenager stomped his foot in frustration. “I want them to stay here and remind me all the time that I have to get back at Feng Xun! I want to wash away my humiliation in front of my brothers!”","Feng Wu admired him for his pride.","Huyan Yichen smacked his forehead. “Hey, why am I telling you that? Enough with the junk. We have more serious matters at hand.”","Feng Wu was confused. “What do you mean?”","Huyan Yichen scratched his head and grinned. “How about you donate something?”","Feng Wu asked, ‘What?”","Huyan Yichen spread out his hands. “It’s not much. Just a little blood will do... Just give me a little blood.”","Feng Wu stared at him. “Why do you need it?”","Huyan Yichen led Feng Wu to an iron table and said, “This is my new weapon, the Ultimate Yang Fork. Look, it’s a Semi-saint weapon!”","Feng Wu said, “So what?”","Huyan Yichen said obsequiously, ‘You look so young. I bet you don’t know anything.”","Feng Wu knew that such a supreme-grade weapon had to be nourished with human blood, especially the blood of an innocent girl.","Feng Wu shook her head. “No.”","Huyan Yichen was confused. “Why not? I don’t need much. Just a bowl will do.” But Feng Wu wouldn’t let him.","Her blood was the Divine Phoenix Blood, and every drop was precious, let alone a bowl.","Feng Wu wouldn’t mind if it was a divine weapon, but Huyan Yichen’s weapon was obviously a Semi-saint one.","Feng Wu shook her head again. “Not with this weapon.”","Huyan Yichen pleaded with Feng Wu. “Gosh, please! Please! Where else am I going to find a girl with such clean eyes?”","Feng Wu glanced at Huyan Yichen. “No.”","Huyan Yichen said, “What do I have to do to make you say yes?”","Feng Wu? glanced at him. “You’re much more capable than I am. If you want my blood, you can force me. Why don’t you do that?”","Huyan Yichen said grumpily, “I’m not in the habit of forcing myself on other people! Plus, you don’t have the Divine Phoenix Blood. If it’s the legendary Divine Phoenix Blood of the Junwu Empire, I might actually force you to give it to me.”","Feng Wu stared at him. “You really will do that?”","Huyan Yichen smiled bitterly. “The Divine Phoenix Blood is the best bloodline in the world. Although my Ultimate Yang Fork is good, it’s only a Saint-level one. It’ll be such a waste if I use the Divine Phoenix Blood on it. I’ll kill myself if I do that. No, I won’t try to take the Divine Phoenix Blood by force.”","Huyan Yichen heaved a long sigh. “But I’m still curious. What will happen if I add the Divine Phoenix Blood? I can’t wait to see it.’","The Divine Phoenix Blood was equivalent to Feng Wu herself. Therefore, if Feng Wu contributed her blood, her identity would become very obvious.."]},{"number":3805,"title":"Chapter 3805: Stingy Shop (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3805: Stingy Shop (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","While Feng Wu was hesitating, Huyan Yichen wouldn’t let go of her. “You don’t have the Divine Phoenix Blood. Just give me a bowl, will you? Please!” Feng Wu, who was several years younger than Huyan Yichen, said coldly, “No.”","“Tch!” Huyan Yichen glanced at Feng Wu. “It’s just a little blood. Don’t be so pretentious.”","Feng Wu said, “Try take it from me. I dare you.”","Huyan Yichen said, “I would never do such a thing! Hmph!”","He stormed off after that.","Before Huyan Yichen left, Feng Wu asked, “Can you sell me the fake iron in this corner?”","Huyan Yichen waved his hand. “Take them all!”","After that, he was out of sight.","Hearing Huyan Yichen’s words, Feng Wu went straight to the pile of iron.","She crouched down and studied the iron. Every now and then, she would pick up a piece, examine it carefully in the sunlight, and smile a little as if she was looking for a bargain.","Huyan Yichen went out, but the old man didn’t. Seeing Feng Wu’s reaction, he frowned and was curious.","“Kiddo, what are you doing?” He couldn’t help but ask.","Staring at the iron, Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “One of them is real and can be used to forge an arm of discipline.” Pffft!","Old Huyan almost burst out laughing.","He didn’t think much of it, but the girl was so good at bragging.","Seeing that Feng Wu was going to elaborate, Old Huyan waved her off. “Go back to what you were doing. I’m off to work.”","After that, he walked up to his workshop and started forging.","Feng Wu had noticed the weapon he was forging.","It was a Flaming Spear made from Semi-divine materials, but it was only a weapon of the Saint-level.","“What a pity,” thought Feng Wu.","Feng Wu thought, “If I have it, I’ll have a 90% chance of refining a Semi-divine","weapon.”","Seeing that was sighing, Old Huyan gave her a suspicious look. As he pounded the refined iron, he asked Feng Wu, “Kiddo, why are you sighing?”","Feng Wu was worried that Huyan would destroy the weapon, so she said, “If you can plant an explosive flame on it, it’ll become a Semi-divine weapon.” Huyan glanced at Feng Wu and shook his head.","“What do you know? Don’t make me laugh.” Old Huyan pursed his lips. “How are you going to inject that flame? It’s impossible.”","Feng Wu said, “Shall I give it a go?”","Old Huyan turned her down. “You know nothing. You can’t even pick up this hammer. Don’t bite off more than you can chew.” Feng Wu looked at him. “Are you sure?”","Old Huyan shook his head.","Feng Wu said, “Your Flaming Spear is made from very rare materials. If you don’t try it now, you won’t have a chance to change it after you make it into a sacred weapon.”","“Why, little girl, you know that the Flaming Spear is a sacred-level weapon.”","Old Huyan couldn’t help but give her another look.","Before Feng Wu could say anything, a voice came from outside.","“She can’t tell a saint from sacred weapons. Grandpa, I told her that you’ve made Gui Qulai’s sword, and it’s a Saint-level one. That’s why she thinks that you can make a Saint-level one every time..”"]},{"number":3806,"title":"Chapter 3806: Stingy Shop (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3806: Stingy Shop (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Old Huyan guffawed.","This girl was so...","He almost believed her.","Feng Wu was speechless...","She was really good at refining weapons. Although she didn’t have many opportunities to do it herself, she had a solid theoretical base.","Since that was the case, Feng Wu didn’t try to retort. She shrugged and said,","“As long as you don’t regret it.”","Huyan Yichen chuckled. “You’re so funny. You sound like an adult.”","Feng Wu shrugged.","“Well, I’ve finally found some blood. I don’t need to beg you anymore. Hmph.”","Huyan Yichen made a face at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu ignored him.","Both Huyan Yichen and the old man were busy with their own tasks.","One was a semi-Saint-level fork.","The other one was a Saint-level Flaming Spear.","Feng Wu looked at the piece of junk in the corner again...","Huyan Yichen glanced at Feng Wu. “You like it that much? If that’s the case, why don’t you play with it?”","Feng Wu said, “Isn’t it your reminder? Are you sure you don’t want it?”","Blue veins popped on Huyan Yichen’s forehead, and he snorted. “I don’t want to talk to you anymore!”","Feng Wu chuckled.","Since Huyan Yichen didn’t take up the worktable, Feng Wu picked up the three pieces and started working on them in the stove.","Seeing the serious look on her face, Huyan Yichen could only shake his head with a wry smile.","Refining weapons was a subject that depended on one’s talent as well as qualifications. The girl didn’t seem to have any talent or qualifications, but Huyan Yichen decided that he would let her do whatever she wanted and treat her as if she were playing with mud.","Feng Wu didn’t want to expose her spiritual essence before she met her Senior Brother Huyan. However, she needed to use the arm of discipline now to protect herself.","Huyan Yichen, who was gloating over the semi-Saint weapon he had just made, darted a glance at Feng Wu before showing off in front of the old man. “Grandpa, Grandpa, what do you think of my Ultimate Yang Fork?”","Old Huyan gave him an appreciative look.","His grandson was already able to forge a semi-Saint-level weapon at such a young age. With his capability, he would be able to work on half of the tasks in the shop. Even if the old man died now, he would be able to rest in peace.","However, despite his comfort, he still put on a straight face and said indifferently, “It’s alright, but you’ll have to work harder! At your age, your Patriarch can already refine a Saint-level weapon, but you’ve only managed to refine a semi-Stain one by sheer luck. You’re still too far behind him. Got it?”","Huyan Yichen nodded humbly.","He didn’t get to gloat for long.","He felt a little lost and disappointed.","Just then, Feng Wu beckoned at Huyan Yichen. “Hey, come over here.” Huyan Yichen walked up to her and asked grumpily, “What?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll teach you how to forge a Semi-divine weapon.”","Gosh...","Huyan Yichen gave Feng Wu a “you idiot” look.","Feng Wu said seriously, “I’m not joking.”","Huyan Yichen was speechless.","Feng Wu said, “Help me with the forging. You’ll see.”","Huyan Yichen felt a headache coming on. He decided that she wouldn’t turn back until she ran into the wall. He would see how she was going to do it.","After that, Huyan Yichen was ordered around by Feng Wu.","She would make him add iron powder, set up an explosion, and cool things down..."]},{"number":3807,"title":"Chapter 3807: Stingy Shop (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3807: Stingy Shop (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huyan Yichen almost lost his temper.","Why was it so troublesome?","However, when he recalled how the girl had introduced herself as a poor girl who had fled from the south, his heart softened.","“Forget it. She was so unlucky. I’ll help her as my good deeds of the day,” thought Huyan Yichen to himself.","But...","Before long, Huyan Yichen’s eyes widened when he saw what he had made out of three pieces of scrap iron.","“What... what’s that?”","After the girl’s random instructions, Huyan Yichen realized that the iron he made wasn’t dark iron.","“What’s that?”","Huyan Yichen touched it and saw that it was made from a special material that shone with a divine light.","“It’s so tough! Am I seeing things?”","Huyan Yichen rubbed his eyes in disbelief, but when he looked again, the iron was still there. He reached out and touched it, but the hardness didn’t change.","As a weapon refiner, he knew what that meant.","He gave Feng Wu a strange look and didn’t come back to himself for a long time.","How was that possible... It was supposed to be a pile of junk. But no matter how hard he tried, it stayed useless. How...","“You... you made it by sheer luck, didn’t you?” Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu and murmured.","Feng Wu asked, “What was that?”","Huyan Yichen said, “N- nothing...”","Was it luck? It had to be!","Otherwise, how could a girl know weapon-refining? He was from an influential family of refiners, and his grandfather used to be taught by the Patriarch...","Although Huyan Yichen had always been humble, he was actually quite influential in Northern Yan.","He didn’t understand the girl at all.","Just then, Feng Wu looked up and asked, “Where’s that drawing?” Huyan Yichen asked involuntarily, “What drawing?","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t Feng Xun give you the material to build an arm of discipline? Where’s the drawing?”","Huyan Yichen’s face went scarlet red. “He lied to me...”","Feng Wu frowned before Huyan Yichen could finish. “You didn’t lose the drawing, did you?”","Huyan Yichen said, “That drawing was fake! My grandpa appraised it himself!”","Feng Wu said, “So?”","Huyan Yichen gritted his teeth. “Just wait and see!”","He wanted to see what the girl was going to do.","Huyan Yichen rushed into the room, came back with a small brocade box, and tossed it to Feng Wu. “See for yourself.”","Feng Wu opened the brocade box to find a drawing inside.","She took it out and read it carefully.","Huyan Yichen said grumpily, “It’s fake, isn’t it? I told you so! Thar Feng Xun, hmph! If he dares to come to Northern Yan again, I’ll make him pay!”","Feng Wu gave Huyan Yichen a strange look.","Huyan Yichen said, “What? He stole my pocket money for ten years. Why can’t I scold him?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “You can’t.”","Huyan Yichen asked, “Why?”","Feng Wu didn’t reply. Instead, she asked, ‘What do you want?”","Huyan Yichen said, “What?”","Feng Wu said, “How about I give you a copy of ‘Refinable Metal Synthesis’?”","Huyan Yichen said, “What?! Isn’t that the legendary book?”","He had heard the title of the book, but he had no idea what it was about.."]},{"number":3808,"title":"Chapter 3808: Refinable Metal Synthesis","paragraphs":["Chapter 3808: Refinable Metal Synthesis","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu asked in a serious tone, “Will a copy of ‘Refinable Metal Synthesis’ be enough to exchange for the metal I just made and the drawing of this arm?” Of course! Huyan Yichen was so excited that he almost burst into tears.","“But... but how can you have it?” Huyan Yichen wouldn’t believe it.","Feng Wu said, “I just do.”","Huyan Yichen said, “If you have it, I’ll trade with you!”","Feng Wu said, “It’s a deal.”","Huyan Yichen was thrilled.","“Silly boy.” A short distance away, Old Huyan shook his head when he heard their conversation.","Spiritual iron? “Refinable Metal Synthesis”? How childish.","As Patriarch Huyan’s outer sect disciple, the old man had only heard about the “refinable metal synthesis” that all refiners dreamed of learning. However, the girl had just given his grandson a “refinable metal synthesis” as a gift. It was like child’s play!","“Grandpa! Grandpa!”","Only then did Huyan Yichen come back to himself. He waved at the old man and said, “Grandpa, she really has forged the divine iron!”","Old Huyan wouldn’t come over. He was still humming a tune and working on his Flaming Spear. He didn’t believe Huyan Yichen at all.","Huyan Yichen was about to drag his grandfather to his side when Feng Wu began to separate the drawing with a special liquid.","It immediately caught his attention.","“What are you doing?” Huyan Yichen moved closer and watched Feng Wu curiously.","Feng Wu was careful but steady.","Before long, Huyan Yichen saw that the edge of the fake drawing had been peeled off.","WHAT?!","Huyan Yichen’s eyes widened when he saw this.","Because he saw that the edge of the drawing had split open from the edges...","There were two drawings!","They were stuck together with a special potion?!","Huyan Yichen held his breath, fearing that he might blow the drawing away. His heart was pounding, and he had a feeling that something big was going to happen.","That was indeed the case.","Feng Wu separated the drawings in less than 15 minutes. Right now, two drawings are sitting quietly on the table.","One was what Huyan Yichen called a fake drawing, and the other one was a brand -new one.","Huyan Yichen didn’t look at the drawing he had been looking at for nearly ten years. Instead, he focused on the new one, and his eyes narrowed as he studied it.","“Let’s begin,” Feng Wu told Huyan Yichen.","Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu. “You mean...”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “The one underneath is the real drawing of the arm of discipline, isn’t it?”","Wasn’t it?","Huyan Yichen wanted to agree with her, but...","“There’s another one underneath... How can there be another one? I haven’t heard of it after all these years!” Scratching his head, Huyan Yichen burst into tears.","Feng Wu smiled. “The person who made this drawing used a deceptive trick. Ordinary people won’t be able to find it even if they stare at it for a hundred years. There’s no need to blame yourself.”","Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu in frustration. “So, I’m just an ordinary person?”","Feng Wu asked, “What do you think?”"]},{"number":3809,"title":"Chapter 3809: The Arm of Discipline (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3809: The Arm of Discipline (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huyan Yichen was frustrated.","He shook his head repeatedly. “I don’t believe it. I don’t believe it’s the drawing of the arm...”","Feng Wu couldn’t care less about his mood and began to order him around.","Huyan Yichen said, “I don’t believe that this drawing can be used to build the arm.”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","However, Huyan Yichen was genuinely curious. Could she really make the arm of discipline?","In the end, he couldn’t fight back his curiosity and started working on it for Feng Wu.","With Feng Wu around, he didn’t have to worry about not doing a good job.","Because if she didn’t do it right, Feng Wu would smack down with the ruler.","“Ouch! That hurts! Why did you hit me?” Huyan Yichen gave Feng Wu a pleading look.","Feng Wu said solemnly, “You’ll thank me in the future. Keep going!”","Feng Wu was very strict, but Huyan Yichen was still a little inferior in his cultivation level, so he was having a hard time. He had to follow Feng Wu’s instructions every single time before he could move on to the next step.","Maybe not for the time being, but in the future, Huyan Yichen would be so grateful to Feng Wu that he would almost kneel down.","Feng Wu had Huyan Yichen build one component after another.","Huyan Yichen didn’t see any hope and was frustrated.","A few days later, Huyan Yichen finally met all Feng Wu’s requirements. He stuck out his tongue and was exhausted.","“I’m exhausted.” Huyan Yichen let out a breath of relief. “You’ve made everything you need, haven’t you? Is that enough?”","Huyan Yichen gave Feng Wu an aggrieved look.","Feng Wu had been giving him pointers over and over again in the past few days, and Huyan Yichen wasn’t an idiot. On the contrary, he was a very talented refiner and had long seen through Feng Wu.","She couldn’t have done it by accident but had to be someone with real talent.","At that thought, Huyan Yichen couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu. The girl was so young, but she was already so capable. That couldn’t be...","Huyan Yichen looked at the iron platform again. If these parts were put together...","Under Huyan Yichen’s gaze, Feng Wu began to combine the parts.","Just then, old Huyan finally finished working on his Flaming Spear and wrapped up.","He carefully examined the sacred weapon he had made himself.","It was the second sacred weapon of his life, and the first one was without a doubt Strike One.","Old Huyan thought that if other people knew that he had such a sacred weapon, many masters would come to him for it. The more he thought about it, the more pleased he became.","He glanced over in passing and saw that Huyan Yichen was still standing there, so he walked up to him.","Old Huyan was about to scold his grandson when he saw Feng Wu assembling some spare parts.","This girl’s hands were so steady!","She was as good as a refiner at his level!","Old Huyan was about to say something when he saw the spare parts in Feng Wu’s hands.","He wasn’t looking at how the parts were put together, but what they were made of!","“Is that divine iron?” Huyan’s eyes lit up.","Huyan Yichen nudged him. “Grandpa, stay out of my way.”","He moved closer to Feng Wu as he spoke, fearing that he would miss a single step.","He had a feeling that if he missed this chance, he would regret it for the rest of his life.."]},{"number":3810,"title":"Chapter 3810: The Arm of Discipline (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3810: The Arm of Discipline (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","All old Huyan could think of was the metal.","“Divine iron? Where did that come from?!” He murmured to himself. Huyan Yichen said grumpily, “That was days ago. Didn’t you notice?”","Old Huyan didn’t notice it because all his attention was on his Flame Spear.","At that thought, old Huyan snorted. “My task is a big deal. I don’t have time for kids’ stuff like this.”","After that, he turned to leave.","Huyan Yichen couldn’t help but ask, “Grandpa, are you done?” “Of course!” Old Huyan had always been very confident in his skills.","“A Saint-level one?” Huyan Yichen asked curiously.","“Of course.” Old Huyan raised his chin and waited for his grandson’s praise.","But...","His grandson changed the subject.","He took old Huyan’s hand and led him to Feng Wu’s side. “Grandpa, what level is this arm?”","“An arm of discipline?” Old Huyan frowned. “No ordinary refiner can make it. Plus, your drawing was fake. I told you already. Apart from your Patriarch, no one else can make an arm of discipline...”","However, before he could finish, he heard a calm voice.","“Done.”","By then, Feng Wu had finished assembling all the parts.","It was slightly bigger than a human arm and had a metallic sheen to it. It reminded one of the fangs of a ferocious beast, which could take a person’s life at any moment.","“Is it the arm of discipline?” Old Huyan shook his head. “I think it’s just an ordinary arm booster. The real one isn’t like this...”","“What does it look like then?”","Huyan Yichen asked curiously before Feng Wu could say anything.","As a matter of fact, Huyan had only heard about it before but hadn’t seen it in person. Therefore, he didn’t know what to say.","“Grandpa, look at this drawing. It’s exactly like this.” Huyan Yichen handed the real drawing to the old man.","“Wait a minute!”","Huyan’s eyes widened when he saw the drawing. He couldn’t hide the excitement in his voice. ‘Where did you get it? Why is it here?”","Huyan Yichen asked, “Grandpa, is it real?”","Old Man Huyan murmured, “I think it’s real if I’m not mistaken. Look at the curve, the tenacity, and the sharpness... But how is it possible for anyone to build something like this?”","“But Grandpa, we’ve made it already.” Huyan Yichen looked at the old man. “I made them myself.”","“Bullshit!” Old Huyan wouldn’t believe it. “I know perfectly well what you’re capable of! You can’t possibly build something like that! Even I can’t do it!”","Huyan Yichen was almost in tears. “It’s true, Grandpa. I really made it myself. Miss Feng taught me herself.”","Old Huyan looked at Feng Wu suspiciously and asked, “Kiddo, is that true?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Old Huyan said, “Can you show me the arm?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Didn’t you say it wasn’t real?”","Old Huyan cleared his throat.."]},{"number":3811,"title":"Chapter 3811: The Arm of Discipline (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3811: The Arm of Discipline (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He hadn’t checked it yet, so of course he didn’t know if it was real...","But the arm was definitely made of divine iron.","Feng Wu put the arm on.","Once she put it on, her right arm seemed to have become a robotic one, which looked rather out of place.","Just then, Feng Wu frowned.","Because she felt the arm “bite” her.","She could feel a “bite” on her wrist, and blood was oozing out of it.","Huyan had been watching the arm the whole time, so he didn’t notice the look on Feng Wu’s face, nor did he know that the arm was absorbing the blood.","“I think it’s a Saint-level weapon.” Old Huyan looked amazed. “I can’t believe that the two of you can build a Saint-level weapon right under my nose. That’s so...”","He didn’t know what to say.","He considered himself to be very talented in the metal element, but at his age, he could only make two Saint-level weapons. How could these two kids make one already?","Feng Wu didn’t move and let the arm suck her blood.","She vented her sarcasm inwardly. She had the Divine Phoenix Blood and hoped the arm wouldn’t go too far. That was enough.","After a while, Feng Wu could no longer feel the pain. The arm had probably absorbed enough blood.","“Wait, that gloss... that quality...”","Old Huyan’s eyes lit up. ‘Why do I feel that the arm is more than a Saint-level one?”","But he didn’t say it aloud because it was impossible.","Even he had to exceed his capability to make two Saint-level weapons in his lifetime. How could these two kids possibly make something more advanced than that? There was no doubt about it.","Just then, Feng Wu activated her arm.","With a whoosh, the fist of the arm smashed into the iron table.","Rumble!","The meter-thick iron platform was smashed into a lump of iron by the arm.","Old Huyan stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","“That’s...” Huyan Yichen swallowed and stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “I thought you didn’t have any spiritual essence.”","Huyan Yichen hadn’t sensed any spiritual essence from Feng Wu so far, which was why he had assumed that she didn’t know anything about cultivation. However, what she did just then...","Feng Wu was pleasantly surprised.","The arm was more powerful than she had expected, and it had to be at least a Semi-divine weapon!","Feng Wu glanced at Huyan Yichen. “One can’t attack without spiritual essence? You’re so ignorant.”","Huyan Yichen glanced at his dumbfounded grandfather, then turned to Feng Wu eagerly. “Can I see it? Can I?”","Feng Wu took off the arm and handed it to Huyan Yichen. “It’ll fit you automatically when you put it on. Try it.”","The arm wasn’t an inanimate object, but a living one because of the divine","metal.","Huyan Yichen was pleasantly surprised. He had put it on!","“I’ll test its power!” Huyan Yichen shouted. “Iron Tower, come out!”","As soon as Huyan Yichen said those words, a figure as tall as an iron tower appeared.."]},{"number":3812,"title":"Chapter 3812: Flaming Arm (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3812: Flaming Arm (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","As soon as Huyan Yichen said those words, a figure as tall as an iron tower appeared.","Feng Wu looked over and saw that the person was three meters tall. He had bulging muscles and looked very strong.","“Bring it on!”","Huyan Yichen aimed his arm at the man.","Iron Tower smirked.","To him, his young master was as weak as a chicken. He could pick the boy up without breaking a sweat...","That was what he thought and what he did.","Therefore, he only waved his hand as if he was playing a game.","However, the next moment!","“Ssss!”","Iron Tower drew in his breath, for his young master’s right arm was very tough, and a sharp blade suddenly appeared in his palm.","The sharp blade stabbed into the back of Iron Tower’s hand.","However, Iron Tower had a very strong defense system. The blade was only able to make an inch in before it was stopped.","Even so, it was enough to attract his attention.","“Young Master, that’s an interesting arm.”","Despite his words, Ta Tie didn’t think much of the arm.","Huyan Yichen relied on his speed in battles, so he moved as fast as he could. He was changing directions all the time.","The arm of discipline was also making unpredictable moves with his right arm.","Several times, Iron Tower was hit. He was covered with wounds, but they were all minor ones.","Iron Tower looked at Huyan Yichen and said, “Young Master, I don’t want to play games anymore.”","The next second, he expanded.","He was already three meters tall, but now, he was even bigger.","He kicked Huyan Yichen away.","Huyan Yichen fell to the ground with a thump.","He couldn’t accept the fact that he still couldn’t defeat Iron Tower.","“Young Master, please give in,” Iron Tower said indifferently.","Huyan Yichen gritted his teeth. “No! I’m going to defeat you! I can only defeat him if I defeat you!”","Iron Tower frowned. “Young Master, you can’t even defeat me, let alone your enemy. Just stay here.”","He turned to leave after that.","Feng Wu was confused. Huyan Yichen had to defeat Iron Tower to defeat his enemy? Who was his enemy?","Seeing the pained look on Huyan Yichen’s face, Feng Wu went up to him and reminded him in a low voice. Huyan Yichen’s eyes lit up.","“Stop right there! I’ll try again!” Huyan Yichen shouted at Iron Tower.","However...","Iron Tower didn’t even look back.","“Stop right there!” Huyan Yichen suddenly aimed at Iron Tower, and a black arrow flew out of his arm, aiming at the latter’s back. Iron Tower turned around and caught the arrow with one hand.","To his surprise, the next second...","The arrow exploded.","There was an unknown liquid in the arrow, and it was highly inflammable!","The liquid splashed all over him.","The next second, flames rose out of Iron Tower and engulfed him.","“Ah!” He buried his head in his hands and didn’t know what to do.","“Iron Tower, Iron Tower...” Huyan Yichen was equally anxious.","Iron Tower was his guard, not his enemy. He had been too reckless.."]},{"number":3813,"title":"Chapter 3813: Flaming Arm (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3813: Flaming Arm (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Young Master, I give in... Help me...”","Iron Tower was almost in tears.","Huyan Yichen rushed over to put out the fire for him.","After the fire was put out, Huyan Yichen saw Iron Tower had been charred black.","Huyan Yichen said guiltily, “Iron Tower...”","Iron Tower waved his hand and wiped his face, but he wasn’t injured. After all, he was very well-defended.","“I’m fine, I’m fine...” Iron Tower waved his hands, still shaken from the explosion. He almost peed his pants.","Seeing that Iron Tower was alright, Huyan Yichen sat down on the ground and let out a breath of relief. “I almost peed my pants, too...”","After that, they both looked at Feng Wu.","Although Iron Tower had been staying outside for the past few days, he knew perfectly well that the girl had been instructing his young master on how to build everything. Whenever his master’s work didn’t meet her standards, she would strike him repeatedly with a stick. Several times, Iron Tower almost couldn’t control himself anymore.","Huyan Yichen rose to his feet and slowly walked up to Feng Wu. His eyes were filled with astonishment and pleasant surprise. “Iron Tower and I are two levels apart. I thought I wouldn’t be his match no matter what, but...”","If Huyan Yichen wanted to kill Iron Tower, he had a million ways to do it when the man was on fire.","Feng Wu stared at the arm of discipline.","“That arm is an incredible weapon!” Huyan Yichen’s eyes twinkled as he looked at his right arm.","By then, Old Master Huyan had taken a step forward, and all his attention was on the arm.","“Take it off. Let me have a closer look,” the old man told Huyan Yichen.","Huyan Yichen didn’t want to, but he took it off in the end.","Huyan couldn’t keep his hands off it. As he studied it, he murmured, “This is so much better than the Saint-level one I made before.”","Huyan Yichen asked curiously, “Grandpa, what level is this weapon? Is it really much better than a Saint-level one? But a Saint-level weapon is already very rare. Even Strike One is only a Saint-level weapon. We’ve never seen a divine weapon before.”","“It’s not a divine weapon yet but only a Semi-divine one,” said old Huyan. “The one Princess Rao has is a Semi-divine one.”","Huyan Yichen cried out, “Princess Rao thinks very highly of that thing. It’s as good as her own life.”","Old Huyan kept his gaze on the arm and didn’t say another word.","Seeing that the old man was absorbed in his study, Feng Wu didn’t disturb him.","Just then, Huyan Yichen finally looked at Feng Wu.","“Kiddo, you’re amazing.” Huyan Yichen smiled so broadly that his eyes couldn’t be seen. He was so enthusiastic that he immediately went up to Feng Wu and poured her some tea.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “You don’t doubt my ability anymore?” Huyan Yichen said, “Gosh, you’re a semi-divine weapon refiner! You’re","”","amazing’.","He gave Feng Wu a thumbs-up as he spoke.","“Well...” Huyan Yichen nudged Feng Wu with his elbow and stammered.","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Huyan Yichen said, “Since the arm is so useful, why don’t we work together and make a few more of them? It’ll sell like hotcakes! Shall we split the profit","50 — 50"]},{"number":3814,"title":"Chapter 3814: 50-50","paragraphs":["Chapter 3814: 50-50","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Shall we split the profit 50-50?” Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu in excitement.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him and turned to leave.","Huyan Yichen immediately caught up with her. “Hey, don’t leave even if you don’t agree to that offer. Alright, no 50-50. How about 60-40?”","But Feng Wu didn’t stop.","Huyan Yichen said, “70-30! That’s the lowest I’ll go! I’ll take 30% and you take 70%! That’s very generous of me!”","Feng Wu glanced at him.","Huyan Yichen stumbled back. “Why are you looking at me like that?” He felt a little flustered.","Feng Wu finally said, “That’s impossible.”","Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu stubbornly. “Then tell me. How do you want to split the profit?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “That’s the only one.”","Huyan Yichen was shocked. “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Feng Wu said, “You heard me.”","Huyan Yichen said, “Why are there only...”","Feng Wu asked indifferently, “Do you have any more of that iron?”","Huyan Yichen said, “I...”","He realized that Feng Xun was the one who had set him up with those pieces of junk. He had left them in a corner to remind himself of his revenge. Who would have thought that they could be used to forge a piece of divine iron!","Feng Wu shrugged. “I forgot to mention that the value of the metal can’t be measured by money. There’s only a handful of them in this world. I’ll build one for you when you find more of it.” She had the blueprint anyway.","Huyan Yichen said, “But...’","He had wanted to make a small fortune with it, but as it turned out, he didn’t even have an arm to use himself.","“Well, then...” Huyan Yichen followed her and asked gingerly, “Are you selling this arm?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Aren’t you going to take it?”","Huyan Yichen threw a dirty look at Feng Wu. “Of course not! Haven’t we made a deal already? We’ve signed the agreement, so why should I take it? But I really like this arm...","Feng Wu said, “Me, too.”","Huyan Yichen could only smile bitterly. “A gentleman shouldn’t take other people’s favorite. If the arm is yours, it’s yours. No one can take it away, not even me. But don’t worry. I’ll work hard to find more divine iron! You’ll build a new one for me when I find it!”","Feng Wu said, “Alright.”","Huyan Yichen sighed with emotion. “You’re amazing. I didn’t know you could build something like this...","“Grandpa, is it really a Semi-divine weapon?” Huyan Yichen still couldn’t believe it.","Old Huyan was too absorbed in the weapon to pay any attention to Huyan","Yichen.","That was why Huyan Yichen knew that it had to be a Semi-divine weapon. Otherwise, his grandfather wouldn’t have been so excited because he had made two Saint-level weapons himself.","“You’re amazing!” Patting Feng Wu on the shoulder, Huyan Yichen said in amazement, “Grandpa has been saying that I’m a natural refiner and that I’ll be even more amazing in the future, but compared to you...” Huyan Yichen was ashamed of his own inferiority.","However...","Huyan Yichen patted Feng Wu on the shoulder again. “But luck is fair. It won’t favor a person. If it opens a door for you, it’ll close the window.”","Feng Wu was confused. “What do you mean?”","Why didn’t she understand?","Huyan Yichen grinned. “You don’t know how to cultivate. It’s like God has closed the window for you..”"]},{"number":3815,"title":"Chapter 3815: Huyan Hongjun","paragraphs":["Chapter 3815: Huyan Hongjun","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu gave him another strange look without saying a word.","Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu. “What do you want to say?”","Feng Wu said, “You’ll see.”","Huyan Yichen wondered if he had missed something.”","Feng Wu only smiled at him without saying a word.","Just then, they heard footsteps outside.","“Who’s here?” Hearing the knock on the door, Huyan Yichen frowned and told Iron Tower, “Go have a look.”","Iron Tower soon came back with a few people.","The leader was a pretty teenage girl. She had long, slender eyebrows that reminded one of a fox in the mountains. She was alluring and enchanting, but the lower half of her face was very innocent. Together, they formed an enchanting and pure face that was both unforgettable and attractive.","The girl held a white fox in her arms. Her face was ghastly pale, and she seemed to be very weak. Wrapped in a thick cape, she looked even smaller and more endearing.","She had two maids with her, and Feng Wu knew them.","They were Caixia and Muli, whom she had met on the way here.","Without a doubt, she was the legendary Princess Rao.","Something flickered in Feng Wu’s lowered eyes.","Princess Rao, who had tried to kill Feng Wu before meeting her, was finally here. Feng Wu made up her mind that she would never forgive those who tried to kill her.","A younger teenager stood next to the girl. Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen was exchanging angry looks with the teenager.","“Huyan Hongjun, how dare you come here?!” Huyan Yichen glared at him.","Old Huyan finally woke up from his reverie and threw a dirty look at Huyan","Yichen. “Watch your language with His Royal Highness!”","A prince? Feng Wu thought to herself. It was said that the third prince and Princess Rao had the same mother. However, the third prince was a misbehaving man with a vile conduct, which gave the emperor a headache. Therefore, the right to inherit the throne was between Princess Rao and the eldest prince, and the third prince wasn’t an option.","Seeing the animosity between Huyan Yichen and the third prince, Feng Wu knew that there was something between the two of them.","Princess Rao waved her hand and said casually, “Hongjun, come back.”","The third prince gave Huyan Yichen an arrogant glance, snorted, and went to Princess Rao’s side.","Princess Rao walked up to Huyan Yichen, sat down on a chair, and cut to the chase. “Have you seen anyone suspicious these days?”","The two maids had made sure that everything was in order. Chairs had been brought out to be wiped clean, and even tea had been prepared.","Feng Wu noticed that Huyan Yichen didn’t like Princess Rao because he frowned and said impatiently, “What suspicious person? And why should I answer your question?”","Before Princess Rao could say anything, the third prince smirked. “Huyan Yichen, who the hell do you think you are? How dare you talk to my sister like that?! Your family is such a distant relative that we can barely be considered to be related! ”","Huyan Yichen looked as if he couldn’t be bothered to talk to the third prince. He frowned at Princess Rao and said, “Ask your question and leave. You know perfectly well that you’re not welcome here.”","Feng Wu was bewildered.. Huyan Yichen was supposed to be a warm, hospitable teenager, but now..."]},{"number":3816,"title":"Chapter 3816: What Happened Back Then","paragraphs":["Chapter 3816: What Happened Back Then","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was perplexed. Huyan Yichen was supposed to be a warm, hospitable teenager, but now, he was obviously very hostile toward Princess Rao and her brother.","Princess Rao only smiled. “Brother Yichen, please don’t mind him. He’s just a kid with a bad temper. You’re older than him. Please be more patient.”","Huyan Yichen smirked. A kid? More like a cannibal! He didn’t reply and only stared at Princess Rao.","Princess Rao asked, “Have you seen this person?”","After that, she took out a portrait and handed it to Huyan Yichen.","Huyan Yichen took it and cried out, “Holy crap! Who’s this girl? She’s so pretty! ”","His eyes twinkled as he looked up at Princess Rao and asked, “Who’s this girl?","Who is she?”","Princess Rao was speechless.","Feng Wu noticed that she had clenched her fists in her sleeves and forced a","smile. She said to Huyan Yichen, “Just tell me. Have you seen her?”","Feng Wu glanced at the portrait and saw that it was indeed her face on it.","Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen was too absorbed in the painting to hear what","Princess Rao said.","Princess Rao’s eyes flickered, but she still smiled. “Brother Yichen?”","“What? Are you talking to me?” Huyan Yichen looked at her in bewilderment and chuckled. “Is she a real person?”","Princess Rao nodded.","Huyan Yichen sighed with emotion. “She has to be the prettiest girl in the world. I don’t think any girl on this continent will be her match.”","Princess Rao took a deep breath.","She was about to say something when Huyan Yichen went on. “I wonder who’s going to win her heart in the future. Shall I join the competition?” Princess Rao was a little annoyed.","Before she could say anything, Caixia took the initiative and smiled obsequiously. “Young Master Yichen, our princess is saying that your shop has been here this whole time. Have you seen this girl around?”","Huyan Yichen threw a dirty look at her and bellowed, “Are you an idiot?! If I had met her, I would never have asked your princess if that’s a real person!”","Caixia didn’t dare to make a sound.","She would have argued with anyone else, but although Young Master Yichen was a very distant relative of the royal family, Old Master Huyan was an excellent weapon refiner. Huyan Yichen was also the most promising weapon refiner in the Northern Yan Kingdom.","Huyan Yichen was famous, talented, and had a promising future. Even the princess wouldn’t offend him.","As expected, no matter what she thought, Princess Rao still forced a smile. “Brother Yichen still holds grudges against me for what happened back then...’","However, Huyan Yichen only smirked. “Yes, I do. Don’t you know that? If you hadn’t protected him, heh...”","Huyan Yichen sounded indignant and aggrieved.","Feng Wu noticed that the rims of his eyes had turned red, and he looked like he wanted to beat Huyan Hongjun up.","However, the third prince was as arrogant as a peacock. He glanced at Huyan Yichen and said, “It wasn’t all my fault. My sister has forced me to apologize to you.. What more do you want?”"]},{"number":3817,"title":"Chapter 3817: Princess Raoxi","paragraphs":["Chapter 3817: Princess Raoxi","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“What more do you want? Are you going to kill me now?” The third prince walked up to Huyan Yichen and sneered at him. “You want to kill me? Bring it on! I’m right here in front of you. I’d like to see how you’re going to do it!”","Infuriated, Huyan Yichen was about to charge at him.","Old Huyan stepped out and grabbed him.","Meanwhile, Princess Rao also grabbed the third prince’s hand and gave him a warning look.","Huyan Hongjun rubbed his nose and looked away, but Huyan Yichen was so angry that he was trembling.","Feng Wu patted Huyan Yichen on the back to comfort him, somehow feeling sorry for him.","Feng Wu didn’t think she should confront Princess Rao now, but the princess was still on her blacklist, and she wouldn’t let the princess get away with it.","Princess Rao glared at Huyan Hongjun. “Apologize!”","Huyan Hongjun raised his chin. “No!”","Princess Rao said, “Huyan Hongjun!”","The third prince couldn’t understand it. “Sister, am I a prince or not? If that’s the case, why should I apologize to him? I’ve apologized for what happened back then. It’s up to him whether he accepts it or not. I won’t say sorry! So what if he has lost a sister? I had a cold for three days, too! I’m a respected prince!” Princess Rao took a deep breath.","To be honest, she agreed with the third prince, but she still had to put on a show. After all, Huyan Yichen was still very useful.","However, before she could finish, old Huyan said coldly, “The person you’re looking for hasn’t been here. You can leave now.”","Princess Rao knew that the old man had been utterly offended this time...","The old man wouldn’t have mattered, but he was the one who used to talk to the Patriarch.","Rising to her feet, Princess Rao smiled bitterly at the old man. “My brother was to be blamed for what happened back then... As his sister, I didn’t teach him well. I apologize to you.” After that, she bowed.","Old Huyan didn’t respond.","Princess Rao smiled bitterly. She was about to leave when she saw old Huyan’s right arm.","“Wait a minute!”","Princess Rao cried out in surprise. “Isn’t that... Isn’t that...”","Old Huyan frowned.","How could he have forgotten about that? He had forgotten to put away the semi-divine weapon.","Meanwhile, Princess Rao couldn’t look away from the arm of discipline.","Seeing that old Huyan wouldn’t speak, she went on. “Old Master, is that really the arm of discipline?”","Seeing the look in Princess Rao’s eyes, old Huyan realized that something wasn’t right.","He knew that Princess Rao might be a fragile girl, but once she made up her mind, she would make sure that she got what she wanted.","But the arm wasn’t his. If Princess Rao took it away because of him, the Old Master wouldn’t be able to answer Feng Wu.","“Did you build this arm? If you ask me, it’s a Semi-divine one, isn’t it?” asked Princess Rao.","Old Huyan nodded perfunctorily and said to Iron Tower, “See them out!”","But Princess Rao waved him off. “Wait.”","She asked, “Old Master, would you like to sell this arm?”","Old Huyan sighed in resignation. He knew it.","He gave Feng Wu a guilty look.","Meanwhile, Princess Rao had been staring at the old man, so she followed his gaze.."]},{"number":3818,"title":"Chapter 3818: Is It for Sale (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3818: Is It for Sale (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Her eyes met Feng Wu’s.","Princess Rao frowned a little. “Who is she?”","She was so ordinary that one could call her ugly. Moreover, she wasn’t capable at all..","However, she was neither humble nor overbearing, looking as if the princess had offended her. Princess Rao found her ridiculous.","She was a princess who had lived a comfortable life, and everyone else had followed her orders. However, she had been set off repeatedly today. Fearing that Feng Wu might get hurt, Huyan Yichen blocked her way and glared at Princess Rao. ‘Why do you care who she is? Get lost!”","Princess Rao grew up with Huyan Yichen, and with what happened back then, Huyan Yichen knew her too well.","Since Huyan Yichen knew that, Princess Rao stopped pretending. She looked from Feng Wu to old Huyan.","“Old Master, are you selling this arm?” Her tone became serious.","Old Man Huyan frowned. He knew very well that Princess Rao wanted it, and once the princess made up her mind, she would be in a lot of trouble...","Even so, old Huyan still shook his head. “I’m keeping it for someone else. How can I sell it?”","“Really? They put it there?” Staring at the arm, Princess Rao smiled. “Who put it here?”","Neither Huyan Yichen nor the old wanted to reveal the owner, but Feng Wu couldn’t bring them into trouble.","She stepped out and said indifferently, “It’s mine.”","“You?” Princess Rao glanced at Feng Wu in an arrogant manner.","Huyan Yichen was furious.","Dragging Feng Wu to his side, he shot her a warning glance and feigned an angry tone. ‘What are you talking about?! ”","However, by then, Princess Rao had already turned her attention to Feng Wu. Holding the fox in her arms, she caressed it, but kept her gaze on Feng Wu.","She didn’t say anything, but the people around her took the hint.","Caixiao went up to Feng Wu and said, “Name your price.”","Both Huyan Yichen and the old man looked at Feng Wu because they couldn’t make that decision for her.","Feng Wu took the arm from old Huyan and casually put it on.","Caixia frowned, stared at Feng Wu, and said, “I’m talking to you. Name your price.”","Feng Wu ignored the maid. She only glanced at Princess Rao, then turned to leave.","“Stop!” Caixia glared at Feng Wu. “Didn’t you hear me? How dare you refuse to sell it to us?! ”","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder at Huyan Yichen. “So, they’re trying to force me to sell it?”","Huyan Yichen said, “I think so.”","Feng Wu asked, “Can I not sell it?”","Huyan Yichen crossed his arms and smiled at Feng Wu. “Of course! ”","Feng Wu said, “But... am I going to get attacked for that?”","Huyan Yichen glanced at Princess Rao and said to Feng Wu, “According to the rules of Northern Yan, even a princess can’t force you to do that. Otherwise, she’ll be punished like a commoner.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is she going to kill me and take my things?”","Huyan Yichen chuckled. “Don’t go anywhere. Just stay here in my shop. I’d like to see who dares to kill you!” He sneered at Princess Rao as he spoke.","Meanwhile..."]},{"number":3819,"title":"Chapter 3819: Is It for Sale (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3819: Is It for Sale (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Meanwhile, Princess Rao was so displeased that she didn’t try to hide it anymore.","A hush fell over the crowd, and the temperature seemed to drop.","Huyan Yichen gave her a half-smile. “What? Are you going to force her to sell it to you?”","Taking a deep breath, Princess Rao fought back her anger. She then turned to old Huyan with a smile. “Old Master, how about you make me a new one?”","Old Huyan waved his hand. “No.”","Princess Rao asked, “Why?”","Old Huyan shook his head. “Do you know who made this arm?”","He didn’t say it outright, for he didn’t know if it would harm Feng Wu.","It was impossible to build a second one now.","Therefore, he didn’t say anything.","However, Huyan Yichen gloated. “Who made it? Let me tell you. This girl here made it herself! ”","Princess Rao rolled her eyes.","Huyan Yichen said, “Why won’t you believe me? She really made it herself! Look!”","He pointed at a stove a short distance away. “There are crumbs here. I haven’t cleaned them yet. One look and you’ll know that I’m not bragging.”","Princess Rao didn’t believe him, but she still shot Caixia a warning glance.","Caixia walked up to the stove and examined it. She then frowned, walked back to Princess Rao, and whispered something in her ear. Princess Rao looked at her in bewilderment.","Caixia nodded.","Holding the snow fox in her arms, Princess Rao strolled to the stove.","There were more refiners in Northern Yan than in other countries, and Princess Rao had learned the basics as well. She could tell right away. “Was the arm really made here?” Princess Rao didn’t ask Huyan Yichen but only stared at the old man.","Huyan Yichen’s words couldn’t be trusted, but the old man was well-respected. He might try to keep it a secret, but he would never lie.","Meanwhile, old Huyan waved his hand. “Just ask Yichen.”","Princess Rao’s stomach lurched because that meant...","Huyan Yichen crossed his arms proudly as if he had made the arm himself. However, he was genuinely proud of it. After all, he was the one who had found the girl.","Instead of asking Huyan Yichen, Princess Rao walked up to Feng Wu and stared at her again.","Princess Rao was used to be so superior. No matter how humble she was, she still looked condescending, which wasn’t very comfortable for other people.","Meanwhile, she kept her gaze on Feng Wu and said indifferently, “So, should I call you a refiner now?”","Feng Wu nodded indifferently.","Princess Rao said, “Make me an arm, then. Name your terms.”","Feng Wu didn’t turn her down right away. Instead, she said, “It’s doable...”","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","After a pause, Feng Wu smiled again. “Get the materials first.”","Materials?","Princess Rao was confused.","Huyan Yichen said unhurriedly, “That’s right. Get the materials first. You can’t make bricks without straws.”","Princess Rao asked, “What materials?”","Huyan Yichen pointed at the stove. “Didn’t you see the iron filings? Find someone to study them, and you’ll know what they are.”","He looked like he wanted to chase the princess away.","But Princess Rao still frowned and asked, “What about the materials for this arm?”"]},{"number":3820,"title":"Chapter 3820: Is It for Sale (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3820: Is It for Sale (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“That’s a great question!” Huyan Yichen gloated. “Of course, little Feng Xun gave me the materials himself!”","Huyan Yichen was elated.","He had thought that Feng Xun had set him up and had been trying to take revenge all these years, but as it turned out... He wasn’t humiliated but had taken advantage of Feng Xun instead.","Princess Rao was confused. “Feng Xun is here in Northern Yan?”","Feng Wu was equally confused. Did Princess Rao know Feng Xun? In that case, did she know Jun Linyuan as well?","Huyan Yichen waved his hand. “I’ve refined all the materials from that pile of iron and only made one arm. If you want more, go to Feng Xun. I can’t help you.”","Princess Rao nodded, gave the arm on Feng Wu’s arm another long look, then left.","As soon as Princess Rao was gone, Huyan Yichen let out a breath of relief. “Finally, she’s gone.”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Are you afraid of her?”","Huyan Yichen said, “Of course not! I’m not afraid of her! I’m just a gentleman!”","Feng Wu shrugged, as if saying, “If you say so.”","Huyan Yichen glanced at Feng Wu and looked concerned. “But... you have to be careful. From now on, don’t leave the house unless you have to. If you must go out, bring me or Iron Tower with you. Got it?”","Feng Wu said, “So, you’re saying that she’ll take the arm from me?”","Huyan Yichen said, “You’re underestimating her. Princess Rao has more capable men than you can count. She’s one of His Majesty’s heirs.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Can your princess be the successor to the throne as well?”","Huyan Yichen nodded. “According to His Majesty, the royal family doesn’t have any children but only heirs. We’re doing this to make Northern Yan stronger.","“For instance, His Majesty isn’t the previous king’s son but a cousin.","“Because His Majesty’s sons were either mediocre or useless. They couldn’t lead Northern Yan to greatness.","“The crown prince and Princess Rao will compete for the throne in the end.","“That’s why I said that Princess Rao wasn’t to be trifled with because she may be the next successor.” Huyan Yichen shrugged. “But even if she becomes the Queen, I won’t show her any courtesy!”","Feng Wu sighed inwardly. The countries around the Junwu Empire weren’t all incredible forces.","The Dongsang Kingdom had a blood tax system, and the Northern Yan Kingdom had a conglomerate system in that the heir to the throne wasn’t limited to the ruler’s offspring. The Junwu Empire was the only one that had a monarchy. Luckily, Jun Linyuan was the crown prince. If the second prince were to become the future emperor, the Junwu Empire might not be able to survive.","Recalling what happened earlier, Feng Wu asked curiously, “Do you have grudges against that prince from before?”","Huyan Yichen looked embarrassed when the subject was brought up.","Feng Wu waved her hands. “If you don’t want to talk about it...”","Huyan Yichen mumbled, “It’s not like I can’t tell you...”","He looked up and saw that his grandfather had left.","“I can tell you,” said Huyan Yichen. “You’re living with us now, and to Huyan Hongjun, you’re on our side. He won’t let you off the hook when he tries to hurt me..”"]},{"number":3821,"title":"Chapter 3821: Did You Meet Him (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3821: Did You Meet Him (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu asked curiously, “I think he did you wrong. Why is he taking revenge?”","Huyan Yichen smirked. “Do you expect him to know that?”","He then told Feng Wu why he hated the third prince so much.","Many years ago, Huyan Yichen had a younger sister, who was only five years old. Back then, the third prince was only three years older than her and was at his most mischievous age.","Back then, she didn’t like hanging out with the third prince, but he insisted on hanging out with her. The prince’s mother then took her into the imperial palace, but in the end, Huyan Yichen received news of his sister’s death.","According to the queen, his sister had fallen into the water, and the third prince had tried to save her, but...","Huyan Yichen smirked. “Like hell I will! My sister hates water, and she’s so auiet and well-behaved. Whv would she Olav in the water? Someone must be","lying!”","Later, the queen tried to compensate the Huyan family, but the old man turned her down. The incident only calmed down when the king handled it himself.","However, the third prince and queen were the only ones who had gotten over it. As for Huyan Yichen, he had never forgotten his grudge.","Huyan Yichen smirked. “He tried to save my sister? Heh! One day, I’ll slap him and make him tell the truth!” Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder. “I’m on your side.”","Huyan Yichen said, “Yes!”","That night, when Feng Wu went to bed, she finally saw Little Phoenix, who had disappeared for days.","Feng Wu’s eyes widened when she saw the filthy Little Phoenix with its injured wing.","“Why are you injured?!”","She had been so busy forging the arm that she had almost forgotten about Little Phoenix.","Little Phoenix had said that it was going to find Huyan Yanbo, but it was injured when it returned.","Little Phoenix pursed its lips and looked frustrated.","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What happened? Did someone stop you? You couldn’t get in? You had a fight, and you lost?”","Feng Wu knew Little Phoenix too well. It wouldn’t tell her anything if she asked in a normal way, so she tried to goad it into action. As expected, the bird flared up.","“Lost?! Me?! How can I lose? I’d rather die than lose!”","Feng Wu smiled and cajoled it. “That’s right. You’re the best bird in the world.","No other bird is as good as you...”","However, that was actually not the right thing to say now...","Little Phoenix gave Feng Wu a resentful look, turned around in frustration, and crouched down with its back to her.","Feng Wu pursed her lips again and patted its butt. “There, there. Tell me. What happened? Did you see your little Yanbo?”","Little Phoenix glanced at Feng Wu in frustration and rubbed its feathers. Feng Wu said, “So, you didn’t get to see him.”","Little Phoenix stomped its foot and said in frustration, “If that stupid bird hadn’t stopped me, I would have been able to get in!”","Feng Wu rubbed her chin. “Let me guess. Are you saying that there’s a bird inside that’s more capable than you?”","Little Phoenix didn’t buy it. “That’s because I’ve only just recovered my ability. I’ll be much more capable than it in the future. It’s nothing! I’ll kick its ass!”","Feng Wu fought back her laughter. “Alright, alright. You’ll be very capable in the future. So, you couldn’t get in now, could you?” “Hmph!” Little Phoenix turned around angrily.."]},{"number":3822,"title":"Chapter 3822: Did You Meet Him (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3822: Did You Meet Him (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu laughed.","Little Phoenix turned around and glared at Feng Wu. “Stop laughing!”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “But have you really not seen Senior Brother Huyan?” Little Phoenix shook its head. “No, I couldn’t. That bird was blocking my way.”","said, “How about you show me the way? I’ll see if I can handle that bird.”","Little Phoenix hesitated. “You’re too weak to go in now.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","That was a dead end.","Rubbing her chin, Feng Wu was trying to figure out a way to meet Patriarch","Huyan when...","There was a tiny noise outside.","Little Phoenix stiffened. It then whispered to Feng Wu in its head, “Someone’s coming! Hide!”","Feng Wu nodded. She quickly rolled up the duvet so that it looked like someone was sleeping under it, then hid behind the door.","The next second, smoke slowly blew into the room.","Someone had used the Enchanting Incense!","Didn’t she know that Feng Wu was an expert in medicine?","Taking a sniff, Feng Wu realized that the level of the toxin was quite high. It wasn’t something just anyone could make. It had to be a Supreme Level knockout powder.","Who was coming to her room in the middle of the night? What did they want? Feng Wu looked at the arm on her right arm involuntarily and narrowed her eyes.","The people outside had no idea that Feng Wu had neutralized the toxin and were still blowing it into the room. Little Phoenix glanced at Feng Wu, who nodded at it.","Hence, Little Phoenix squeezed out of the open window and quietly hid behind the person outside.","The bird had an invisibility skill, which enabled it to do great things in the Hua family.","After Little Phoenix flew out, it saw a man dressed in black blowing toxins into the room. It looked around and reported back to Feng Wu, “Old Huyan was drugged, and so were Huyan Yichen and Iron Tower. Everyone in the family is lying there now.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Little Phoenix sighed with emotion as it flew. “They’re good at forging weapons, but they’re not very capable in terms of cultivation. They won’t be able to protect you.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “Let’s get down to business.”","Little Phoenix smiled bitterly as well. “That’s right. A lot of people are here. There are six people outside your door and two each outside the old Huyan,","Huyan Yichen, and Iron Tower’s room.”","Feng Wu asked, “How capable are they?”","Little Phoenix heaved a long sigh. “If they were just a bunch of random people, I would just annihilate them all. However, they’re all very capable people.","“The weaker ones are guarding the Huyan family, and they’re only junior Spiritual Overlords.","“But there are four intermediate Spiritual Overlords and two peak Spiritual Overlords guarding your door...","“Who on earth is so resourceful? They sent so many people to kill a good-for-nothing like you, who has lost all her spiritual essence. How terrifying! ”","There were so many of them!","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She looked down at her arm of discipline. Without spiritual essence, she couldn’t exert its full power. What should she do now?","If she woke up the Huyan family, what if they got killed?","“Do you know who sent them?” Little Phoenix asked Feng Wu curiously.","Feng Wu nodded. “I do.”","Little Phoenix asked, “Who is it?”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Apart from that Princess Rao, there’s no one else..”"]},{"number":3823,"title":"Chapter 3823: Did You Meet Him (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3823: Did You Meet Him (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix was surprised. “She knows where you live?”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Little Phoenix said, “That is to say, she targeted you again without recognizing who you are?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Little Phoenix said, “Are you her archenemy now?”","Feng Wu shrugged with a wry smile.","“So, what should we do now?” Little Phoenix asked Feng Wu. “I’m a Spiritual Overlord now, and I’m a peak one! I’ve only just woken up from this enlightenment, and I’m already very capable!” Feng Wu nodded. “Impressive.”","Little Phoenix said, “Yes, but you’re still a cripple.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Little Phoenix said, “I can take care of one peak-level Spiritual Overlord, but there are still so many left. What are you going to do?”","Feng Wu was worried as well. Why did Princess Rao have so many Spiritual Overlords under her command?","Had she summoned all the Spiritual Overlords she could summon? Seeing the smoke rising into the air, Feng Wu smiled. “I may have an idea...”","“Is that so?”","Little Phoenix asked Feng Wu curiously, “Tell me!”","Feng Wu smiled.","She had prepared a lot of things because she had been keeping an eye on Princess Rao.","Had it been somewhere else, she wouldn’t have been able to handle all these capable cultivators, but now, she had such a great opportunity...","She knew how to get rid of all the Spiritual Overlords. Thinking about what happened to the Hua and Zuo families, Feng Wu was amazed by herself.","She told Little Phoenix, “Make as much noise as you can to stall them. I’ll need ten minutes to set it up.”","Little Phoenix said, “I’ll do my best.”","After that, Feng Wu ignored what was going on outside and focused on setting up the room.","Because she knew that Princess Rao might send assassins here, Feng Wu was prepared. She had set up a formation room in this room a while ago.","The tables, chairs, bed frames, bricks, and wooden candlesticks... Feng Wu had carefully set up each corner according to the formation and had concentrated on carving inscriptions. Anyone who stepped into the room would be hit!","Feng Wu removed the arm of discipline, powered it up, and put it in the most important position. As for what she was going to do with it, no one knew.","Was that all Feng Wu was going to do?","Of course, it was more than that!","Spiritual Overlords were very difficult to handle.","Right now, ????????????????? was moving so fast that one couldn’t follow her movements.","“Princess Rao, why do you have to fight me?”","Feng Wu was getting ready when she heard a loud noise outside.","The door opened with a thump.","What on earth was going on here?!","The Spiritual Overlords outside were astonished.","Four Spiritual Overlords were standing in front of Feng Wu, and the other two had been lured away by Little Phoenix.","The four Spiritual Overlords looked at one another in bewilderment. They couldn’t understand why the door would open so suddenly.","“Don’t let her get away!”","All four of them had their faces covered by a cloth so that no one would see their faces. The head of the four gestured at the others to move forward.","They filed into Feng Wu’s room.."]},{"number":3824,"title":"Chapter 3824: Did You Meet Him (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3824: Did You Meet Him (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","They filed into Feng Wu’s room.","They frowned when they entered because they sensed something different.","The door was suddenly closed behind them.","Was that the wind?","They looked over their shoulders and saw that the door was tightly shut. The only light came from a tiny gap next to the window, through which the silver moonlight shone.","The leader of the team was the tallest, and he made a hand gesture.","Hence, the four of them surrounded the bed in four directions.","They eyed the bed with contempt.","According to the information they received, they were going to assassinate a person without any spiritual essence and take a weapon. That was all.","They couldn’t for the life of them figure out why the six of them were sent here for such a simple task. What was the princess thinking?","What they didn’t know was that Princess Rao had sent all of them here not only to rob the treasure but also to intimidate and take revenge on Huyan Yichen.","Huyan Yichen had disrespected her, and she couldn’t stand it.","Since she could command so many people, why not use them?","The duvet was rolled up on the bed, and someone was lying inside. The leader nodded at the others, then walked up to the bed.","He always liked to kill with a blade.","However, the next second...","When he lifted the duvet, he realized...","Empty?!","Where was she?","At that critical moment, there was a slight noise outside.","The window had closed at some point, and no light could get in.","All four of them had strange looks on their faces, but no one could see their faces clearly in the dark. “The target is missing.”","They were Spiritual Elders, but they let Feng Wu get away? That was preposterous!","“Let’s go!”","The man in the lead found the room so strange that he wanted to retreat. However...","He suddenly couldn’t move his leg.","Because...","It suddenly became very quiet.","He felt like a fetus was in his mother’s womb.","They were all smiling happily.","They seemed to be immersed in their dreams.","Feng Wu didn’t go out. Instead, she stayed in the room that was dozens of square meters in size.","She hid quietly on the roof beam and waited for the poison to take effect.","Yes.","Feng Wu had used poison.","She didn’t have much toxin with her, but these people had used such a potent powder. Hence, Feng Wu was able to quickly create a hallucinogen based on the powder, which turned things around for them.","A Spiritual Overlord was human after all.","It was inevitable that they would be affected as well.","“Kiddo!”","A voice came from outside.","It was Huyan Yichen!","Feng Wu saw that the Spiritual Overlords almost woke up.","She gritted her teeth and increased the dosage.","As for herself, she opened the door in the dark and quietly showed Huyan Yichen in.","Huyan Yichen let out a breath of relief when he saw Feng Wu. He almost thought that Feng Wu was dead.","Before he could say anything, Feng Wu tugged at him and quietly sat him down on the beam.","The moment Feng Wu opened the door, Huyan Yichen saw the four people inside and was astonished.","“They...”"]},{"number":3825,"title":"Chapter 3825: Assassination in the Dark (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3825: Assassination in the Dark (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“They...”","Huyan Yichen almost cried out.","Feng Wu covered his mouth in time.","If Feng Wu didn’t cover his mouth in time and let him shout, all her effort would go to waste.","“How... How...” Huyan Yichen was astonished.","Feng Wu lowered her voice. “Do you know them?”","Huyan Yichen nodded immediately. “I’ve met them before!”","After a pause, he lowered his voice. “I saw them at Princess Rao’s place... Why are there so many Spiritual Overlords here?”","Feng Wu? was confused. “Isn’t there any outside your room?”","Huyan Yichen shook his head. “No.”","Feng Wu thought that the Spiritual Overlords guarding Huyan Yichen’s door had been lured away by Little Phoenix.","They were still talking when Feng Wu heard Little Phoenix’s anxious voice. “I can’t hold on much longer!”","It was talking to Feng Wu through her mind, so only Feng Wu could hear it.","Little Phoenix was only a bird that hadn’t reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage yet, and it was already a miracle that it had lasted this long.","She had to take care of these four people first.","Feng Wu didn’t have any spiritual essence with her at the moment, nor did she have the arm. She couldn’t break his defense. One had to be a Spiritual Overlord to do that...","Feng Wu looked over her shoulder at Huyan Yichen. “What’s your level?”","Huyan Yichen said to Feng Wu in a low voice, “I’m still a little bit away from the","Spiritual Overlord stage.”","Feng Wu asked, “How close?”","Huyan Yichen said, “I’m a Level-8 Spiritual Lord now, and it’ll be years before I become a Spiritual Overlord...’ Feng Wu said, “I’ll help you.”","Huyan Yichen asked, “What?”","He was utterly confused. How was the girl going to help him? She didn’t have any spiritual essence at all...","However, Huyan Yichen saw Feng Wu beckoning at a Spiritual Overlord in the dark.","“Why did you bring him here? I’m only a Level-8 Spiritual Lord! I can’t handle him!” Huyan Yichen was anxious.","But Feng Wu wasn’t worried at all. She summoned the unconscious Spiritual Overlord and said to Huyan Yichen, “Of all the people here, he’s the only one with the same element as you.”","Feng Wu whispered a cultivation technique to Huyan Yichen. “Got it?”","Despite his anxiety, Huyan Yichen still had a good memory, so he nodded at Feng Wu. “But...’","Feng Wu said, “Kill him before he wakes up.”","Huyan Yichen said with a long face, “But... but we can’t break his defense!” Spiritual Lords were no match for Spiritual Overlords.","However, before Huyan Yichen could complain, Feng Wu waved her hand, and the arm appeared in her hand.","Huyan Yichen’s eyes lit up when he saw the arm of discipline. “The arm!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Can you break their defense now?”","Huyan Yichen said excitedly, “I can do that!”","After that, Huyan Yichen quickly put on the arm of discipline.","Feng Wu’s original plan was to let the Spiritual Overlords activate the arm at last and let it kill them. However, it would be too time-consuming and wouldn’t have a high chance of succeeding.","Since Huyan Yichen was here, Feng Wu let him do it for her.","In the darkness, a sharp dagger appeared at the tip of the arm.","It pierced the Spiritual Overlord’s heart without making a sound.."]},{"number":3826,"title":"Chapter 3826: Assassination in the Dark (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3826: Assassination in the Dark (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The moment his heart was pierced, the Spiritual Overlord woke up from the pain.","His eyes snapped open in the darkness.","They were as sharp as ice.","He immediately saw the two people in front of him. One was a teenager with a strange arm, and the other was an ordinary-looking girl.","The look on his face was so ferocious that Huyan Yichen, who had never killed anyone before, was baffled.","Feng Wu gave Huyan Yichen a nudge. “His throat!”","Huyan Yichen realized what had happened.","At the same time, the Spiritual Overlord realized that someone was trying to kill him.","As for his friends...","The Spiritual Overlord was shocked when he saw that his three teammates were all wandering off. Although he didn’t know what had happened, he could tell that there was something wrong with the two teenagers.","And that girl was their target tonight!","At that thought, the Spiritual Overlord struck out, but it was too late.","He had underestimated the speed of the arm!","Seeing that Huyan Yichen didn’t have time to react, Feng Wu pressed a key spot on the arm. She then heard the sound of something ripping through the air.","With a whoosh, a thin needle flew out of the arm and pierced the forehead of the Spiritual Overlord less than a meter in front of them!","Out of all the places...","The area between the eyebrows was the core of the mind!","The needle pierced his forehead and reached his brain.","The needle Feng Wu made wasn’t just any sewing needle.","Spiritual Overlords could survive ordinary needles as long as their cerebrovascular vessels weren’t injured. However, the needles Feng Wu had made for the arm were known as burst needles.","What was a burst needle?","As the name suggested, the needle would explode when it entered the brain.","When a capable cultivator cultivated, they might be able to defend their head, but there was nothing they could do to their brain.","Therefore, when the Spiritual Overlord threw a punch at Feng Wu and when Huyan Yichen shielded Feng Wu with his arms...","Everything...","Everything seemed to freeze at that moment.","Huyan Yichen didn’t feel the pain he had expected, so he slowly opened his eyes.","What he saw was a giant figure standing in front of him. The man’s eyes were wide open, his body was stiff, and he didn’t move a muscle. One couldn’t tell if it was alive or dead...","Huyan Yichen waved his hand in front of the man’s face, but there was no reaction.","He poked the man and saw that he fell backward.","Before the dead Spiritual Overlord fell to the ground, Feng Wu reached out to catch him. If she was a little bit slower, the sound would have woken up the other three Spiritual Overlords.","Feng Wu was a little bit too late, so she tried to use herself as a cushion.","When Huyan Yichen realized what was going on, he grabbed the Spiritual","Overlord and stared at Feng Wu in disbelief. “He...”","He spoke very quietly, fearing that he might wake up the other Spiritual Overlords.","“He’s dead.” Feng Wu silenced him with a wave of her hand.","Huyan Yichen was speechless.","Dead?!","The Spiritual Overlord was dead just like that!","Spiritual Overlords were already very powerful in the Northern Yan Kingdom, and only a handful of them could be found in the empire. However, the ugly girl had just killed them!","Feng Wu had Huyan Yichen move the Spiritual Overlord to a corner of the room.."]},{"number":3827,"title":"Chapter 3827: Assassination in the Dark (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3827: Assassination in the Dark (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huyan Yichen lowered his voice. “Is he really dead?” Feng Wu nodded.","Huyan Yichen scratched his head. “Did I do that?”","Feng Wu nodded again.","Huyan Yichen said, “But... Although I’ve stabbed him in the heart, his defense is too strong. The blade didn’t completely destroy his heart. With the capability of a Spiritual Overlord, it shouldn’t be that easy for him to...”","He looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “I saw you shoot a needle, but wasn’t it just one needle? Was it that effective?”","Instead of answering Huyan Yichen, Feng Wu pointed at the other assassins. “...There are three more to go.”","Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu in disbelief and stammered, “Are you going","to...”","Feng Wu nodded. “Just repeat what you’ve done.”","Huyan Yichen said, “But... but I... I’m not their match.”","Just then, Huyan Yichen saw something incredible.","Crouching down, Feng Wu searched the Spiritual Overlord’s head for something. Soon, she came back.","She stuffed something half-transparent into Huyan Yichen’s head. “Argh!” Huyan Yichen felt a stabbing pain in his head and almost burst into tears.","He didn’t have time to ask any questions. There was a flash of white light, and a lot of things rushed into his head so fast that he almost couldn’t take them all.","It didn’t take Huyan Yichen long to come out of the illusion. He turned to Feng Wu with wide-open eyes. “You... you know the Soul-Absorbing Technique!”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “It’s not that.”","Huyan Yichen said, “What is it, then? How could you extract his soul and stuff it in my head? I...”","Feng Wu shrugged and asked, “How do you feel?”","Huyan Yichen said, “I... I feel like I’ve comprehended a lot of things about the Spiritual Overlord stage... All of a sudden...","Feng Wu asked, “Can you activate the Spiritual Overlord’s power now?","Huyan Yichen said, “Maybe...”","While Huyan Yichen was mumbling, Feng Wu summoned a second Spiritual","Overlord.","She then turned to Huyan Yichen and gestured at him.","Huyan Yichen was eager to try. He wanted to see how capable he was.","It wasn’t difficult to do the same thing again.","Huyan Yichen killed the second Spiritual Overlord as soon as the latter woke up.","Huyan Yichen was ecstatic. He looked at Feng Wu in excitement. “I, I...”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was looking at the incense that had almost burnt out.","Once the incense was burnt out, those men would wake up.","At that thought, Feng Wu told Huyan Yichen in a hurry, “Quickly! We don’t have enough time!”","Huyan Yichen nodded.","He was able to kill Spiritual Overlords because they were in an illusion. Although he didn’t know why they were in that illusion, he and the girl would be dead when they woke up.","At that thought, before Feng Wu could summon the Spiritual Overlord, Huyan Yichen had put on the arm of discipline.","Luckily, the arm was a semi-divine weapon that could break through the defense of Spiritual Overlords. Moreover, his comprehension had reached the level of a Spiritual Overlord, so he was able to exert more power. Before long, Huyan Yichen killed the remaining two Spiritual Overlords.."]},{"number":3828,"title":"Chapter 3828: Assassination in the Dark (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3828: Assassination in the Dark (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing the dead Spiritual Overlords in the room, Huyan Yichen didn’t know what to do.","He stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “I... I... I killed four Spiritual Overlords? Oh my god...","Huyan Yichen felt that he was only a Level-8 Spiritual Lord and was too far away from these Spiritual Overlords. However, the four Spiritual Overlords lying in the room had really been killed by him!","“I feel like I’m dreaming...” Huyan Yichen still couldn’t believe it.","Just then, Little Phoenix cried out outside.","Although it had the Invisibility Spell, the peak Spiritual Overlords were very capable.","Moreover, there were two peak Spiritual Overlords and three intermediate Spiritual Overlords outside.","“We’ve finally killed them all. Let’s get out of here!” Huyan Yichen thought that everything was going to be alright, so he turned to leave with Feng Wu. However, Feng Wu only gave him a strange look and told him the truth.","“What?!","Huyan Yichen was so frightened that he almost fell to the ground. Staring at","Feng Wu, he said nervously, “There are still three intermediate Spiritual Overlords and two peak Spiritual Overlords?!”","Feng Wu nodded.","Huyan Yichen was astonished. “Are all the capable cultivators of Northern Yan here tonight?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Maybe.”","Huyan Yichen asked, “Are we going to die?”","Feng Wu said, “No.”","Huyan Yichen said, “But there are so many of them. My grandpa is amazing, but he’s only good at forging weapons. There’s nothing he can do.”","Listening to the noise outside, Feng Wu frowned and asked Huyan Yichen, “Have you delivered the letter I told you to deliver?”","Huyan Yichen said, “Of course! I’ve sent it out in secret. I was worried that","Princess Rao would send someone to spy on us, so I told the person to sneak into the eldest prince’s residence.” Feng Wu nodded and murmured, “By now, his men should be here.”","Huyan Yichen asked, “Whose men?”","Feng Wu said, “The eldest prince’s.”","Huyan Yichen almost choked on his own spit. He stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “Whose people?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Princess Rao has a troop, and there’s no way that the eldest prince, who’s competing with her for the throne, doesn’t have one. By right, his people should be here by now.”","Huyan Yichen said, “You’re just an ugly girl. Who do you think you are? How dare you order a prince to help you? He’ll never listen to you!”","Feng Wu said, “If I give you the arm of discipline if you have a troop, and if Princess Rao is the enemy, will you send out your men?”","Huyan Yichen said, “Of course!”","Feng Wu said, “There you go.”","Huyan Yichen said, “But... but how did you know that Princess Rao would send someone to kill you tonight?”","Feng Wu smiled. “She may not want to kill me, but she’ll definitely send someone to take the arm away.”","Huyan Yichen agreed. “She always has to have everything she wants. The arm of discipline was the first time she couldn’t have something. With her temperament, she would have to take it... But you know her really well.” Feng Wu thought to herself, “If I don’t know her well, I’ll be dead by now.” Just then, they heard the sound of a fierce battle outside.","“Reinforcements are here!” Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu in excitement and took her to look out of the window. “Look, someone is fighting Princess Rao’s men.. It’s a fierce battle!”"]},{"number":3829,"title":"Chapter 3829: The Eldest Prince (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3829: The Eldest Prince (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu followed his gaze and saw what he was looking at.","A short distance away, two capable cultivators were fighting Princess Rao’s men.","The two of them were fighting peak Spiritual Overlords, which meant that they were equally capable.","“Are there only two of them?” Huyan Yichen grew anxious.","There were still quite a few Spiritual Overlords left. Apart from the two that were fighting, there were three more.","However, the three of them were slightly weaker. They were intermediate Spiritual Overlords.","Even so, they were still very difficult to handle.","They were Spiritual Overlords after all...","Just then, they heard someone screaming outside.","It was Little Phoenix.","Thanks to its Invisibility Spell, the bird had been able to make several Spiritual Overlords run around outside. Otherwise, Feng Wu would have been dead by now.","“Come in,” Feng Wu reminded Little Phoenix. ‘You’d better take a Spiritual","Overlord inside with you. We won’t be able to handle them all for a while.”","Little Phoenix was astonished when Feng Wu told it that they had killed all four Spiritual Overlords.","“They’re really dead? You’re not lying, are you? You’re a good-for-nothing, and Huyan Yichen isn’t capable at all. Did you really do it?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “Although I don’t have any spiritual essence now, I still have other skills.”","Feng Wu was good at everything from alchemy to weapon refinement, medicine refinement, and formation.","Little Phoenix agreed with her. Master Mu’s pupil was anything but weak. She had just killed four Spiritual Overlords when she was still a good -for-nothing.","That was quite an achievement.","“Three men are chasing me! Wait for me! I’ll take one of them with me!” After talking to Feng Wu, Little Phoenix started making the people chase it.","It didn’t take long for it to come back with one of them.","Little Phoenix said to Feng Wu, “You can have that one. I’ll bring the other one back in a minute. Hurry up.”","After that, Little Phoenix left the Spiritual Overlord behind and flew out of the room.","The Spiritual Overlord was brought in by Little Phoenix, and before he knew it, the bird was out of sight. He was about to leave the room when the door closed with a loud bang.","The Spiritual Overlord was dazed for a moment. Before he knew it, he was sucked into the spell.","Together with the formation Feng Wu had set up, his head spun, and he couldn’t think straight.","Feng Wu glanced at Huyan Yichen.","Huyan Yichen nodded.","Hence, when the Spiritual Overlord fell into an illusion, Huyan Yichen struck out with the arm of discipline.","There were needles, daggers, and other things on the arm...","Feng Wu had installed quite a few gadgets.","Before the Spiritual Overlord could react, he was struck by the arm’s hidden weapon in the area between the eyebrows, his throat, and his heart.","The Spiritual Overlord screamed. When he came back to himself, he saw a young man in front of him, and he had three fatal wounds.","“You...”","Before he could finish, he heard a voice outside.. “Fifteen? Are you there?”"]},{"number":3830,"title":"Chapter 3830: [The Eldest Prince (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3830: [The Eldest Prince (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","As it turned out, the person severely injured by the arm was known as Fifteen. That was probably his ranking.","Feng Wu gave Huyan Yichen a warning look.","Huyan Yichen realized that now wasn’t the time to be baffled.","Thump!","The arm struck out.","The hidden weapons were only add-ons, and its most lethal force relied on the punch.","“Fifteen!”","The Spiritual Overlord kicked the door open and rushed into the room.","“Fifteen!”","His eyes turned bloodshot red when he saw what was going on.","For he saw Fifteen, his friend, lying on the ground and staring at him with wide open eyes.","“Argh!” He bellowed and spared no effort.","The bellow of an intermediate Spiritual Overlord wasn’t that easy to withstand.","Earlier, the Spiritual Overlords didn’t dare to make too much noise to disturb the others because they were assassins. However, things had turned against them, and they couldn’t care less.","The Spiritual Overlord bellowed, and the roof of Feng Wu’s room was lifted off the ground.","Feng Wu had borrowed the darkness of the night to set up the formation. Now that the darkness had been overturned, half of the formation was destroyed.","As if that wasn’t enough, the Spiritual Overlord bellowed again.","Even the wall of the room Feng Wu was in had been blown away.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","That soundwave was incredible.","Luckily, Feng Wu had prepared for this and had backed off beforehand. Otherwise, she would have been blown away by now.","When the entire room was blown away, Feng Wu’s formation probably wouldn’t work anymore.","However, the Spiritual Overlord finally saw what was going on.","He drew in his breath.","Oh god...","He wanted to scream because there were five dead bodies!","Five dead Spiritual Overlords were lying side by side, and each one had been severely injured.","Looking up, he didn’t see anyone, but he saw two figures running down the slope.","“Stop!” The Spiritual Overlord bellowed and charged at them.","He moved as fast as a streak of lightning!","Fearing that Feng Wu would get hurt, Huyan Yichen pushed her away. He then turned to face the Spiritual Overlord.","Thump!","The man knocked Huyan Yichen away with one strike, and his back smashed into the wall. The next second, the wall collapsed.","The Spiritual Overlord didn’t even look at Feng Wu. All his attention was on Huyan Yichen.","Huyan Yichen was wearing the arm, which was their target this time. He slowly walked toward Huyan Yichen with a cold look in his eyes. Blue veins popped on his forehead.","All five of his friends were dead!","“Die!” The Spiritual Overlord bent down and grabbed Huyan Yichen by the throat.","Huyan Yichen raised his arm and struck down at the Spiritual Overlord.","However, although Huyan Yichen was already a Spiritual Overlord, h’s was still a Spiritual King in terms of his capability. Therefore, his opponent was only slightly injured and was going to throttle him.."]},{"number":3831,"title":"Chapter 3831: The Eldest Prince (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3831: The Eldest Prince (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, there was a loud thump, and a spear pierced the Spiritual Overlord from behind.","“Cough, cough...”","Huyan Yichen was almost strangled. His vision went dark, and he thought he was going to die. Luckily...","Looking up, he wanted to know who had saved him, but...","“Grandpa?” Huyan Yichen cried out.","It was indeed old Huyan.","As soon as Huyan Yichen pushed Feng Wu away, Feng Wu knew what he was going to do.","He wanted to stall for time. He knew perfectly well that he was no match for an intermediate Spiritual Overlord, but he still pushed her away without hesitation.","She was going to call Little Phoenix, but the bird was too busy killing the last Spiritual Overlord to do anything.","Feng Wu smacked her own head. How could she forget...","She went to wake Huyan up with some medicine.","Therefore, Huyan Yichen was amazed when he saw his grandfather. “Grandpa,","you... ”","An idea struck Huyan Yichen, and he looked sad.","Huyan threw a dirty look at Huyan Yichen and left with a darkened face.","Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu. “Did you bring my grandfather here?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Huyan Yichen sighed. “Grandpa is mad...”","Feng Wu was confused. “Why is he so angry?”","Huyan Yichen sighed and said, “To save me, my grandfather made an oath in front of the queen and Princess Rao that he would never use his spiritual essence again. He has broken his promise...”","Feng Wu looked at Huyan Yichen in bewilderment. “Most of the people here are sent by Princess Rao. She’s only bullying your grandpa because he can’t do anything. If we don’t do anything, she’ll get what she wants. That’s so stupid.” Huyan Yichen agreed with her.","Feng Wu said, “When your grandfather made that oath, was it because of your sister? Did you go after Princess Rao?”","Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu in amazement. Was she even human? How did she know that?","Feng Wu said, “But look, Princess Rao broke the rule first. So what if your grandfather broke his oath? He can’t just stand there and watch while they try to kill us! That’s not keeping his promise! That’s called being pedantic and stupid! ”","Huyan Yichen scrambled to his feet. “That’s true. I...”","Before he could finish, Huyan Yichen covered his head and drew in his breath.","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Can’t hold it anymore?","Huyan Yichen nodded.","Iron Tower, who had finally shown up, said anxiously, “Young Master, let me carry you!”","After that, he was going to carry Huyan Yichen toward the toilet.","“No, it’s not that...” Huyan Yichen waved his hands and said, “I’m going to make a breakthrough. I...”","Huyan Yichen wanted to find a quiet place to cultivate and make a breakthrough, but the entire shop was in a mess, and he couldn’t find a quiet","spot. Moreover, ne couldn’t stancl It anymore...","He said to Feng Wu, “Protect me.”","After that, he sat down cross-legged and started cultivating, ready to make a breakthrough.","Iron Tower watched this in astonishment... His young master was going to make a breakthrough? What happened while he was sleeping?"]},{"number":3832,"title":"Chapter 3832: The Eldest Prince (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3832: The Eldest Prince (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","By then, Little Phoenix had finally taken care of the last Spiritual Overlord. It was stumbling toward Feng Wu until it landed on her palm.","Seeing the blood on Little Phoenix’s feathers, Feng Wu asked sympathetically,","“Are you hurt? Where?”","Little Phoenix waved her off. “Don’t worry about it. It’s been years since I fought to my heart’s content. That was so satisfying!”","Seeing that Little Phoenix was in a good mood, Feng Wu was relieved to see that it was alright.","The situation was almost under control.","There were seven Spiritual Overlords in total, and five of them were killed by Feng Wu and Huyan Yichen. One was killed by old Huyan, and the other was killed by Little Phoenix.","The remaining two were at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, and they had already fought their way into another dimension. Otherwise, the damage would be too severe... His Majesty would hold them responsible.","Just then, a group of people slowly walked in.","It was a tall, handsome, and well-defined young man, followed by several Spiritual Overlord guards.","Spiritual Overlord guards...","Feng Wu immediately recognized the person.","He looked right into Feng Wu’s eyes and smiled.","“The king of refinery?” He stared at Feng Wu with a smile on his face.","The letter Feng Wu gave him was signed by “the king of refinery”.","If it hadn’t been for that title, he wouldn’t have come all the way here.","“Your Royal Highness?” Feng Wu stood a meter away from him and smiled as well.","Right now, Feng Wu was neither servile nor overbearing, and she was very calm. She wasn’t as flustered as the others when they saw the prince.","The crown prince looked at the ugly girl, followed her gaze, and saw the dead bodies on the ground...","They were all his sister’s right-hand men...","The look on the prince’s face was even more cheerful. He walked up to Feng Wu and smiled. “Young lady, did you write that letter?” Feng Wu nodded indifferently.","The prince asked, “Did you kill them as well?”","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow. “Do you think I’m good enough to do that?”","The prince could sense that Feng Wu didn’t have any spiritual essence. He waved his hand and gestured at Feng Wu to sit opposite him.","No one Imew what Feng Wu and the prince talked about. All they saw was that Feng Wu and the prince were enjoying their conversation.","Iron Tower was surprised.","To him, the prince was cold and unapproachable, and even his young master didn’t dare to act recklessly in front of him. However, this girl... She was sitting on the same level as the prince and wouldn’t give in.","That was impressive!","What Feng Wu didn’t know was that old Huyan, who had left a long time ago, was also observing her in secret and was surprised by what she did.","However, he soon convinced himself.","A weapon refiner that could forge a semi-divine weapon had to be very capable.","The prince was only a junior to him. What was so strange about this girl interacting with him as an equal? Just then, there was a rumbling sound.","What was that?","Everyone looked in the direction of the sound and saw that Huyan Yichen was absorbing the spiritual essence.","By then, he had absorbed all the spiritual essence and slowly opened his eyes. The moment he saw Huyan Yichen, the prince frowned, and he jumped to his","feet.."]},{"number":3833,"title":"Chapter 3833: I’m a Spiritual Overlord (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3833: I’m a Spiritual Overlord (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He walked toward Huyan Yichen, moving so fast that the others didn’t have time to react. Before they knew it, he was crouching down in front of Huyan Yichen.","“Yichen?” He waved his hand in front of Huyan Yichen’s face. Before Huyan Yichen could react, he waved his hand again.","This time, Huyan Yichen finally came back to himself. He stared at the prince but didn’t know what to say.","The prince spoke first.","“Yichen, did you make a breakthrough?”","After all, the prince was a prince of a major kingdom and had seen much of the world. Hence, he soon calmed down.","Judging by his trembling voice, he wasn’t all that calm.","Huyan Yichen nodded. “Yes.”","Seeing that Huyan Yichen was in a trance-like state, the prince couldn’t help but ask, “What level are you now?”","Huyan Yichen blushed when he heard that. He jumped to his feet and looked very excited.","“I... I...” Huyan Yichen didn’t dare to speak. He looked around the room.","Old Huyan was standing a short distance away. Seeing the look in Huyan Yichen’s eyes, the old man stroked his beard. The boy had come to beg him, hadn’t he?","But...","After looking around, Huyan Yichen fixed his gaze on Feng Wu.","“Ugly girl!” Huyan Yichen ran toward Feng Wu and almost threw himself at her. Luckily, Feng Wu reacted in time and dodged the attack.","However, Huyan Yichen was still very excited. He turned around and stared at Feng Wu.","“Did you see that? I made a breakthrough! I’m a Spiritual Overlord now! I’m a","Spiritual Overlord now! Hahahaha!!!”","That was true.","With Huyan Yichen’s cultivation level, which was a Level-8 Spiritual King, he would consider himself lucky if he rose to the Spiritual Overlord Stage in a few years. If he wasn’t lucky enough, he might stay that way for the rest of his life. However, he had just made a breakthrough. How could he not be excited? Feng Wu nodded grumpily.","However, Huyan Yichen was still very excited. He ran toward the prince and spun the latter around in circles. “Hahaha! I’m a Spiritual Overlord now! I’m a","Spiritual Overlord now!”","The prince smiled bitterly and rubbed his nose.","However, Huyan Yichen wouldn’t stop talking. “It’s all little Feng’s doing! She enabled me to make a breakthrough! She’s amazing!”","Before the prince could react, Huyan Yichen was already running toward the old man. His voice reached his grandfather before he could reach the latter.","“Grandpa! Grandpa! Grandpa! I’m a Spiritual Overlord now! Your grandson is a Spiritual Overlord!” Huyan Yichen ran around the old man in circles in excitement.","Old Huyan wanted to slap him to wake him up, but he couldn’t bring himself to do it.","Because he knew that the little girl died in Huyan Yichen’s arms. Back then, she said that when her brother reached the Spiritual Overlord Stage, he would be very capable, and he would be able to save her.","Old Huyan couldn’t bring himself to think about it..","As expected, Huyan Yichen, who had been so pleased with himself a moment","ago..."]},{"number":3834,"title":"Chapter 3834: 1 1 m a Spiritual Overlord (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3834: 1 1 m a Spiritual Overlord (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He bent over, rested his hands on his thighs, and burst into tears. “I’m already a Spiritual Overlord... But where am I going to save my sister? Where...”","Seeing this, Feng Wu walked up to Huyan Yichen and patted him on the shoulder.","However, Huyan Yichen looked like a drowning man clutching at his last straw. He wrapped his arms around Feng Wu, buried his head in her chest, and burst into tears again.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","The teenager was the type that would laugh and cry whenever he felt like it. He didn’t try to hide his true nature at all. He was so adorable.","However, if Jun Linyuan saw him like this, he would be killed.","Feng Wu tried to pry his hands off her.","However, Huyan Yichen was like an octopus. He wrapped his arms around her and couldn’t stop crying.","Feng Wu looked up at the sky and met the prince’s eyes.","Jun Linyuan found Feng Wu’s behavior amusing. The way she sighed just then was so amusing...","That was to say, Huyan Yichen still didn’t know who the girl was. Was he the only one in Northern Yan who knew who she really was? The prince was elated.","Feng Wu turned to the prince for help with a pleading look on her face...","He walked up to Huyan Yichen, grabbed him, and dragged him away from Feng wu.","Feng Wu nodded gratefully at the prince with a long face, but the latter only smiled. Deep down, he found the girl very amusing. He didn’t know that legendary teenage girls could be so adorable.","“Are you done crying?” The prince picked up Huyan Yichen and asked in resignation.","Huyan Yichen was still sobbing and didn’t say a word.","The prince heaved a long sigh and said affectionately, “Haven’t I told you already? I’ll take revenge for you...”","However, Huyan Yichen stretched out his arm and showed off his biceps excitedly, “I’ll take my revenge myself! I’m a Spiritual Overlord now!”","The prince was speechless when he saw all the Spiritual Overlords lying on the ground.","He used to think that Spiritual Overlords were very capable, but when he saw the dead bodies on the ground, he couldn’t believe his eyes.","Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen ignored the prince and ran toward Feng Wu.","“Sister Feng, Sister Feng, you’re going to help me, aren’t you?!” He gave Feng Wu a pleading look.","Feng Wu had a bad feeling. She frowned and asked, “Help you with what?”","Huyan Yichen said in a serious tone, “Avenge my sister!”","Feng Wu pointed at the prince. “Didn’t he say he was going to help you? Go find him. What good can a good-for-nothing with no spiritual essence do?”","The prince nodded. That was right. He was the heir to the throne, but instead of asking for his help, Huyan Yichen was talking to a good-for-nothing. Although she was a genius, she was still a good-for-nothing.","However, Huyan Yichen grabbed Feng Wu’s hand and said earnestly, “I’m begging you! You’re the only one who can kill that girl!”","That was to say...","Feng Wu looked at the prince involuntarily and saw that his face had darkened.","Huyan Yichen was openly despising the prince, and he was going to drag her down with him!"]},{"number":3835,"title":"Chapter 3835: The Patriarch (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3835: The Patriarch (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Since this was Northern Yan’s territory, she had to show the prince some respect.","Feng Wu shot a warning glance at Huyan Yichen, but the clueless teenager only replied in a sincere tone, “It’s true. You’re the only one who can handle that girl. His Royal Highness can’t! If he could, he would have taken revenge for me all these years. Why wait until now?”","That did make sense.","Feng Wu looked at the prince involuntarily.","As expected, the crown prince’s face was darker than a stormy sky.","Feng Wu asked, “How can I do that?”","However, Huyan Yichen said matter-of-factly, “Isn’t there a saying in the Junwu Empire that evil people will be punished by evil people? Princess Rao is exceptionally evil, but you’re worse than her. You’re the only one who can do that! I have faith in you!”","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","The prince pointed at Huyan Yichen and laughed until he was in tears.","Huyan Yichen looked at the prince in bewilderment. Had he said something wrong?","The Spiritual Overlords brought by the crown prince all had strange looks in their eyes.","The eldest prince was a taciturn man who seldom spoke. He only spoke a little when he saw Huyan Yichen, but he had never laughed like this before.","At that thought, they couldn’t help but dart another look at Feng Wu, trying to figure out who the girl was that could make the crown prince so agitated.","The crown prince looked curiously at Feng Wu and said teasingly, “I didn’t know you were such a villain. Sorry about that.”","Feng Wu waved her hands. “It takes one to know one.”","Huyan Yichen looked eagerly at Feng Wu, who said grumpily, “Go away.","Consolidate your cultivation level now, or you’ll be in a lot of trouble.”","“Yes!”","Huyan Yichen followed Feng Wu’s order and went to cultivate to consolidate his foundation.","The eldest prince and old Huyan looked at each other and shook their heads with wry smiles. Huyan Yichen had never been so obedient.","Old Huyan left on his own. The prince sat down opposite Feng Wu and smiled at her. “What are you going to do now?”","Feng Wu stared at him and threw the question back at him. “What are YOU going to do now?”","The crown prince said, “You’ve killed Princess Rao’s capable subordinate. What do you think she’ll do when the sun rises?”","Was he threatening her?","Feng Wu smiled. “I’m just a good-for-nothing with no spiritual essence. How can I possibly kill these people? No matter how highly Princess Rao thinks of me, she won’t think that way.”","The prince frowned.","As expected, Feng Wu patted his left arm with a smile. “Your Royal Highness, since you’re here, shouldn’t you be protecting our shop? Didn’t you kill those people?”","The prince was speechless.","Feng Wu grinned. “Don’t you agree?”","The prince rubbed his forehead. “So, you were going to make me the scapegoat when you sent that letter?”","Feng Wu nodded. “I’m too weak to take the blame. She’s your competitor, and you can’t wait to see her dead. What’s wrong with taking the blame?”","The prince looked at Feng Wu in resignation and said, “Miss Feng Wu, you’re indeed a legendary girl. You’ve planned everything from the very beginning..”"]},{"number":3836,"title":"Chapter 3836: The Patriarch (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3836: The Patriarch (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu smiled. “What do you mean by that? I’m helping you get rid of the enemies. Princess Rao has suffered a lot in this battle. Please don’t tell me that you’re not happy about it.”","The prince didn’t know what to say. Of course, he was happy. If he won, he would win the entire kingdom, but this was the first time that someone had pointed it out.","He stared at Feng Wu and said indifferently, “Miss Feng Wu, are you always so frank?”","Feng Wu shrugged. “Not really. Your Royal Highness, you’re the only one who knows who I really am.”","The prince had been leaning back in his chair, but now, he leaned forward, crossed his fingers, and stared at Feng Wu. “Aren’t you worried that I’ll hand","you over to Princess Rao?”","Feng Wu smiled. “You won’t.”","The prince narrowed his eyes on Feng Wu. “Why not?”","Feng Wu leaned back on the bamboo chair and looked around the room. She then turned to the prince and said, “I could kill these Spiritual Overlords without spiritual essence. What do you think of my capability when I recover my spiritual essence?”","The look on the prince’s face changed.","Feng Wu went on. “Plus, who am I in the Junwu Empire? Who’s my patron? Who’s he in the Junwu Empire? Your Royal Highnesses are well-informed. I don’t think I need to explain everything.”","The prince nodded. He had been keeping an eye on Feng Wu’s relationship with Jun Linyuan, for Jun Linyuan’s marriage was too important.","Feng Wu smiled again. “Befriending me is as good as winning the Junwu","Empire’s friendship.”","The prince said indifferently, “The friendship of the Junwu Empire is great, but not having it won’t matter much.”","Feng Wu shook her head with a smile. “It’s true that the friendship of the Junwu Empire won’t affect your accession to the throne, but what if your competitors suddenly gain the support of other countries?” The prince narrowed his eyes. “Are you saying...” Feng Wu pointed to the northeast.","The crown prince asked, “The Dongsang Kingdom?” Feng Wu nodded.","The prince stared at Feng Wu with eyes as deep as the ocean.","He didn’t ask Feng Wu how she knew because he knew that Feng Wu was telling the truth.","“Interesting.” The prince stared at Feng Wu and suddenly smiled. ‘What do you want?”","Feng Wu stared at him and asked earnestly, “You want to hear the truth?”","The prince said, ‘Yes.”","Feng Wu nodded and said directly, “I need to see your Patriarch.”","The prince almost choked on his tea. He immediately put down his cup and studied Feng Wu with an astonished look on his face.","Feng Wu shrugged, not feeling guilty at all. ‘You told me to tell the truth.”","The prince took a deep breath. “Do you know who our Patriarch is?”","Feng Wu asked, “Huyan... Yanbo?”","Pffft!","The prince almost spat out another mouthful of water.","Huyan Yanbo?!","No one in their generation dared to mention the name of their Patriarch, and they all addressed him as Patriarch respectfully. However, to this girl, addressing him as Huyan Yanbo was as common as addressing someone of her generation. The prince was almost frightened to death.","“Just... shut up.” The prince stared at Feng Wu with a solemn look on his face. “You shouldn’t address our Patriarch by his name.. If my father finds out, he’ll cut your head off!”"]},{"number":3837,"title":"Chapter 3837: The Patriarch (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3837: The Patriarch (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Does the emperor of Northern Yan respect Huyan.. ahem, your Patriarch very much?”","The prince was speechless. ‘What are you talking about? Does the Junwu","Empire have no respect for your Patriarch?”","Feng Wu didn’t answer. Instead, she changed the subject. “I need to see him.”","The prince noticed that Feng Wu didn’t say “I want to see him” but “I need to”.","After a pause, he asked Feng Wu, “Are you serious?”","Feng Wu nodded. “I need to see him.”","Rubbing his smooth chin, the prince was lost in his thoughts.","“To be honest, it’s very difficult to see the Patriarch. He’s so elusive that he may not be in Northern Yan now.”","Feng Wu said, “But he’ll be here in two weeks.” The prince looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “Why are you so sure?”","Feng Wu repeated, “He has to be here.”","Seeing how serious Feng Wu was, the prince realized that she must know something...","“Fine, let’s just say that he’s in Northern Yan, but it’s still very difficult to meet him.” The prince smiled bitterly. “Actually, it’ll be easier if you go to Raoxi because the Patriarch has been kind to her.”","Feng Wu asked, “Really?”","The crown prince nodded. “It’s true. He once said that Raoxi looked a lot like an old friend of his... Maybe that’s why. Who knows? But Raoxi can indeed enter this Spiritual Concealing Tower.","“If it wasn’t for the fact that the Patriarch likes Raoxi, a woman like her would never have been able to compete with me for the throne. My father still values the Patriarch’s opinion more than anything else.” Seeing that Feng Wu was honest, the prince was very straightforward. Feng Wu nodded and said affirmatively, “I’m sure you can figure it out.” The prince smiled bitterly and didn’t reply.","He suddenly asked, “Can you tell me why you want to see the Patriarch? Although I’m a prince, the Patriarch’s safety is at stake, and my father won’t leave it alone. I’m taking too big a risk.”","After some thought, Feng Wu decided to tell the crown prince, “Have you heard of the Primary Heaven Pill?”","The crown prince nodded. “The pill is a body-strengthening elixir the Patriarch prepared for Raoxi. She hasn’t been well since she was little, so she...”","“It’s mine.”","Feng Wu spoke before the prince could finish.","The prince was baffled and stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded and repeated, “The pill is mine.”","The prince was shocked.","What happened today had exceeded his expectations several times. The girl in front of him was a legend!","“Did you just say...” The prince swallowed. “The pill is yours?”","Had it been anyone else, he would have kicked them out already. However, this was Feng Wu, and Feng Wu had made her name in the Junwu Empire. Not to mention what Feng Wu had just done, the prince couldn’t help but believe her.","Feng Wu nodded and didn’t say another word.","The prince leaned back in his chair and heaved a sigh. “If that’s true, then..","“Can I make a guess?” The prince sat up straight again and leaned forward. “The Patriarch doesn’t dote on Raoxi as much as she claims. Of course, you know that people like us don’t like to spread the news ourselves. All we need to do is to take advantage of the situation and send out a signal..”"]},{"number":3838,"title":"Chapter 3838: The Patriarch (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3838: The Patriarch (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Tilting her head, Feng Wu gave it some thought and said, “I don’t know if your","Patriarch really dotes on Raoxi, but what I’m sure of is that the Primary Heaven Pill is mine. Moreover, your Patriarch only has the safe custody of the pill, not the right to use it.”","The prince looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu nodded solemnly.","The prince took a deep breath. “...You’re so unfathomable.” He was scared.","Feng Wu grinned. “So, are you willing to work with me?”","She smiled and extended her hand.","Closing his eyes, the prince racked his brain.","Every man for himself. He would never help Feng Wu for no reason, for the two of them hadn’t been emotionally involved before. Therefore, the only thing he cared about now was his personal gain.","The prince opened his eyes, which were as clear as bottomless pools and as sharp as blades.","“So, what will you give me if we work together?” Keeping his gaze on Feng Wu, the prince enunciated each word.","Feng Wu smiled. “I’m going to give you an opportunity to become the king. Will you take it?”","Judging by Feng Wu’s tone, he knew that she was going to destroy his rival for him.","Raoxi wasn’t that easy to handle, especially when she had a Patriarch behind her. However, this girl seemed to be very influential.","They might as well work together. “Happy working with you.”","The prince shook Feng Wu’s hand.","They smiled at each other.","Meanwhile, the princess’s residence was a mess.","Thump, thump, thump!","Things kept falling.","Outside, Caixia and Muli looked at each other and both saw fear in each other’s eyes.","The princess they remembered was elegant, unperturbed, and could make other people lose their minds with a smile, but she was smashing things in exasperation now. That was something they had never seen before.","“What should we do now?” Muli panicked and asked in a low voice.","Caixia waved at her with a straight face, indicating that she should keep her silence.","Muli lowered her voice. “But Sister Feiyu is inside. Is something going to happen to her?”","Caixia shook her head.","Soon, they heard the sound of someone being whipped.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","The cracking sounds were so loud that they reminded me of raindrops.","With each crack, Muli cringed, and a chill ran down her spine.","She covered her ears, but hearing Feiyu’s painful voice, Muli thought she was going to have a nervous breakdown.","After a long while, she heard the sound of a whip being thrown away.","“Come in!” A cold voice rang out.","Muli shuddered and almost cried out.","Caixia threw a dirty look at her and warned her in a low voice. “The princess is venting her anger. Behave yourself if you want to live!”","Muli nodded nervously.","The two of them went inside together.","The clean and tidy room was in a mess. There were crumbs everywvhere, and there wasn’t even enough room to stand on.","Among the debris was a person covered in blood. She was lying on her stomach and was covered with cuts and bruises. It was a terrifying scene!","Right now, Princess Rao was sitting in front of the dressing table and slowly straightening her makeup. She didn’t seem to notice anything.","Muli’s heart was pounding, and she was shaking..","She noticed that the one covered in cuts and bruises was none other than Sister Feiyu, who had delivered the news to the princess.."]},{"number":3839,"title":"Chapter 3839: The Patriarch (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3839: The Patriarch (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Sister Feiyu was the princess’s senior maid, and Muli remembered the day before. Feiyu had chatted with her and told her that the princess was very nice to her. She had earned a lot of money this month and had saved up a little. She was going to send it to her family, but now...","“Clean this place up.” Princess Rao glanced at them, her face as calm as ever.","She headed for the door after that.","After Princess Rao left, Muli let out a breath of relief. Her forehead was covered with sweat.","“Finally! My god!” Muli heaved a long sigh and said to Caixia, “Let’s save Sister Feiyu!”","After that, Muli crouched down and was going to treat her with hemostatic medicine.","But Caixiao didn’t move.","Muli prompted her. “Caixia, come here. It’s Feiyu...’","However, Muli couldn’t finish her sentence.","Because she could feel Feiyu’s breath, and the latter was no longer breathing.","She anxiously tried to find Feiyu’s pulse, but there was nothing...","“Ah!” Muli screamed, rose to her feet, and stumbled back.","She suddenly realized that Sister Feiyu was...","“She’s... she’s...” Muli was so frightened that she couldn’t speak.","But Caixiao seemed to be very experienced. She found a bag in the corner and put Feiyu in it. Muli watched this with her mouth agape.","Soon, Caixia stuffed the body in. Looking up, she saw Muli standing there in a trance-like state. She frowned and said in a solemn voice, “Come here and help me!”","Muli said, “The princess has...”","Before Muli could finish, Caixia cast a stern look at her. “Do you want to become a dead body as well?”","Muli said, “No, of course not... Caixia said, “Give me a hand, then!”","Muli said, “Yes, of course...”","Although she said yes, her hands were shaking violently.","Caixia sighed inwardly.","Caixia snorted. “I’ve been doing this since I was little. Even if I’m not bold enough, I’ve learned it.”","Muli’s stomach lurched.","Caixia said she had been used to it since she was little, and Mulli suddenly felt like crying.","Caixiao suddenly asked, “Zilan will be here soon. You can show her around.”","“Zilan is coming back?! But isn’t she dead?!” Muli was frightened again, and her face went ghastly pale. As a newbie, she felt that the world had turned upside down.","Caixia glanced at her. The girl was so naive that she was willing to say a few more words.","“Don’t you know?” Caixia glanced at her. “The princess’s maids’ names never change, but the people using those four names will.”","After that, Caixia carried the dead body out of the room and told Muli, “Clean this place up before you come back out.” By then, Muli was dumbfounded.","Holy crap...","What was that supposed to mean? The people using those four names could change? Was it what she thought?","Muli was so frightened that she fell to the ground.","Right now, Feng Wu knew that Princess Rao would be furious, for the prince had done a naughty thing. He sent a letter to invite Princess Rao here to the shop, saying that he had something nice to show her.."]},{"number":3840,"title":"Chapter 3840: The Patriarch (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3840: The Patriarch (6)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Of course, Princess Rao knew what her brother wanted to show her.","She wouldn’t come, but she would be furious.","“Report to the authorities!” Huyan Yichen said coldly. “After what they did to our shop, we can’t pretend that nothing has happened! Do you think I’m that easy to bully? After what she did to me back then, I won’t stand for this!” The prince didn’t stop him.","Hence, Huyan Yichen went to the Punishment Office and banged on the drum.","The Punishment Office was the judicial department of the empire and was in charge of all the officials of the imperial court and the imperial family. Huyan Yichen had determined that it was Princess Rao’s doing, so he came here directly.","The Punishment Office was having a peaceful time.","The imperial court had been peaceful recently, and the head of the office had been trying to have a son to inherit the family business.","Just then, a servant came to report that the young master of a shop had come to complain.","The office head frowned. “It’s just a small shop. Why are you so nervous? Get out!”","“But... but... that’s Petty Shop...","“Petty Shop? Do you mean THAT Petty Shop? Master Huyan’s shop?!”","“Yes...”","“Why didn’t you say so earlier?!”","The office head put on his clothes.","Apart from being a master refiner, Master Huyan was also a member of the royal family!","He also had a title, which was quite prominent, although the old man himself never paid much attention to it.","When the officer saw Huyan Yichen sitting there, he was even more convinced. The teenager had addressed him as “Uncle”, which was quite affectionate.","“Ahem.” The office head cleared his throat. “May I ask who you are and what you’re here for?”","Instead of mentioning Princess Rao, Huyan Yichen feigned a teary voice. “Uncle, please help us. Someone tried to assassinate my grandfather and me in our shop last night. We almost got killed.”","Assassination?!","Northern Yan had always been a safe place. How could someone try to assassinate the top weapon refiner of the kingdom?","“Are you alright? How’s your grandfather?” Master Huyan was the most important figure of the kingdom, and they had to keep him safe!","Recalling what Feng Wu had told him, Huyan Yichen made up his mind to give Princess Rao a hard time. He feigned a teary voice and said, “My grandpa is badly injured, and he’s lying at home with the bodies of the assassins who broke in last night. Sir, please bring us justice.”","He didn’t need to say more.","Hence, with a wave of his hand, the office head was going to send one of his most capable men to investigate the case. However, after recalling Master Huyan’s status, he said in a hurry, “I’ll go myself and pay him a visit while I’m at it.”","He was furious when he saw the half-collapsed shop. “That’s outrageous! Which thief is so heartless? I’ll arrest him and punish him!”","He had made up his mind that he would make sure that the case was properly investigated, for with how important Master Huyan was to His Majesty, the case would soon reach his ears.","However, when he saw the bodies on the ground...","He was baffled.","The dead bodies didn’t look like ordinary people.","His most capable subordinate was called Yang Zong, who stared at him in bewilderment and didn’t know what to do. The office head gave him a warning glance.","Yang Zong looked distressed.."]},{"number":3841,"title":"Chapter 3841: Investigate (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3841: Investigate (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Yang Zong looked distressed.","However, the office head urged him, “Check it now!”","Yang Zong moved closer and whispered in his superior’s ear, “Sir, all seven of them are Spiritual Overlords!”","Spiritual Overlords?!","Hearing that, the officer almost fell to the ground.","Spiritual Overlords were all precious treasures of the kingdom, but now...","“Are you saying that all of them...” The officer went ghastly pale.","Yang Zong nodded.","The officer was astonished.","He didn’t know what to say. He was in big trouble!","He took a few deep breaths to calm himself down before turning to Huyan Yichen. “Where’s your grandfather...”","He had to talk to the old man.","However, Huyan Yichen only said to the officer with a long face, “My grandpa is badly injured and shouldn’t be disturbed. Please let me know if you need anything.”","Having no other choice, the officer asked Huyan Yichen tentatively, “Are all seven Spiritual Overlords?”","Huyan Yichen looked surprised. “Spiritual Overlords? No wonder! They’re so powerful! My family was almost annihilated last night!”","The officer looked at Huyan Yichen in bewilderment. “Seven Spiritual","Overlords... How did you survive and leave their bodies behind?”","Only a handful of people in the Northern Yan Kingdom could send seven Spiritual Overlords at once.","Huyan Yichen said, “Luckily, His Royal Highness happened to be in the area, and he had some capable men with him. Otherwise, my grandfather and I would have been dead by now. We could have lost our top weapon refiner! Sir, please look into it!”","The officer felt a headache coming on... This investigation was going to be very problematic.","But what Huyan Yichen said next was, “If you can’t do it, don’t worry. I’ll go to His Majesty now. I’m going to report to His Majesty!”","The officer was speechless.","To make it worse, Yang Zong, who had finished examining the body, whispered in the officer’s ear, “There’s a body here... It’s Princess Rao’s secret guard..","A chill ran down the officer’s spine as he stared at his subordinate.","Yang Zong nodded solemnly.","The officer drew in his breath.","He had been trying to stay out of the competition between the eldest prince and Princess Rao. Who would have thought that the two of them had reached this stage?","However, the Northern Yan Kingdom was the one that was losing power! At that thought, the officer was furious.","He said to Huyan Yichen, “This is too big a matter for the Punishment Office to handle. His Majesty has to do something...” All Huyan Yichen wanted was to tell the king about it!","Princess Rao had sent someone to assassinate him!","He would like to see what the king would say when they caught her red-handed!","Huyan Yichen had no idea what Feng Wu and the prince discussed the night before, nor did he know what their plan was. All he knew was that the girl was so awesome that Princess Rao would never be her match!","All he needed to do was follow the girl’s order!","That was what Huyan Yichen thought, but he put on a sad face. “Since we have to report this to His Majesty, I’ll leave it to you.”","The officer liked Huyan Yichen. After all, Huyan Yichen had taken the official route and didn’t go above the Punishment Office when he could have gone to His Majesty directly.."]},{"number":3842,"title":"Chapter 3842: Investigate (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3842: Investigate (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, something happened at home as soon as the officer went back and finished writing the memorial to the throne.","Someone came to see him.","He narrowed his eyes when he saw the person.","The visitor was Princess Rao’s daily servant.","“Sir, have we met before?” Caixia asked and glanced at him.","The office head was a third-ranked official and one of the three chiefs of the judicial department. However, to Caixia, he was only an average official because her master was going to be the future king.","Seeing Caixia, the office head sighed inwardly... Some things were bound to happen.","“Sir, since you’ve recognized me, there’s no need to beat around the bush. Let’s get straight to the point.” Caixia looked at the office head.","The office head was so angry that he laughed.","Because of what had happened to Huyan Yichen, he had gone to see the eldest prince, who had been so mild and humble toward him. However, Princess Rao’s maid was acting so arrogantly in front of him now. How interesting.","The office head sat in a chair with a cold look in his eyes.","Caixia frowned a little. Was he going to disrespect the princess?","At that thought, she slowly walked up to the office head and stared at him. “Sir, what are you laughing at?”","The office head didn’t say anything and only stared at her.","Caixia cleared her throat. “If I’m guessing correctly, you’re investigating the incident in Huyan Yichen’s family, aren’t you?”","The office head didn’t reply.","Caixia stared at him. “My princess has something to say about this case.” “Really?” The office head smiled at her. “I wonder what Princess Rao has to say.”","Caixia looked into his eyes and said in a warning tone, “My princess wants you to drop the case if you can. You’re a busy man. Don’t tire yourself out.” The office head was so angry that he laughed.","“Princess Rao wants to do whatever she wants? How arrogant!”","“Do you have a different opinion?” Caixia frowned and was surprised because when the princess told her to come, she told her to just tell the old man to shut up.","If Caixia repeated those words, the office head would be furious.","But the fact was that Princess Rao was still furious over the death of seven Spiritual Overlords. She had come up with several plans to catch Huyan Yichen and the others all at once.","The office head nodded. “Your princess can speak for herself if she has something to say!”","After that, he waved her off with a stern look on his face. “This isn’t a place for a maid like you. Leave now!”","Caixia was dumbfounded. The officials had always been very polite to Princess Rao, for not only was His Majesty behind her, but the Patriarch was as well!","At the thought of the omnipotent Patriarch, Caixia smirked. “So, I advise you to think it through.”","The office head waved his hand impatiently. “Get lost!”","Caixia gritted her teeth and threatened him. “Fine. If that’s the case, don’t blame us for what our princess will do! Don’t come to us for help when the time comes!”","She turned to leave after that.","She had thought that the office head would stop her, but he didn’t. Instead, he smirked.","Terrific!","Caixia left in a huff.","A figure entered the study after she left.."]},{"number":3843,"title":"Chapter 3843: Investigate (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3843: Investigate (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, the wife of the office head entered the room.","“My lord, that’s Princess Rao’s personal maid. Are you sure you can do this?” His wife gritted her teeth.","The office head sighed. “The eldest prince and Princess Rao are involved, and the competition for the throne isn’t something to be taken lightly. We’ll stay out of it and remain neutral. We’ll only support His Majesty.”","His wife said, “If Princess Rao takes her revenge...”","The office head smiled bitterly. “She’ll have to wait until she becomes the emperor.”","His wife said, “Apart from His Majesty, she also has the Patriarch... Isn’t she the only one the Patriarch likes? Even His Majesty is on her side..","The office head shook his head. “...If she really is that kind of person, Northern Yan will have a darkest moment when she becomes the king. No, I won’t allow","His wife smiled bitterly. She hoped it wouldn’t come to that.","After Caixia went back, she told Princess Rao about the office head’s reaction.","Princess Rao narrowed her eyes. “Is that really his reaction?”","Caixia lowered her gaze and said respectfully, “I’ve been very polite, but he wouldn’t drop the case no matter what. He even said that the memorial to the throne had been sent to the palace.”","According to the rules of the Northern Yan Kingdom, the memorial to the throne would be sent to the royal palace on the same day for His Majesty to see. The following morning, His Majesty would take it out for discussion.","If the officials heard about it...","Princess Rao was both angry and troubled.","She was furious because she had lost so many capable cultivators. She only had so many Spiritual Overlords left. She had to be out of her mind to send so many of them, but she had no idea that the eldest prince’s men would suddenly show up.","She then recalled the arm of discipline, which had brought her to think about the ugly girl... Ever since she ran into that girl, she knew that she was going to be in trouble. It just didn’t feel right.","“Kill her!” Princess Rao said angrily.","Her? Who? Caixia was confused, but when she saw the murderous look in","Princess Rao’s eyes, she realized something. “The ugly girl who lives in Petty Shop? Your Highness... we sent so many capable cultivators, but they still couldn’t kill her. Now...","“Plus, could it be the eldest prince’s plan? Has he gotten wind of it already? Will he still have people guarding there...” Caixia asked more questions.","Princess Rao was furious.","“Fine. Have someone keep an eye on her. Kill her as soon as she’s alone!” Princess Rao gritted her teeth. “And make sure you get that arm!”","Her 18th birthday was coming up, and according to the Patriarch, if everything went as planned, she would get that pill at her 18th birthday banquet. That way, she would be able to make great achievements in her cultivation and become the ruler of the kingdom!","After all the medicine she had taken, all the supplementary cultivation techniques she had practiced, and all the hard work she had put in since she was little, she had to have that pill.","Seeing the look on Princess Rao’s face, Caixia didn’t dare to say anything and only nodded.","“And send someone to stop the carriage from entering the palace! Stop the memorial to the throne before it reaches the king!”","Princess Rao wanted to stall.","All she needed to do was to keep it a secret until after her birthday party. As long as she could get that Primary Heaven Pill, the eldest prince would be nothing!","Who else could compete with her for the throne?","At that thought, Princess Rao looked pleased.."]},{"number":3844,"title":"Chapter 3844: Investigate (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3844: Investigate (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was true that she hadn’t done anything all these years, but she had been fawning on the Patriarch, and that was the right thing to do!","Princess Rao was very pleased with herself for fawning over the Patriarch.","She smirked inwardly when she saw Caixia leave. It would be great if she could stop the memorial to the throne, but if she couldn’t do it in time...","Princess Rao’s eyes glinted coldly.","She had to get started.","“Come out,” she said coldly.","A gray figure appeared in front of her.","Lowering her voice, Princess Rao gave him instructions on what to do, and the person quickly left after receiving the order.","Before long, Caixia came back, looking displeased.","“Your Royal Highness...” With a long face, Caixia told Princess Rao that the people she sent couldn’t stop the memorial.","Caixia had thought that Princess Rao would vent her anger on her and that she would end up like Feiyu. However, Princess Rao only waved her off and left her with some other instructions.","Back at the shop.","Huyan Yichen ran up to Feng Wu happily and said excitedly, “Feng, I’ve done everything you asked of me. What’s next? What shall we do next?”","Feng Wu wasn’t alone. The eldest prince was with her as well.","Right now, the eldest prince was looking at Huyan Yichen with an aggrieved look in his eyes. He was sitting there, but Huyan Yichen ignored him and was only talking to the girl.","Feng Wu was forging a weapon at the moment. After the arm of discipline, Feng Wu decided to make something else.","Feng Wu had planned to build herself a divine-level armor if she had more divine iron. Although the soft armor Jun Linyuan gave her earlier was very useful, it could protect her from both front and back.","But she was short of divine iron, so she could only make some gadgets that would be useful soon.","Seeing that Huyan Yichen was running happily toward her, Feng Wu glanced at him and didn’t give him another look, for she couldn’t afford to be distracted.","Huyan Yichen wanted to say something, but the eldest prince gave him a warning glance.","Huyan Yichen said, “Your Royal Highness, there you are.”","The prince was so angry that he almost laughed. Why was it so hard to see a","living person like him?","After that, Huyan Yichen just stood there and watched Feng Wu work. He didn’t ask any more questions.","The crown prince rolled his eyes at him. “Aren’t you going to ask what happened after the incident last night?”","Huyan Yichen cried out, “You know?”","That was hilarious. As the eldest prince and one of the heirs to the throne, he had a lot of connections. If he didn’t know, who did? That girl?","Crossing his hands behind his back, the crown prince snorted and waited for Huyan Yichen to ask the question.","But Huyan Yichen didn’t say anything.","The eldest prince took a deep breath and calmed himself down.","Fifteen minutes later, Feng Wu was finally done with her work.","Huyan Yichen asked curiously, “What are you making? It looks like a mosquito.”","Feng Wu nodded. “Does it look like a real mosquito?”","Huyan Yichen looked at it and nodded. “It does look like it! What does it do? Can it explode? Is it an offensive secret weapon?”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “No. It’s a detection device.”","Before Huyan Yichen could react, the prince’s eyes lit up, and he forgot about","his little tantrum.."]},{"number":3845,"title":"Chapter 3845: New Invention (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3845: New Invention (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The prince’s eyes lit up. He quickly walked up to Feng Wu and stared at the inky black mosquito in Feng Wu’s hand.","He looked at Feng Wu in excitement and reached out.","Feng Wu knew that the prince was her business partner these days, and she would have to depend on him if she wanted to meet the Patriarch.","At that thought, Feng Wu put the mosquito in the prince’s hand.","The prince held the mosquito with both hands and examined it closely.","Huyan Yichen rolled his eyes at him. “What’s there to see? It’s just a toy.”","The prince looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment as well. “Is this mosquito... used for detection? Can it fly?”","Feng Wu nodded. No one knew how she did it, but the little thing the size of a black bean slowly rose from the prince’s hand like a real mosquito. It flapped its wings and flew in the air.","“That’s true...” The prince stared at the mosquito and heaved a long sigh. He then turned to Feng Wu. “Did you say this is a detector? How is it going to do that?”","Feng Wu suddenly smiled and asked Huyan Yichen, “Do you want to know what your grandfather is doing?”","Huyan Yichen said, “Isn’t my grandpa sleeping in his room?”","Feng Wu smiled. She then took out a white jade from her chest pocket and drew an inscription on it. The next moment, the mosquito flapped its wings and slowly flew toward old Huyan’s room.","It wasn’t moving very fast and looked like a real mosquito.","Soon, the mosquito stopped outside the room.","Because the door was closed.","Huyan Yichen laughed. “Look, your mosquito is so stupid. It flew around the door and was dumbfounded. After all the effort you’ve put in, what good can it do? It’s useless...","However, Huyan Yichen was soon proven wrong.","When the mosquito found a corner where it couldn’t see clearly, it stuck its head forward and made a small hole.","The rice-sized mosquito then flapped its wings and flew into old Huyan’s room.","Huyan Yichen’s mouth fell open, and he stared at Feng Wu.","“Is... is that even possible?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Why not?”","“But, but... It’s a fake mosquito...” How could it be so smart? It could poke holes with its antennae and choose a blind spot in the corner? That was incredible!","Feng Wu smiled. “It’s only like this because it’s a fake mosquito.”","Meanwhile, the fake mosquito was hovering over old Huyan’s head.","Old Huyan wasn’t asleep. He was sitting at his desk with a pen in his hand. He was writing something, and there were piles of paper scattered all over the floor.","Feng Wu glanced at Huyan Yichen and commented, “Your grandfather’s handwriting really isn’t that good.”","“Huh?” Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “My grandpa’s handwriting... Wait, how do you know how good my grandpa’s handwriting is?","You’ve never seen it before.”","The next moment, Feng Wu unfolded the white jade.","There was a clear image on the white jade.","In the image, Old Man Huyan was sitting at his desk, holding a pen in one hand and scratching his ear with the other. He looked like a hopeless student.","Huyan Yichen cried out.."]},{"number":3846,"title":"Chapter 3846: New Invention (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3846: New Invention (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huyan Yichen pointed at the white jade. “You can see everything!”","Feng Wu nodded matter-of-factly.","Huyan Yichen was still shocked. “I can’t believe it!”","Although the image wasn’t very clear or very big, Huyan Yichen still saw what his grandfather was doing right away. He could even recognize the words he was writing.","“That’s amazing!” Huyan Yichen cried out. “You’ve been working on it this whole time! My grandpa is the best refiner in Northern Yan, but he has never made anything like this!","“They’re inscriptions, aren’t they?” Huyan Yichen studied the white jade plate in Feng Wu’s hand.","Feng Wu nodded and tossed him the white jade plate.","Huyan Yichen caught it in a hurry, fearing that it might break.","As a refiner, how could he not be excited when he saw something so amazing?","The prince was equally excited.","As a scheming man, he had come up with a million ways to make use of the detector. It would no doubt help him in his future competition for the throne!","“Show me.” He wanted to take the token from Huyan Yichen.","But Huyan Yichen wanted to see it as well. He couldn’t bring himself to let go of it, so he clenched his fists.","The prince threw a dirty look at Huyan Yichen.","Huyan Yichen pretended that he didn’t see anything.","The prince feigned an angry tone and asked in a low voice, “Huyan Yichen?”","Huyan Yichen was frustrated. He darted a resentful look at the prince and said reluctantly, “What kind of prince are you? All you ever do is use your power to bully me. Tsk, tsk.”","But no matter how reluctant he was, the prince was still the heir to the throne. Huyan Yichen handed the mosquito to him in frustration.","After taking it, the prince imitated Feng Wu and started working on the detector.","“Hey, it’s coming out!”","Seeing that the mosquito had come out of the little cave after the prince had turned it around, Huyan Yichen moved closer to take a closer look. The aggrieved look on his face was long gone.","What a careless teenager. Feng Wu couldn’t help but glance at Huyan Yichen, and she was affected by his bright smile.","Huyan Yichen reminded her of someone she knew.","Just then, the door opened with a thump.","Old Huyan came out.","But they weren’t looking at the old man. Instead, they were looking at the mosquito that had been hovering over his head.","Old Huyan came out and saw that the eldest prince was also there. He nodded at him.","He then frowned at Feng Wu. “Kiddo, are you sure this plan will work?”","Old Huyan had focused all his attention on forging weapons and didn’t have much of an advantage in terms of strategy. Not only had Feng Wu killed so many Spiritual Overlords, but she had also helped Huyan Yichen to make a breakthrough. Therefore, Old Huyan recognized Feng Wu’s intelligence.","Feng Wu smiled. “Yes.”","Old Huyan frowned. “What’s your plan?”","Feng Wu smiled. “You have the right to report to the king, don’t you? Write a memorial to the throne first.”","Old Huyan blushed. All he ever thought about was forging weapons, and he had never written a memorial to the throne before.","Feng Wu said, “Actually, you don’t need to write anything fancy. You can just hand in a piece of paper. It’s just a formality.”","Both Old Huyan and the prince looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment.. What did she mean by that? What would the blank paper do?"]},{"number":3847,"title":"Chapter 3847: New Plan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3847: New Plan","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Neither of them asked that question, but Huyan Yichen asked curiously, “What do you mean? This is a memorial to His Majesty. You can’t just hand in blank sheets.”","Feng Wu only smiled mysteriously and didn’t say anything.","The less Feng Wu said the more curious Huyan Yichen became. He nudged Feng Wu’s arm and said anxiously, “Just tell me.”","Having no other choice, Feng Wu sighed and waved at the three of them.","Hence, the three of them gathered around and formed a circle.","A few steps away, Quan Xi, the prince’s personal guard, couldn’t believe his eyes.","Wasn’t the prince supposed to be aloof and unapproachable? But now, he was eavesdropping with his back arched and his buttocks raised... Was he still the prince and the future king?!","Feng Wu had no idea what was going on in the guard’s head. She summarized her plan in a few words.","Huyan Yichen was the first to be astonished.","“You... You’re making such a big deal out of this! Gosh!” Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu as if he was looking at a god. His eyes were twinkling with admiration.","Old Huyan’s face darkened, and he waved his hand. “No!”","Huyan Yichen was about to speak, but Feng Wu beat him to it. Feng Wu glanced at old Huyan. “I didn’t ask for your opinion.” Old Huyan glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said casually, “I’m only telling you the plan.”","Old Huyan flared up. “Who gave you the right to specify this plan?”","Feng Wu said, “Myself.”","Old Huyan smirked. “Yourself? You’re just a good-for-nothing with no spiritual essence. What kind of capability do you have?”","Feng Wu only smiled at him.","Old Huyan suddenly realized that although the girl wasn’t capable, she had already proved how lethal she was. She was indeed terrifying.","“Ahem... What I’m saying is that we can think about it.” Old Huyan’s tone softened a little.","Huyan Yichen gave the old man a strange look. The old man had always been a stubborn man, but he had just given in. What an eye-opener!","Huyan Yichen admired Feng Wu even more now. How could she be so capable?!","The old man glanced at the prince, indicating that it was time for him to intervene.","After all, Feng Wu’s plan would scare the wits out of anyone. She was so bold!","However, the prince only smiled and said to Feng Wu, “I think it’ll work.”","What?","Old Huyan stared at the prince in disbelief.","The prince smiled a little and nodded at old Huyan. “We’ll give it a go.” Old Huyan was so angry that he almost had an internal injury.","Just then, his favorite grandson chimed in, his eyes twinkling. “Grandpa, I think so, too!”","Old Huyan was furious. “What are you...”","Just then, Feng Wu chuckled. “Are you sure you don’t want to clean up the mess?”","Huh? Old Huyan stared at Feng Wu in bewilderment.","Afraid of getting hit, his grandson had already run up to Feng Wu. He stuck his head out and looked at old Huyan. “That’s right, Grandpa. Your room is covered with waste paper. Is it that difficult to write a memorial to the throne? You usually force me to read, but you can’t do it yourself.”","The old man looked astonished.","How did they know that?","However, his first reaction was to deny it. Glaring at Huyan Yichen with a darkened face, he said, “Nonsense! I can write memorials to the throne!”","Huyan Yichen snapped, “Grandpa, stop pretending. You look just like me when you were struggling.”","The old man blushed and wanted to smack Huyan Yichen, but Huyan Yichen showed him the white jade plate. “Grandpa, look! It’s all there! We saw everything!”","Old Huyan was dumbfounded when he saw the image on the white jade plate.","Because the mosquito was hovering over his head, he saw himself.","He looked from Feng Wu to Huyan Yichen. “What’s going on? This is...” The old man spun around in excitement.","As a top-notch weapon refiner, he knew much better than Huyan Yichen did. He knew exactly how amazing this thing was.","“Do you want to...”Old Huyan stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded earnestly.","Old Huyan said, “That’s why you’re so sure... But someone still needs to...” Feng Wu operated the jade plate, and with a thump, flames shot out!","The fire was aimed at the old man’s head, so fast that no one had time to react.","Old Huyan’s white hair was on fire!","By the time old Huyan put out the fire, he only had half of his hair left.","However, not only wasn’t he angry, but he even held the mosquito as if it were a treasure. “This is a treasure... Where did this come from? The Patriarch was here?!”","Huyan Yichen said grumpily, “Of course not! Boss Feng made it!”","Huyan Yichen had been addressing Feng Wu as “ugly girl”, but he had changed it to “Miss Feng” the day before and was now “Boss Feng”.","Old Huyan, on the other hand, was so excited to see the mosquito in his hands that he wanted to take it apart and study it!","Huyan Yichen said anxiously, “Grandpa, this mosquito is very useful. Please don’t destroy it!”","Old Huyan asked, “Are there more?”","Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu shook her head. “There’s one more, but it’s not loaded with high-explosive bullets.”","After that, Feng Wu handed the other unused one to Old Huyan.","After taking it, Old Huvan didn’t care about Feng Wu’s Dlan anvmore. He shut himself in a small black room and studied the mosquito with all his attention.","To him, nothing could excite him more than studying something new.","After sending Old Huyan away, Feng Wu let out a breath of relief as well. She then turned to the eldest prince. “Shall we begin?”","The prince smiled and stuck out his right hand like Feng Wu did the day before. “Happy working with you.”","“Happy working with you.” Feng Wu drew back her hand after a light touch, and the prince marched off after her.","He would be the one to carry out the plan.","According to Feng Wu, if this could happen, Princess Rao, who had lost some of her strength, would suffer a huge loss.."]},{"number":3848,"title":"Chapter 3848: Ongoing (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3848: Ongoing (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the royal palace of Northern Yan.","Princess Rao entered the palace.","She went to the imperial study first and was stopped at the door because His Majesty was going through the memorials and no one was to disturb him. Princess Rao’s face was as calm as still water. She then whispered something in the eunuch’s ear.","However, the young eunuch shook his head with a pale face.","Princess Rao frowned and said coldly, “His Majesty will leave when the time comes!”","Hearing that, the young eunuch finally nodded, as if he was ready to die.","Seeing that he had stiffened and slowed down, Princess Rao warned him, “If you tell anyone, you’ll be decapitated!”","The young eunuch shuddered. He then straightened his back and moved naturally.","After that, Princess Rao quickly went to see her mother.","The queen was sipping her tea, and the atmosphere in the palace was very peaceful.","However, when Princess Rao told her about the current situation, the queen frowned. “Is that true?","Princess Rao didn’t behave like a peacock in front of the queen. Instead, she looked very innocent.","The queen was sitting, and Princess Rao knelt down in front of her. She buried her face in the queen’s palm and said, “Mother, all seven Spiritual Overlords are dead. Huyan Yichen still won’t let me go. He’s going to report to my father. Mother...”","“Huyan Yichen isn’t capable enough to do that.” The queen didn’t seem flustered at all. She remained unperturbed. After taking a sip of her tea, she said with a grim look on her face, “The eldest prince is involved now. He’s the only one who’s capable enough to do that. He’s also the one who wants to take you down.”","“Mother, I don’t think my brother is the only one. There’s also that mysterious girl.” The ordinary-looking girl appeared in Princess Rao’s mind. She wasn’t all that stunning, but her eyes were like twinkling stars in the night sky!","Hence, she told the king about the girl who had shown up in the shop, but the queen didn’t think much of it. “She’s just a girl with no spiritual essence. What’s important is to hush this thing up.”","The queen stared at Princess Rao. “What are you going to do?”","Princess Rao said, “What happened happened. Huyan Yichen and my brother were the witnesses. It was said that the head of the Punishment Office went to examine the scene, and they have all seven dead Spiritual Overlords. The head has sent a memorial to the throne, and it can blow up at any moment.” The queen’s face darkened.","Princess Rao said, “We have two options now. One is to admit to my father what I’ve done, but I’m sure he won’t forgive me that easily...","“The second option is to burn the memorial!”","Empress Dugu said, “Even if we do that, the office head can always write another one.”","Princess Rao said, “I’ll go see him myself and ask him to stall for a few days. I’m sure it’ll work!”","Empress Dugu asked, “What about Huyan Yichen or your brother? Are they going to wait?”","Princess Rao said, “I just need a few more days. How about...’","She whispered something in the queen’s ear.","“How dare you!” The queen smacked the table and glared at Princess Rao. Princess Rao immediately knelt down and put on a pitiful look.","The queen threw a dirty look at her.","Princess Rao tugged at the queen’s sleeve. ‘Mother, I’ll be fine when the Patriarch comes out of his seclusion.. I’ll be fine when I have the pill for my birthday...”"]},{"number":3849,"title":"Chapter 3849: Ongoing (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3849: Ongoing (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The queen took a deep breath. “You... That’s enough. Get up!”","Princess Rao smiled with tears in her eyes. “Mother, would you like to help","The queen jabbed a finger in her forehead. “If I don’t help you, who am I going to help? Your brother?”","After that, the queen gave some instructions to her maid, who nodded and quickly walked away.","Princess Rao said, “Mother, you’re...”","The queen said, “Your father dotes on Concubine Mei these days. Let her go.” “Mother, that’s brilliant!” Princess Rao was over the moon.","As expected, after Lady Mei coaxed the king away, the study was empty.","Princess Rao finally let out a breath of relief and told her mother, “Mother, don’t worry. I’ve arranged for someone in the study to burn the memorials. As for Father... Mother, how about you let him stay sick for a few days?","“When that happens, my brother and Huyan Yichen won’t dare to disturb him, and the office head can only postpone the investigation indefinitely.”","The empress frowned. “Your father isn’t just anyone. I’m afraid that ordinary medicine...","Just then, Princess Rao took a potion out of her chest pocket and handed it to the queen.","The queen was confused. “What’s that?”","“It’s a Semi-divine potion,” said Princess Rao in a low voice. “Let him drink it, and he’ll...”","The queen didn’t like the idea, but Princess Rao kept persuading her and said, “My father is with Concubine Mei. Even if something happens, Concubine Mei will be the one to answer for it... So, Mother, what are you afraid of?”","The queen agreed. If she could get rid of Concubine Mei with this incident...","“But I’m the one who recommended Concubine Mei. She’s still useful. It’ll be such a shame to destroy her now.” The queen sounded reluctant.","Princess Rao smirked. “Mother, you’re too kind. Haven’t you noticed? Concubine Mei has been getting more and more disobedient in the past few months, and she’s been behaving like a spoiled child now and then.” The queen paled a little.","Princess Rao said, “You did recommend her to the king, but now that she’s earned my father’s favor, she doesn’t think it’s because of you anymore.","Mother, she’s disloyal.”","“Raoxi!” The queen’s voice was authoritative.","But Princess Rao wasn’t afraid.","“Mother, you have to prove that you can make her popular but can also tramp her to death. That way, she’ll be obedient. Otherwise, she’ll jump around even more and backfire on you. Can you accept that?”","The queen was lost in her thoughts.","Princess Rao was still trying to persuade her. “This is our best chance. Mother, we can kill two birds with one stone!”","The queen said, “I’ll think about it.”","Semi-divine potion aside, things didn’t go as smoothly as Princess Rao thought.","That was because...","The study was on fire!","Little Liu, the young eunuch, didn’t know what happened.","When His Majesty wasn’t around, he opened the door and snuck in to look for the memorial. However, he couldn’t find it after searching for a long time, and somehow, there was a fire all of a sudden.","He didn’t use any fire.","Why was the room on fire all of a sudden?","Little Liu was confused.","Apart from him, there was only one mosquito flying around...","To make it worse, when he tried to run, he realized that the door was locked. There was no way he could get away!","Gosh!","Little Liu thought he was going to lose his mind.","Flames quickly swept across the study, which was filled with flammable paper and wood..."]},{"number":3850,"title":"Chapter 3850: Northern Yan Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 3850: Northern Yan Palace","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The queen and Princess Rao rose to their feet when they heard the news.","The queen threw a dirty look at Princess Rao. “Did you order someone to burn down the study?!”","Things would get out of hand if the study was burnt down.","This wasn’t a small matter anymore. It was a matter of great importance! All the officials would be involved, and it would get out of hand!","Princess Rao was equally dumbfounded.","She couldn’t understand it. Everything had been going smoothly for her until recently. Now, nothing seemed to go as planned.","Everything seemed to have changed since she started targeting Feng Wu.","The queen threw a dirty look at Princess Rao. “You really didn’t order the imperial study to be burnt down?”","Princess Rao tried to explain. “Mother, why should I burn the study? What good will it do for me?”","The queen agreed, but it was still troublesome.","“Get rid of that eunuch before you’re incriminated!” She cast a stern look at Princess Rao.","Princess Rao nodded and was about to get down to business, but Empress Dugu stopped her. “Forget it. I’ll take care of everything in the palace. Just stay out of it and pretend you don’t know anything.”","Princess Rao immediately went up to the queen and held her arm. “Mother, I know you’re the best. When I become the crown princess, I’ll share Northern","Yan with you.”","The queen liked the sound of that. She nodded with a smile.","However, the eldest prince was behind this, and it wouldn’t be so easy for the queen to get rid of him. The more she tried, the more mistakes she would make.","The eldest prince had never been so happy.","Ever since his father put him on the same level as Princess Rao, he had been having a hard time. Princess Rao had the queen and the Patriarch behind her, but he had no one but himself.","As a result, he had been losing ground this whole time...","However, it worked wonders when he teamed up with Feng Wu. He now had a lot of evidence on Princess Rao.","Needless to say, the mosquito had set the study on fire.","She was indeed a genius girl of the Junwu Empire... The prince sighed inwardly.","He had no idea when she had come up with this plan, but it had slowly trapped Princess Rao.","And Lady Mei...","Suppressing his excitement, the prince went on with what he was going to do.","After leaving Princess Rao to the prince, Feng Wu had nothing better to do. However, she didn’t stay idle either, for she still remembered her goal.","She had to see Huyan Yanbo as soon as possible...","“I need to go to court,” Feng Wu told Huyan Yichen. Huyan Yichen cried out, “Go to court? Now?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Now.”","Huyan Yichen was confused. “What are we doing in court? Is it that urgent?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes. I thought you wanted to take revenge for your sister.”","Huyan Yichen asked excitedly, “Can we kill Huyan Hongjun now?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “Soon.”","Huyan Yichen was excited. “Alright, I’ll do it for you. But after we get to the imperial palace...”","Feng Wu said, “Just send me to the prince.”","Feng Wu could have gone to court herself if she took a little risk, but since she had other means, why should she?","Huyan Yichen went off to work, and he came back to report to Feng Wu five minutes later.."]},{"number":3851,"title":"Chapter 3851: Northern Yan Palace (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3851: Northern Yan Palace (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huyan Yichen was ready in five minutes. He told Feng Wu that she could go to court now.","As expected...","Huyan Yichen was a capable man. He escorted Feng Wu to the eldest prince.","The prince was surprised to see Feng Wu, but with his capability, he could arrange for Feng Wu to stay with him. “Just pretend to be my maid,” said the prince.","Feng Wu nodded.","However, he was still curious. “Why are you in such a hurry to go to court in the middle of the night?”","Feng Wu said simply, “I’m waiting for someone.”","The prince asked, “Who are we waiting for?”","Feng Wu smiled. “Your Patriarch, of course.”","Both the prince and Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","They trusted Feng Wu’s capability, so they knew that she wasn’t lying. If she said she was waiting for something, she probably was.","“The Patriarch will be here today? How...” The prince shook his head. Feng Wu glanced at him and said, “Keep an eye on your father tonight.” The prince’s stomach lurched. “My father...”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, she heard an anxious voice a short distance away.","“Master, quickly, come to the plum garden...” It was a young eunuch sent by the eldest prince.","The prince couldn’t help but glance at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded. “I’m coming with you.”","The prince was about to say something when Feng Wu grinned. “I’m a good doctor. I’m a Semi-divine medicine refiner.” Gosh!","Both the prince and Huyan Yichen coughed.","Huyan Yichen said grumpily, “I would believe you if you said you were a","Supreme Level medicine refiner, but a Semi-divine one? Don’t make me laugh.”","Feng Wu shrugged. She wasn’t joking this time, but the others didn’t believe her. Fine.","The prince quickly led Feng Wu toward Lady Mei’s courtyard. Before they entered, they heard Lady Mei sobbing.","“I have no idea...","“His Majesty just suddenly... It was all my fault...”","She kept talking between broken sobs.","Because of the fire in the study and the sudden stroke of the Northern Yan king, the imperial palace was in a mess.","Many physicians were already treating the king when the prince went in, but they were all too terrified to do anything.","Although the king had had a stroke, he was still conscious. He was staring at them with his terrifying eyes.","The queen didn’t expect this either...","She had never expected that the potion would give the king a stroke!","As a matter of fact, the king hadn’t appointed an heir yet, and the Patriarch had never mentioned that Princess Rao had gained his support. The princess had always been the one to talk about it.","However, the officials were obviously on the prince’s side. Therefore, it wouldn’t do Princess Rao any good if the king died.","The queen’s face was livid, and the look she gave Princess Rao was rather frightening.","Princess Rao was dumbfounded.","Wasn’t it a Semi-divine potion? She had spent a small fortune on it to keep her father unconscious for a few days. That way, all eyes would be on her father’s illness, and no one would bother him over such a petty matter.","It was all part of Princess Rao’s plan, but the king was indeed sick. He had a stroke and was physically paralyzed. However, his eyes were so wide open that he looked like he wanted to eat someone alive.."]},{"number":3852,"title":"Chapter 3852: Meet the Patriarch (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3852: Meet the Patriarch (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","King Yan was furious.","He had no idea what was going on.","He only came here to take a break at Concubine Mei’s place when he heard that the study was on fire.","He had to go to study as soon as he received the news, but somehow, he fell out of bed. Not only did he crack his head, but he couldn’t move either. It was as if he had had a stroke.","Had he really had a stroke? The thought made the king uneasy, but the physicians didn’t know what to do.","Not only that, but they also tried to shirk responsibility from each other. No one dared to step out to take the blame, which infuriated the king..","Even with the queen here, things didn’t get any better.","The king’s eyes lit up when he thought of a certain person. He then stared at Princess Rao.","Princess Rao didn’t understand at first. She knelt in front of the king, held his hand, and cried.","The king was frustrated.","He could barely move his eyes, but after trying his best, he only managed to twitch an eyelash. As it turned out, Princess Rao didn’t understand at all. How stupid could she be?","The eldest prince seemed to realize something and asked gingerly, “Father, do you mean that you want the Patriarch to come here?” The king’s eyelashes quivered again.","It was very difficult to meet the Patriarch, even for the king.","But now that he was like this, the only person that could save him was the Patriarch.","Princess Rao immediately realized what he wanted.","“That’s right. The Patriarch is invincible. I’m sure he’ll know what to do. I’m sure he can save my father.”","Wiping away her tears, Princess Rao looked at the king in delight. “Father, please wait. I’ll go to the Patriarch now. If he doesn’t come, I’ll kneel and kowtow until he comes with me.”","The king was so pleased that his eyelashes quivered again.","“I’ll go now!” Princess Rao soon left.","Meanwhile, the queen let out a breath of relief.","As long as the Patriarch was here, he would be able to save His Majesty. Moreover, after His Majesty was saved, half of the credit would go to Raoxi, which would benefit her greatly.","At that thought, the queen smiled even wider.","She had already forgotten that it was the eldest prince who had reminded her to bring the Patriarch here.","Meanwhile, the prince looked confused. It was obvious that the arrival of the Patriarch would benefit Raoxi, but why did Feng Wu say that it would benefit him this time?","That was right. Feng Wu had reminded him on their way here.","Raoxi returned sooner than they expected.","The king looked past her shoulder.","Right now, Raoxi was all by herself. There was no one behind her.","Was the Patriarch not coming? The king panicked a little.","He wasn’t the only one. The others panicked as well.","Was the Patriarch away, or was he unable to treat the king?","No one thought that it was the second possibility because he was omnipotent.","However, the first thing Raoxi said was, “The Patriarch is in the tower, but he said he wasn’t coming and that we should send my father to him.” No one noticed that Little Zhao, the king’s eunuch, had been dragged to a","corner.."]},{"number":3853,"title":"Chapter 3853: Meet the Patriarch (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3853: Meet the Patriarch (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu reacted quickly.","She had planned for so long just to meet that legendary Patriarch.","She had thought that the Patriarch would come here to treat the king, but the old man was more respected than she had expected. He had asked the apoplexy-stricken king to go to him.","Under normal circumstances, Feng Wu wouldn’t be able to get in. She could only see the old man if she became someone close to the king.","Feng Wu had been lying in wait since the first time she met Princess Rao. No, she hadn’t started even before meeting the princess, but it was time to take action.","Soon, Feng Wu disguised herself as Little Zhao, and the real one was hidden away by the eldest prince’s men.","That was how convenient it was to have someone in court.","The eldest prince wasn’t included in the group that headed for the tower.","Thanks to Princess Rao’s subtle hints over the years, everyone had come to the conclusion that she was the closest to the Patriarch, who didn’t like the eldest prince at all.","In the end, the queen, Princess Rao, and a few eunuchs and maids went with the king.","Little Zhao, whom Feng Wu had impersonated, was among them.","Soon, they arrived at the tower.","The tower that wasn’t open to outsiders had countless seals, and ordinary people couldn’t get in. Right now, there was a giant eagle that was as tall as a grown man. It stood on its hind legs and stared coldly at the crowd.","The seals on the door had been lifted, but the eagle wasn’t happy to see so many people. It spoke in human language and sounded impatient. “No! There are too many people!”","The queen stepped out and smiled obsequiously. “We’ve left quite a few people behind so that we won’t disturb the Patriarch. How about...’","However, the eagle reprimanded her without hesitation. “Aren’t you going to disturb all these people?”","The queen blushed at the giant eagle’s reprimand, but she didn’t dare to retort.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was talking to Little Phoenix.","“Is that that bird?” Feng Wu asked curiously.","However, Little Phoenix turned its head away and pretended that it didn’t hear her.","However, Feng Wu wasn’t going to let it go. She asked with a smile, “Is it the eagle that has stopped you from going in and fighting with you?” Little Phoenix looked embarrassed and ignored Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was laughing inwardly.","By then, the eagle had finished scolding the queen and told them, “No more than three!”","Three? That included the king.","That was to say, apart from the king, only two people could go in.","Both the king and Princess Rao had to go in. As for the rest of the people...","Princess Rao smiled obsequiously. “Grandpa Eagle, when are we going to come out? Do we need to go into seclusion?”","The giant eagle didn’t like Princess Rao much and said coldly, “You’re coming out when the king recovers. Do you want to leave alone? Opening the seal is a big deal!”","Princess Rao was rendered speechless.","Feng Wu looked at Princess Rao in bewilderment. That didn’t sound right. According to Princess Rao, the Patriarch doted on her. Why would his eagle scold her? Moreover, it didn’t show her any respect and was only slightly better than when it spoke to the queen.","It didn’t take the princess long to make up her mind. She and the king would go in, and she would bring a maid with her. Of course, that was to take care of her father.."]},{"number":3854,"title":"Chapter 3854: Meet the Patriarch (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3854: Meet the Patriarch (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, when Princess Rao lowered her head, she didn’t see a young eunuch quickly approach the eagle and stuff something under its wing.","A bribe? The giant eagle smirked inwardly. It wasn’t the kind of eagle that could be bought off!","However, the giant eagle’s eyes lit up when it saw what it was, and it put it away with a straight face.","It said, “Only two people will come in. The king and you!” After that, the giant eagle picked up one with each wing.","One was the king, and the other one was Feng Wu.","The seal began to close as soon as the giant eagle pulled the two of them in. By then, Princess Rao finally realized what had happened, but it was too late.","“Why is this happening?!”","Princess Rao couldn’t believe her eyes. She couldn’t believe that the eagle had turned her away!","The door quickly closed.","Princess Rao and the queen looked at each other. It would be very difficult for them to go in now.","The queen narrowed her eyes and gave Princess Rao a questioning look.","Involuntarily, the princess lowered her gaze.","The queen took a deep breath and fought back her anger. Luckily, they were all on the same side here, so there was no need to spread rumors.","“I’m sure His Majesty will be alright.” The queen left two people outside the tower while she took Princess Rao back to the imperial palace.","As for what the mother and daughter had discussed in the bedchamber behind closed doors, no one knew.","All the maids in the imperial palace knew was that the queen had smashed a cup!","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had been taken into the tower by the giant eagle, and the sealed door was closed. It was almost impossible for her to get out.","Feng Wu was happy, but Little Phoenix was dumbfounded.","“Are we in?”","Little Phoenix couldn’t believe its eyes.","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “That’s right.”","Little Phoenix said, “And that princess isn’t qualified to come in!”","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “That’s right.”","Little Phoenix said, “Because you gave the ugly eagle something?!”","Feng Wu chuckled. “It’s not just a little thing. It’s something I found in the Hua family.”","Little Phoenix shook its head.","Had it known that things would turn out this way, it would have saved Feng Wu all the trouble. So many things had happened, and so many things could have gone wrong.","Little Phoenix was so frustrated.","Feng Wu, on the other hand, didn’t think Little Phoenix would bring itself to bribe the eagle.","With her sharp eyes, Feng Wu could tell right away that the giant eagle was full of Yang energy and that the Yin energy was damaged. It just so happened that she had stolen a treasure from the Hua family’s vault that could nourish the Yin energy, which was why the giant eagle was over the moon.","It treated Feng Wu better than it treated the king.","It put Feng Wu down first before putting the king down on the bed, and Feng Wu could tell it wasn’t as gentle when it handled the latter.","This giant eagle was an interesting bird.","Apart from a stone bed, there was nothing else in the spacious room.","The king’s eyes were still wide open. That was to say, he could see and sense everything, but he couldn’t speak or move.."]},{"number":3855,"title":"Chapter 3855: Meet the Patriarch (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3855: Meet the Patriarch (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu wondered when the Patriarch would arrive.","She was a little excited at the thought that she would soon meet her legendary sixth senior brother.","Before long, the stone door opened on its own.","Feng Wu and the giant eagle looked in the direction of the door.","An old man with white hair and beard walked out of the door with an indifferent look on his face. The look in his eyes was so cold that no one dared to approach him.","The giant eagle dared to scold the queen, but when the old man was around, it lowered its head obediently.","“It’s him! It’s him!” Little Phoenix’s excited voice rang out in Feng Wu’s head, and it murmured, “But why is he like this? Why is he so old? He’s as ugly as everyone else when he’s old!”","Little Phoenix’s last sentence almost amused Feng Wu, and she had to fight back her laughter.","However, it still caught the Patriarch’s attention.","He turned his sharp gaze on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu immediately lowered her head and didn’t dare to make any unnecessary movements.","The old man didn’t pay much attention to Feng Wu. After all, she was playing a young eunuch now.","The Patriarch walked up to the emperor, examined him, and checked his pulse.","Emperor Yan was relieved to see the Patriarch. The old man was omnipotent, so he was sure that he would be alright.","However, he frowned as soon as he checked the king’s pulse.","Before long, he heaved a long sigh and shook his head.","What was that supposed to mean?","The old man said, “It’s not easy to treat you.”","The king was dumbfounded.","The old man shook his head again. “No one can cure you.”","The king was shocked.","What happened to the omnipotent Patriarch?!","Was he going to stay this way forever?","“Hm!”","The king struggled violently and had a strong desire to live.","He didn’t want to stay bed-ridden like this. He still had his kingdom to run and his ambitions to achieve...","However, the Patriarch heaved a long sigh.","“If my master were here, he might be able to save you. I’m not good at medicine, so there’s nothing I can do.”","The old man looked frustrated and sad.","He looked up at the small window on the east side and said, “Master, where are you? I’ve missed you.”","He burst into tears after that.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","She had always thought that the Patriarch was an invincible ruler, but as it turned out, he was someone who would cry.","Little Phoenix said grumpily, “I told you already. Yanbo was picked up by your master when he was little. He used to cry all the time. He’s old now, but he’s","still like that.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say when she saw the way Little Phoenix commented on the Patriarch.","He was the Patriarch of Northern Yan, not a crybaby! If other people heard what the bird said, they would probably kill Little Phoenix.","The king looked at the old man in resignation. He was probably used to the old man’s nostalgia for his master, so he remained very calm.."]},{"number":3856,"title":"Chapter 3856: Junior Sister (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3856: Junior Sister (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Help me...” The king had no choice but to remind the Patriarch.","He used all his strength to say those words.","The Patriarch glanced at the king and heaved a sigh. “I’ll send you some spiritual essence. That’s my only option. Let’s see how much it can help you.” Cure him? That was impossible.","The king couldn’t believe his eyes. Wasn’t the Patriarch supposed to be omnipotent?","But... he was right. The Patriarch was indeed an expert in refining weapons, but his medical skills...","As expected...","When the Patriarch injected his spiritual essence into the king’s internal organs, it did help with his condition. At least, he could talk now.","“Thank you, master.” The king let out a breath of relief.","It was already a big step for him to be able to speak again. He just needed to hold on a little longer...","However, as soon as he thought that, the Patriarch shattered his hope.","“Don’t overthink it. I’ve done everything I can. There’s nothing else I can do,” the Patriarch said indifferently.","The king was baffled.","Although he could speak, he still couldn’t move.","“Master, what should I...","The king had a lot of respect for the Patriarch.","The Patriarch waved his hand and said calmly, “Unfortunately, my second senior brother isn’t here. He’s the best doctor. If we can find him, we may be able to treat you.”","“Then, where can we...” the king asked.","The old man looked nostalgic again. He waved his hand and rose to his feet.","“Master, Master...” The king panicked. What was going on? Was he going to be like this forever?","However, the old man didn’t stop just because of that.","Just then, the young eunuch, who had been standing next to the king’s bed, moved. He ran after the old man.","The king was pleased. Little Zhao was indeed a loyal servant.","Meanwhile, “Little Zhao” followed the Patriarch out of the room.","The old man frowned when he heard the noise, but he didn’t linger. No one could catch up with him.","Just then, Feng Wu suddenly called out, “Huyan Yanbo!”","Feng Wu’s voice almost frightened the eagle to death.","That name, that name... It threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and was going to drag her out!","However, at that moment, a little bird flew out and blocked the eagle’s way.","The two birds started fighting right away.","Huyan... Yanbo?","The Patriarch stopped abruptly when he heard that name.","It had been years since anyone used that name, so long that he had forgotten about it.","He suddenly turned around and saw a young eunuch standing a short distance away.","Looking past Feng Wu, the old man looked to his left and right, but there was no one there. He must have been hallucinating.","“Senior Brother Huyan.” Feng Wu wiped the disguise off her face and showed him her real face.","The Patriarch narrowed his eyes. That face...","‘You!”","Patriarch Huyan quickly walked up to Feng Wu and stared at her. “You’re... Junior Sister! Are you really her?”","He was thrilled.","“Although there’s only a 50% to 60% resemblance,... are you really my junior sister?! ” Exhilarated, Patriarch Huyan burst into tears.."]},{"number":3857,"title":"Chapter 3857: Junior Sister (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3857: Junior Sister (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She had thought that it would take a lot of effort to convince her sixth senior brother, but as it turned out, he was already addressing her as “junior sister”. Feng Wu was confused. “How do you know I’m her?”","Patriarch Huyan nodded repeatedly. “Yes! You look just like her! Although you don’t look exactly the same, you’re definitely my junior sister! I didn’t know you were really reincarnated! You’re so cruel!”","Feng Wu was dumbfounded. What reincarnation? What cruelty? She didn’t understand.","Feng Wu wanted to ask more questions, but Master Huyan suddenly stopped and smiled bitterly. “Oh my, what am I talking about?”","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","Patriarch Huyan waved his hands repeatedly. “The secrets of heaven cant be divulged. If that happens, my master will kill me when he comes back. By the way...”","Patriarch Huyan’s eyes lit up. Grabbing Feng Wu, he asked excitedly, “Junior","Sister, where’s my master? Have you seen him? Is he really alive?”","Feng Wu asked, “How do you know that?”","Patriarch Huyan said excitedly, “My master is invincible and omnipotent. He’s survived ten thousand tribulations, and he’s been everywhere! How can he be dead? Even if everyone in this world is dead, he’s still alive!”","Feng Wu thought, “This old man is such a loyal fan of my beautiful master.” Feng Wu looked back at the stone room.","Only then did Patriarch Huyan realize what was going on. He told the eagle, “Take him back to the imperial palace!”","He couldn’t talk to his junior sister while an outsider was there.","He had a lot of questions for his junior sister.","Just then, Feng Wu chuckled. “If we send the king out, everyone will know that","their Patriarch isn’t omnipotent.”","The old man said grumpily, “I never am! They can say whatever they want!” Feng Wu said, “Isn’t that a humiliation to our sect?”","The old man said, “Too bad that your second senior brother died in the war.","Otherwise, his medical skills would be incredible. He can treat anything. He’s a","Semi-divine medicine refiner, second only to my master.”","“A Semi-divine medicine refiner?” Feng Wu rubbed her chin.","Patriarch Huyan nodded. “That’s right. He’s very impressive. Unfortunately...”","Before he could finish, Feng Wu smiled. “Sixth Senior Brother, I can treat the king.”","Patriarch Huyan looked at Feng Wu in amazement. “You?”","He didn’t think his junior sister could do it because she didn’t have medical skills back then.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes, I can. I’m the reason he’s like this now.”","After that, Feng Wu told him everything, starting from how she came all the way from the Junwu Empire to see Huyan Yanbo. After much hardship, she finally arrived at the Northern Yan Kingdom but was stopped by the tower. She was going to fly Little Phoenix in, but the bird couldn’t make it. In the end, she had no choice but to use this method.","Patriarch Huyan’s mouth fell open... Was his junior sister still so capable after she reincarnated?","She had single-handedly shaken the entire Northern Yan Kingdom and dragged the king down with her. That was incredible!","“Wait! Brother Phoenix?!” Patriarch Huyan cried out. Looking over his shoulder, he saw a little bird on Feng Wu’s shoulder.."]},{"number":3858,"title":"Chapter 3858: Junior Sister (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3858: Junior Sister (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It reminded him of when the bird used to stand on his master’s shoulder.","Patriarch Huyan was so excited that his face turned scarlet red, and he burst into tears.","“Brother Phoenix! ”","Seeing Little Phoenix, Master Huyan was so excited that he almost burst into tears again.","Feng Wu sighed inwardly. Little Phoenix was right. The old man was indeed a crybaby.","When Little Phoenix landed on Huyan Yanbo’s shoulder, the giant eagle shuddered.","What the heck?!","They knew the Patriarch?","Little Phoenix was complaining to Patriarch Huyan and wouldn’t stop talking. It even glanced at the giant eagle, which scared the latter out of its wits.","“How dare that bird stop you? I’ll smack it for you!” Patriarch Huyan was on Little Phoenix’s side.","The giant eagle almost burst into tears. “But it didn’t say that it knew you...”","The giant eagle was a very capable cultivator at the peak of the Spiritual","Overlord stage. It could stop Little Phoenix, and everyone would address it as “Master Eagle”. Even if the queen was here, it could use the power of Master Huyan to scold her. But now, it was terrified.","Master Huyan didn’t expect that Master Phoenix, who used to be so capable, couldn’t even defeat a little eagle. He felt so sorry for the bird.","However, it pained Patriarch Huyan to hear what Little Phoenix said about Feng wu.","“Junior Sister, you’ve lost your cultivation ability, haven’t you?” Patriarch Huyan checked Feng Wu’s pulse in a hurry. “Good. It’s only temporary. If it’s permanent, even the Primordial Heaven Pill will be useless.”","Patriarch Huyan let out a breath of relief and led Feng Wu inside. “Our master let me hold onto such a pill, and I’ve been guarding it for you for years. I didn’t expect to see you here.”","Recalling a rumor, Feng Wu asked curiously, “But Sixth Senior Brother, didn’t they say that Princess Raoxi would be given this pill for her birthday this year?”","However, Patriarch Huyan’s eyes widened. “Raoxi? Who’s that?”","Feng Wu cleared her throat and pointed at the king. “His daughter.”","“Oh, you mean her,” said Patriarch Huyan. “She does come here quite often to clean the tower, but she never stays long, and she’s not allowed inside. By the way, what did you say? What about her birthday?”","Feng Wu was astonished.","Cleaning?","Did Princess Raoxi come to the tower just to clean the place? But Feng Wu remembered that the rumor she heard was...","Feng Wu couldn’t help but ask that question.","Patriarch Huyan frowned. “She’s here to clean the room, isn’t she? With a bucket and a cloth?”","The last part of the question was directed at the giant eagle.","After all, there was only one person and one eagle in the tower.","The giant eagle nodded. “That’s right. She’ll be here in two days. You’ll see.” Taking Feng Wu’s hand, Patriarch Huyan said, “Let’s go. Your cultivation level is the most important thing. You don’t need to worry about such petty things.” After that, he tried to drag Feng Wu away.","Feng Wu tossed a bottle of potion to the eagle. “This is to treat the king. One dose a day, and he’ll be fine in three days.”","The giant eagle immediately said yes.","Patriarch Huyan, on the other hand, didn’t have time for such petty things. Ever since Feng Wu showed up, he had been paying all his attention to her. All he could think of was how to help Feng Wu recover her ability and improve her physical strength.."]},{"number":3859,"title":"Chapter 3859: Junior Sister (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3859: Junior Sister (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Here we go!”","Patriarch Huyan smacked his own head. “How could I have forgotten about it?! The pill is meant for you! Let’s go!”","He dragged Feng Wu away.","In the main hall.","Patriarch Huyan checked Feng Wu’s pulse again and let out a breath of relief. “Good. You’ll be back to normal in three days.”","After that, he took out the treasure he had been keeping for years and handed it to Feng Wu. “This is the Primary Heaven Pill. Take it.”","Feng Wu finally saw the legendary pill.","It was the size of a baby’s fist and was as fair and plump as a steamed bun.","However, the dense spiritual essence was almost spilling out of the pill. One breath and Feng Wu felt as if all her cells had been activated! The spiritual essence was so dense that it seemed to reach her soul!","Feng Wu looked at the Patriarch in amazement. “Should I swallow it?”","Shaking his head, Patriarch Huyan said earnestly, “Hold it in your hand and slowly bring the spiritual essence into your meridians. That’s not enough. In the end, you’ll have to integrate it into your body. When that happens, you...”","His eyes lit up.","“When that happens, you’ll be as brilliant as a star!","“Junior Sister, this is the only Primary Heaven Pill in the world. My master made it himself. There’s no second one.”","Feng Wu suddenly became curious. “Rumor has it that the pill will die down in a few days, and the effect will start to wear off. So, everyone is saying that you’re going to give it to Princess Raoxi. Is that just a rumor?”","Patriarch Huyan said grumpily, “No matter how weak the pill becomes, it’s still a divine-level pill. If you weren’t here, why would I give it to someone else? I can take it myself!”","Seeing the angry look on his face, Feng Wu chuckled.","Princess Raoxi’s behavior reminded her of someone else...","“Don’t overthink it. Your top priority now is your cultivation and physical quality.” Patriarch Huyan poked his junior sister’s forehead affectionately. “You were... Forget about it. You don’t have any spiritual essence now, and we can’t let that happen anymore. With your weak physical quality, killing you will be as easy as killing an ant. If anything happens to you, I’ll never forgive myself.”","Patriarch Huyan let Feng Wu start, but he didn’t go out himself. Not only did he have to guard Feng Wu, but he also had to send her spiritual essence to help with her cultivation.","Time ticked by...","Just as Patriarch Huyan said, Feng Wu was slowly getting her cultivation ability back.","Spiritual Master, Spiritual Grandmaster, Spiritual Elder... She soon reached the peak of the Spiritual King stage.","Before, Feng Wu was already a junior Spiritual Overlord, but now, she had reached the peak of the Spiritual King stage in a day.","Seeing the rapid increase in Feng Wu’s cultivation level, Master Huyan was baffled as well.","His junior sister seemed to be even more talented than she used to be. That was incredible.","She was only in her teens, but she was already...","However, before he knew it, Feng Wu had become a junior Spiritual Overlord.","Master Huyan was speechless.","He had expected that the girl would only become a junior Spiritual Overlord at most, but to his surprise, Feng Wu’s cultivation level was still rising.."]},{"number":3860,"title":"Chapter 3860: Peak Spiritual Overlord (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3860: Peak Spiritual Overlord (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","After surpassing the junior Spiritual Overlord stage, Feng Wu’s cultivation level was still rising.","Patriarch Huyan cried out inwardly.","That girl was incredible! She had recovered so much in one go!","Patriarch Huyan only let out a breath of relief when he saw that the pill in Feng Wu’s hand was almost gone.","He was worried that the girl would break through to the Spiritual Saint stage in one go. If that was the case, she wouldn’t be able to keep up with her cultivation. He hoped that she wouldn’t explode.","As expected, Feng Wu stopped when she reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage.","And she had just used up the pill.","A little more...","She just needed a little more to reach the Spiritual Saint stage, didn’t she? Patriarch Huyan thought to himself.","It only took Feng Wu a day to go from a good-for-nothing to a peak Spiritual Overlord. All she needed to do now was to consolidate her physical quality.","With Patriarch Huyan’s help, Feng Wu began to train her physical body.","The Primary Heaven Pill was indeed the best pill in the world. Not only did it restore Feng Wu’s spiritual essence, but it was also quickly tempering her body.","Feng Wu had refined the muscles, tendons, and skin beforehand, and she was working on her bones now.","Hearing the cracking sounds in Feng Wu’s bones, Patriarch Huyan almost couldn’t sit still.","That was fast.","From Patriarch Huyan’s past experience, although the Primary Heaven Pill was powerful, it shouldn’t have taken effect so fast. It had only been a short while, but she had already finished refining her bones. Other people might not be able to do it even after years.","After that, Patriarch Huyan watched as Feng Wu moved on to her internal organs.","The internal organs were a very fragile part of the human body, and it was extremely difficult to cultivate that part.","But Feng wu...","Patriarch Huyan was dumbfounded again.","The girl went on smoothly. In a matter of hours, her internal organs had been turned into iron walls!","Normal people wouldn’t be able to destroy her internal organs so easily.","According to Patriarch Huyan’s estimation, Feng Wu’s physical cultivation level was about the same as that of a Spiritual Overlord.","That was to say, if a junior Spiritual Overlord took action, Feng Wu would be invincible, and the opponent wouldn’t be able to break through her defense.","To Patriarch Huyan’s disbelief, the girl went on.","After refining his bones and internal organs, she began to refine her marrow.","It was common knowledge that bones were easy to build, but cultivating the","bone marrow was unbelievably difficult.","The difficulty of reaching the intermediate level of the Spiritual Overlord stage was equivalent to that of refining one’s marrow.","Feng Wu closed her eyes again and focused on her refinement.","Her face had gone ghastly pale.","“You’ll be drained if you keep refining it. You can’t do it anymore.” Patriarch Huyan was worried about the girl. No matter how talented a person was or how exquisite the medicine was, they couldn’t withstand such hard work.","However, Feng Wu wouldn’t listen to him.","“The Primary Heaven Pill is such a rare opportunity that it’ll be better if I can make some progress as soon as possible. The Northern Yan Kingdom is too dangerous for me.”","Feng Wu sat down cross-legged and spoke in a trembling voice.","Patriarch Huyan could tell that Feng Wu was exhausted. In the past, no one would dare to defy him. However, the girl wouldn’t listen to him now, and there was nothing he could do.","“Then refine the marrow. After that, you’ll have to listen to me. You can’t refine anymore.”","“Alright,” Feng Wu said.."]},{"number":3861,"title":"Chapter 3861: Peak Spiritual Overlord (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3861: Peak Spiritual Overlord (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It was true. By the time Feng Wu finished refining the marrow, most of the spiritual essence she had accumulated was gone. Luckily, the effect of the Primary Heaven Pill was still there.","Feng Wu closed her eyes and worked on her recovery.","For the past three days, Patriarch Huyan had been taking care of Feng Wu and injected a lot of spiritual essence into her. He had turned paler, and his smooth face had wrinkles on it. He looked five years older.","However, Patriarch Huyan didn’t seem to mind at all. He only smiled at the girl in satisfaction.","That was great...","He had thought that he was all alone in this world, but he had never expected to have such a family member. All the more reason for him to stay alive and protect this girl. His Master would be so sorry if she was bullied.","Three days later.","Feng Wu finally finished her cultivation and slowly opened her eyes.","“That’s amazing!”","Patriarch Huyan gave Feng Wu a thumbs up.","Feng Wu had examined her own body. She had reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage and had refined her bone marrow.","That was such a big improvement! Feng Wu was elated. She hadn’t suffered for nothing after all!","The journey with the Gao family had been slow, but it had been safe. Moreover, she had been able to be involved in ordinary people’s lives. Hence, she had learned a lot, which was why she was able to reach the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage so quickly.","Little Phoenix was amazed when it saw Feng Wu. It ran around her and cried out.","“A Spiritual Overlord? You’re a peak Spiritual Overlord already? Ahhh!” Little Phoenix cried out in excitement.","That was true.","Feng Wu was only a junior Spiritual Overlord when she left the Junwu Empire a few months ago. When Jun Linyuan was around, she had a wonderful time. Without Jun Linyuan, her life was miserable. She was hunted everywhere, and she ran as fast as she could.","Finally, she was a peak Spiritual Overlord!","The bird was a peak Spiritual Overlord, and so was Feng Wu. Only a handful of people in this world could hunt them down now! Little Phoenix was thrilled!","One day, the bird would become Master Phoenix again!","“Feng Xun will cry his eyes out if he knows what you’re capable of now...” Little","Phoenix added.","Feng Wu cleared her throat uneasily.","Feng Wu remembered that Feng Xun was indeed a junior Spiritual Overlord. Back in the Peace Grassland, Feng Xun was a rank higher than her. If she went to the Peace Grassland now... At that thought, Feng Wu was intrigued.","Patriarch Huyan looked at Feng Wu in amazement. “You used to be a junior Spiritual Overlord?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Patriarch Huyan stroked his beard. “Your breakthrough is indeed a little too fast. No one can rise from junior to the peak in such a short time. How many levels are there in between?”","Little Phoenix nudged Patriarch Huyan. “Teehee, little Yanbo, you have no idea how talented our girl is. She’s even more talented than before! Maybe she’ll just be a little less accomplished than our master in the future.”","Patriarch Huyan nodded. He had realized in the past few days that she was indeed very talented.","After all, Little Phoenix worshiped Mu Jiuzhou the most, so even if it had to compliment Feng Wu, it would mention Mu Jiuzhou first.","Patriarch Huyan was even more so. He was Mu Jiuzhou’s biggest fan, and no one could surpass his master.."]},{"number":3862,"title":"Chapter 3862: Peak Spiritual Overlord (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3862: Peak Spiritual Overlord (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Unfortunately, my master will never see my junior sister like this again... Patriarch Huyan sounded aggrieved as he spoke, and tears rolled down his cheeks. “Why is my master gone... How...”","Seeing that he was crying again, Little Phoenix was speechless and turned to Feng wu.","Feng Wu rubbed her temples. She finally realized that her Sixth Senior Brother was indeed prone to crying.","He was so arrogant and omnipotent in front of the king and the others, but who knew what he was like behind their backs? She didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","Feng Wu patted him on the arm. “Senior Brother Huyan...”","“Junior Sister, we’ll never see Master again, never... I often dream that Master is still alive, and we’re still living carefreely by his side. All our Senior Brothers are there too...” Patriarch Huyan pounded his chest and stomped his foot as he cried.","Feng Wu said, “Says who? Master is still alive!”","However, Patriarch Huyan wouldn’t believe her.","“Senior Sister, please don’t make fun of me. Although I often mistakenly think that my master is still alive, after so many years...” He burst into tears again.","Feng Wu rubbed her forehead. Meanwhile, Little Phoenix shrugged and looked at Feng Wu in resignation, as if saying, “I told you so.”","Feng Wu didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. She poked Patriarch Huyan with a finger. “Senior Brother Huyan, it’s true. My master is still alive.”","Patriarch Huyan said, “You said that Master is still alive. Where is he?”","Feng Wu said, “He’s in a very safe place now, and we won’t see him until the time is right. But don’t worry. He’ll wake up.”","Patriarch Huyan wiped his tears and gave his junior sister a pleading look. “Really?”","Feng Wu rubbed his head. “It’s true. Trust me.”","“My master is still alive! He’s still alive!” Patriarch Huyan sobbed. However, he felt that he was in such a sorry state, so he turned around and wiped his tears. From behind, his shrugging shoulders showed how excited he was.","Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder and asked curiously, “By the way, you mentioned our three Senior Brothers just then. Are you in touch with them?”","The mention of that infuriated Patriarch Huyan!","“No!” He snorted.","Wait... there seemed to be more to it.","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Then... why is that?”","She had seen her third senior brother from afar... It was proof that he was still alive!","Patriarch Huyan waved his hand. “It’s nothing good. Kiddo, don’t ask.”","Feng Wu almost stomped her foot.","What was wrong with these people? When she asked for the truth, they all told her not to ask...","“Senior Brother, I’m not a child anymore. I’m already a peak Spiritual Overlord! ” Feng Wu said as she showed him her biceps.","Patriarch Huyan rolled his eyes at her. “Even if you’re a peak Spiritual Overlord, you’re still in your teens. It’s not for you to worry about. Be a good girl and don’t ask.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","It seemed to be something so important that even a peak Spiritual Overlord","wasn’t qualified to take part...","She was so curious.."]},{"number":3863,"title":"Chapter 3863: Peak Spiritual Overlord (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3863: Peak Spiritual Overlord (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Just then, they heard a noise outside.","Feng Wu was confused. ‘What’s outside...”","It just so happened that Feng Wu’s cultivation level and physical strength had been refined, and she could come out now.","She came out to find the giant eagle.","The giant eagle stumbled back as soon as it saw Feng Wu.","The feeling Feng Wu gave it was completely different from three days ago.","Three days ago, she was just an ordinary girl, but now, she gave out a dangerous feeling.","“You...” The giant eagle took a deep breath. “You’re a peak Spiritual Overlord!”","Feng Wu was amazed. “You can tell?”","The eagle said grumpily, “I’m not blind.”","Feng Wu was confused. “But I have the Concealing Jade with me. Isn’t it supposed to cover my tracks?”","The giant eagle snorted.","Patriarch Huyan smacked the eagle on the head. “How can you talk to your Aunt-Master like that?!”","Aunt-Master...","The bird didn’t know what to say.","Patriarch Huyan glanced at the giant eagle and said sternly, “Why aren’t you greeting your Aunt-Master?”","Patriarch Huyan was a crybaby when he was around Feng Wu and Little Phoenix, but when he was around other people, he was like a real Patriarch and an invincible figure. He didn’t get angry but was very intimidating.","The giant eagle cringed right away. It glanced at Patriarch Huyan and saw that the old man’s face had darkened. It lowered its head and greeted Feng Wu, calling her “Little Aunt-Master”.","Feng Wu tossed it another pill.","The giant eagle was elated, and its eyes lit up.","However, it didn’t dare to take the bribe this time. Instead, it carefully observed Patriarch Huyan.","Patriarch Huyan stood there proudly with his hands behind his back. Seeing the look in the eagle’s eyes, the old man snorted. “That’s a greeting gift from your Aunt-Master. Take it.”","“Yes!” The giant eagle was very excited, and it carefully put away the treasure. That was the most useful treasure. Little Aunt-Master was the best!","The giant eagle didn’t think that there was anything wrong with a senior being intimidated by a teenage kid.","Frustrated, Little Phoenix nudged Patriarch Huyan with its wings.","Patriarch Huyan looked at it in bewilderment.","“Me! Me!” Little Phoenix stared at him.","Only then did Patriarch Huyan realize what the bird meant. He nodded at the eagle.","The giant eagle felt uneasy.","It had fought Little Phoenix before, and the bird had been defeated. It had even kicked the bird out! Not only that, but the giant eagle had also wondered if it should stew the bird and eat it...","Now that things had turned around...","The giant eagle wanted to cry.","The Patriarch used to say that this was a world that valued martial prowess above everything else, and one’s fists were everything. But now...","“Come here and pay your respects to your younger Martial Uncle.” Seeing the look on the eagle’s face, Patriarch Huyan couldn’t help but frown and beckoned it over.","The giant eagle didn’t like the sound of that at all.","Next to them, Little Phoenix stuck out its tail and mimicked Feng Wu’s action.","It reminded Feng Wu of a despicable person who had gotten what he wanted. Feng Wu found it hilarious.","“Huh?” Patriarch Huyan’s face darkened.","The giant eagle, which had scolded the queen without hesitation, looked up at Patriarch Huyan with a pitiful look on its face and said angrily, “Didn’t you say that this world cares only about martial prowess? That bird can’t defeat me!”","Little Phoenix said proudly, “Are you not convinced?”","The giant eagle raised its chin and said proudly, “I just can’t accept it!”"]},{"number":3864,"title":"Chapter 3864: Keep It to Yourself(l)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3864: Keep It to Yourself(l)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Little Phoenix waved its paw like a boss. “If you don’t like it, keep it to yourself.”","Feng Wu almost burst out laughing.","Why did the bird copy her?","Moreover, she was never that proud. She was supposed to be such a lovely girl.","Little Phoenix threw a dirty look at Feng Wu, telling her to keep her silence.","Feng Wu nodded and turned away.","The eagle was furious. “You!”","Patriarch Huyan didn’t know what to do.","Feng Wu tugged at her Sixth Senior Brother. “Just leave them be and let them fight among themselves. We’ll talk after they figure out who’s the winner.”","Feeling aggrieved, Little Phoenix glared at Feng Wu. “Aren’t you going to help me?!”","Feng Wu glanced at it. “You can’t even defeat your junior martial nephew. How dare you call yourself its martial uncle?”","Little Phoenix was furious. “I, I...”","Seeing that Feng Wu was on its side, the giant eagle immediately felt that Feng Wu was the best person in the world. Its eyes twinkled.","Just then, Feng Wu remembered something.","“Gosh! How could I have forgotten...” Little Zhao was no longer here after she turned back into Feng Wu. The king wasn’t stupid, so of course he would be suspicious.","Hence, Feng Wu asked the eagle, “How’s His Majesty doing?”","The giant eagle was too busy bickering with Little Phoenix to hear what Feng Wu said.","Having no other choice, Feng Wu had to go in herself.","The king was in a bad condition before and couldn’t move at all. However, he was much better now and could move a little, but he still couldn’t get out of","bed.","He was confused when he saw Feng Wu.","Feng Wu examined him carefully and said, “You’ll be able to move soon. Don’t worry.”","The king looked alarmed. “Who are you?”","Feng Wu took out a tube of medicine and injected it into the tube. She then pushed the tube upward, and a few drops of liquid gushed out.","Emperor Yan’s stomach lurched when he saw the medicine.","He had never seen such a needle before.","“What are you going to do to me? Get out! Get out!” The king panicked.","Feng Wu thought, “I didn’t know that kings could panic. Emperor Wu is much better than this one, and Jun Linyuan is much better than his father.”","While the king was shouting, Master Huyan came in and stood behind Feng wu.","“Patriarch!”","In front of the old master, the king wasn’t the supreme ruler anymore. He was like a youngster who admired his father. Right now, he was looking eagerly at the old master.","Patriarch Huyan threw a dirty look at him. “Shut up!”","Hence, the king immediately shut up and didn’t say another word. He only looked a little aggrieved...","The Patriarch turned to Feng Wu in surprise. “You’re a good doctor, aren’t you?” Feng Wu adjusted the injection and nodded.","Come to think of it, Feng Wu was the reason that the king was in such a state, and after what he had gone through... Although Feng Wu wasn’t going to let him know the truth, she still had to save him. She didn’t want to owe him anything, so she had to get it over with.","Patriarch Huyan asked curiously, “What level are you?”","Feng Wu stared at the syringe in her hand and casually said, “I’m a Semi-divine medicine refiner now.” Pffft!","The king was astonished.","The Patriarch gave Feng Wu a strange look.. “You’re already a Semi-divine medicine refiner? Have you learned all the master’s skills?”"]},{"number":3865,"title":"Chapter 3865: Keep It to Yourself (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3865: Keep It to Yourself (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said indifferently, “I haven’t been able to learn them all. If I could, I would be a divine medicine refiner at the very least. I only know a limited amount.”","Master Huyan didn’t know what to say.","The girl was only in her teens, and she had reincarnated. She had no memory of what happened in her previous life. That was unbelievable.","Patriarch Huyan didn’t think Feng Wu was bragging, for that was how things worked in his sect. All his fellow disciples were geniuses, or his master wouldn’t have taken them in.","The king didn’t believe it at first, but when he saw Patriarch Huyan’s attitude toward Feng Wu, he immediately changed his attitude.","“Are you really a Semi-divine medicine refiner?” The king didn’t dare to underestimate the teenage girl.","He thought to himself, “Maybe she’s over 100 years old, but she just look young.”","Feng Wu had no idea what was going on in his head. She only said indifferently, “Give me your hand.”","The king obediently held out his hands.","Feng Wu grabbed one of the hands, and injected the tube of medicine.","The king felt the pain at first, but it soon disappeared. He only looked at Feng","Wu in amazement. “Are you trying to save me?”","Because he had seen with his own eyes how special Patriarch Huyan was toward Feng Wu, he didn’t dare to act like a king in front of Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded with a straight face.","The king nodded. He didn’t dare to criticize Feng Wu for her aloofness. Instead, he thought that was what a genius doctor should be like.","However...","The king was confused. ‘Well... may I ask where my eunuch is?”","He had been taken care of since he was little, but the eagle couldn’t be bothered. The bird thought it was already very kind of it to feed him on time. Right now, the king didn’t feel very comfortable.","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. She had forgotten about it...","She had to get Little Zhao here. Hence, after the injection, Feng Wu turned around and told the giant eagle, “I’ll write a letter. Bring the eldest prince here.”","The giant eagle nodded obediently.","The king no longer had any doubts about Feng Wu’s identity. The giant eagle didn’t even talk to him, the king, but this girl..","“Junior Sister...”","Soon, Patriarch Huyan led Feng Wu away.","The king’s eyes widened.","He couldn’t believe his ears!","He had thought that the girl was the Patriarch’s new pupil, but as it turned out, she was his junior sister.","Although the king had heard that the Patriarch was Mu Jiuzhou’s pupil, it was only a rumor. No one knew who his master really was.","But now, a junior sister had shown up out of nowhere... That was to say, she really was a senior.","Her status was higher than he had expected.","Could she really be an old lady? The king thought to himself.","Feng Wu told the giant eagle to deliver the message.","The giant eagle usually stayed in the tower. Of course, when the Patriarch went into seclusion, it would take a walk in the dark when it was bored. Therefore, it was quite familiar with the capital city.","Where should the eldest prince be? The giant eagle racked its brain with a letter in its mouth.."]},{"number":3866,"title":"Chapter 3866: Keep It to Yourself (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3866: Keep It to Yourself (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","He had to be in the royal palace, right?","The giant eagle then swaggered toward the palace.","Needless to say, the giant eagle was stopped outside the gate.","But Patriarch Huyan’s spiritual pet was a different story. It leaped over the gate and headed for the inner courtyard of the imperial palace.","The guards at the gate were worried sick.","However, it alarmed the secret guards of the inner courtyard.","The giant eagle had been with the Patriarch when the king worshiped the ancestors, so the secret guards recognized the bird. They didn’t dare to do anything and could only follow it from afar.","The giant eagle didn’t know where the eldest prince lived. It flapped its wings and shouted, “Your Royal Highness! Your Royal Highness!” As for what the prince’s name was... Sorry, it didn’t know.","Things weren’t looking good for the prince at the moment.","The Patriarch and the queen were said to be supporting Princess Rao, but the prince had no one. The king was indeed on his side, but if he really had a stroke and couldn’t speak... The prince thought that Princess Rao would have a very high chance of winning.","He was a little frustrated.","Princess Rao also knew that she had the upper hand. Therefore, she had launched a few attacks and the prince had lost quite a few men.","While the prince was disappointed and Princess Rao was gloating, there was a strange noise in the air.","After all, the eagle spoke in a strange way.","Everyone in the imperial palace heard its voice.","The entire imperial palace knew there was a visitor.","Quan Xi, the crown prince’s guard, told him that it was a giant eagle, which belonged to Patriarch Huyan.","The prince’s heart skipped a beat.","Had something happened?","He had sent Feng Wu in with a disguise earlier, and Little Zhao was still locked up here. If he was caught... The prince panicked a little.","Soon, the giant eagle arrived.","It wasnt alone. Princess Rao, the queen, and many other people in the palace were there as well.","The queen thought that the giant eagle was here for revenge, so she brought a bunch of palace ladies who were there to pay her respects.","Hence, they all gathered in the eldest prince’s residence.","Seeing the prince, the giant eagle was about to throw the envelope at him out of habit, but then it recalled what Feng Wu said...","Well...","The giant eagle cleared its throat and asked, “So, you’re the eldest prince.”","The prince nodded.","“Read it, then.” The giant eagle mimicked Little Phoenix and crossed its wings. It looked very proud.","The giant eagle found the posture proud and confident, which showed how wise it was.","Suppressing his nervous feeling, the crown prince began to read the letter.","He saw the signature first. It was Feng Wu.","What was going on? Since when was Feng Wu bold enough to sign her own name? Moreover, she had even sent Grandpa Eagle out to deliver a letter... What was wrong with this girl? She didn’t look like she had done anything wrong.","They greeted the eagle respectfully.","Even the king had to talk to the eagle nicely, so of course, the queen didn’t dare to offend it.","Princess Rao greeted him as well as if she was very close to the giant eagle.","Seeing that she still needed to clean the tower every day, the giant eagle nodded at her.","That simple reply was enough to make Princess Rao very pleased with herself. She was the only one who could walk into the tower and get close to the Patriarch.","As expected, the others all looked envious.","In Northern Yan, Patriarch Huyan was the ultimate protector, and his only spiritual pet, the giant eagle, was also an outstanding figure.."]},{"number":3867,"title":"Chapter 3867: Keep It to Yourself (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The giant eagle didn’t have time for this. It only glanced at the prince and asked, “Are you done?”","The prince nodded immediately.","The giant eagle snorted. “Let’s go, then.”","The prince was filled with questions, but there were so many people around, and he couldn’t bring himself to ask. Hence, he nodded and left with the giant eagle.","Many people saw the look on his face when he left. He didn’t seem very happy. That was to say, it wasn’t good news.","Box Novel.com","Seeing that the giant eagle was only taking the prince away, Princess Rao quickly followed it and asked gingerly, “Grandpa Eagle, what happened?” Why wouldn’t the eagle take her?","However, before she could ask that question, the giant eagle said coldly, “Don’t ask questions you shouldn’t ask!”","Princess Rao nodded obediently and didn’t dare to say another word.","The prince couldn’t help but glance at her.","Wasn’t the Patriarch supposed to dote on her and support her? Wasn’t he going to give her the Primary Heaven Pill? Why didn’t the eagle show her any respect?","Moreover, the prince had a feeling that the eagle seemed to treat him better than his sister. It was so strange. At that thought, the prince rubbed his nose and was confused.","Soon, they arrived at the tower.","Normally, no one was allowed to enter the tower, but the giant eagle was guarding it, so of course, it could bring the prince in.","Then... the prince realized that he had walked in just like that.","What he didn’t know was that all the ladies and princesses had gathered around Princess Rao and were asking her what was going on.","The queen glanced at Princess Rao, who immediately said, “Maybe my brother has done something to offend the master. Otherwise, Grandpa Eagle wouldn’t have arrested him.”","Arrest?","It was a severe enough punishment for ordinary people but for the prince... It was like a thunderclap on a sunny day!","Because of what Princess Rao said, the news soon got out.","The prince had no idea what was going on. Right now, he was standing in the spacious hall, feeling a little dizzy.","He was in? Just like that?","Feng Wu quickly came out to greet him.","“You’re here.” She waved at the prince.","However, the prince didn’t recognize Feng Wu and only looked at her in bewilderment.","“Right, I forgot about that...’","Feng Wu waved at him. “I used to disguise myself as the ugly girl, but I’m back now. What? Don’t you recognize me?” The prince said, “That difference...”","It was so huge!","Before, Feng Wu was an ugly girl, but now, she was stunning!","No words could describe how stunning she was. The prince was infatuated.","“Hey, wake up.” Feng Wu patted him on the shoulder.","The crown prince blushed.","Feng Wu was so magnanimous that he would look petty if he behaved this way.","The prince sighed. “I’ve long heard that Miss Feng Wu of the Junwu Empire is unparalleled in her beauty. I couldn’t tell with your disguise earlier, but now, I see that you’re indeed worthy of fame!”","It was said that she and Jun Linyuan were engaged... At that thought, the prince felt a little jealous...","Feng Wu didn’t expect the prince to overthink it.. She only asked, “Do you know why I asked you to come in?”"]},{"number":3868,"title":"Chapter 3868: Take You to the Patriarch (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The prince shook his head in bewilderment.","Feng Wu said, “Bring Little Zhao here to your father.”","She was very busy and was ready to leave after that.","Only then did the prince realize what had happened. “Wait!”","Feng Wu turned around and looked at him in bewilderment. “What?”","Box Novel.com","The prince asked anxiously, “Can you walk freely in and out of this tower now?”","Feng Wu nodded. Of course.","The prince asked, “Can you show your real face now?”","Feng Wu nodded. Of course.","The prince went on. “Can you go on...”","Feng Wu nodded. Of course.","The prince was speechless.","“Why?!” The prince didn’t understand and looked at Feng Wu in disbelief. “You’re not bluffing, are you?”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Do you think I can brag about letting the eagle bring you here? Do you think I can brag to let you in? Do you think I can brag about bringing you to your Patriarch?”","The prince shook his head every time Feng Wu asked a question. However, he stared at her in astonishment when she finished her sentence. ‘What did you say?!”","Feng Wu was confused. ‘What do you mean?”","The crown prince said, “What did you just say? You can take me to the","Patriarch?”","Feng Wu nodded. Of course. Was it that hard to meet her sixth senior brother?","The prince rolled his eyes at Feng Wu. “Stop bragging.”","Feng Wu almost laughed.","What a coincidence.","Just then, Patriarch Huyan rushed out. He let out a breath of relief when he saw Feng Wu. “Why are you running around? I almost couldn’t find you. What did you do with the mosquito? Tell me!”","The prince was dumbfounded when he saw the old man.","That was their Patriarch, wasn’t it?","The prince had seen the old master up close during ceremonies, so he recognized him right away. However, he wasn’t so sure because the old master used to sit in a high position with a solemn look on his face. Even his father didn’t dare to breathe loudly in front of him.","However, the old man was so lively that he reminded the prince of a child.","That was why the prince didn’t dare to greet the old master.","Patriarch Huyan had been watching Feng Wu the whole time. Seeing that Feng Wu was looking away, he followed her gaze.","He recognized the boy right away.","“Isn’t that...” What was his name? Patriarch Huyan realized that he had forgotten the kid’s name.","The prince dropped to his knees and said respectfully, “Patriarch, it’s my honor to meet you.”","After that, he kowtowed three times.","Patriarch Huyan nodded, then turned to Feng Wu. “Let’s go. What’s with the mosquito and the high flame?”","Patriarch Huyan had a lot of questions.","He had learned to forge weapons from his master, so he wanted to use the time when his junior sister was around to teach her what he was best at. However, to his surprise, his junior sister was even better at it than he was!","She could even make explosives. That was incredible!","Therefore, it was now Patriarch Huyan’s turn to follow Feng Wu around and learn from her on forging weapons.","The eldest prince, who was kneeling on the ground, was speechless.","He recalled the conversation he had with Feng Wu and didn’t know what to say. Before the Patriarch dragged Feng Wu away, she only had time to give the prince one instruction.."]},{"number":3869,"title":"Chapter 3869: Take You to the Patriarch (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3869: Take You to the Patriarch (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Bring Little Zhao here. Your father needs him.”","Before the prince could reply, Feng Wu was dragged away by Patriarch Huyan.","The prince was speechless.","Just then, she heard a familiar voice. “You’re still here?”","Turning around, the prince saw that it was Princess Rao. Right now, she was talking to the giant eagle and addressing it as “Grandpa”. The prince was speechless.","If he remembered it correctly, Feng Wu had been addressing the eagle as “Brother Eagle”.","Just then, the giant eagle prompted the prince. “Get on with your work!” The prince nodded immediately.","After the prince left, Princess Rao feigned a curious tone and asked what he was doing there.","The giant eagle glanced at her and warned her, “Don’t ask what you shouldn’t ask! ”","Princess Rao had always been on friendly terms with the giant eagle. Hence, after being scolded, she lowered her head and put on a pitiful look.","The giant eagle was about to tell her something when it heard Feng Wu’s voice.","“Brother Eagle?”","The giant eagle forgot all about Princess Rao and immediately said, “Right away!”","It ran away.","Princess Rao stomped her foot in frustration.","wait!","What did she hear?","That was a familiar female voice, and she was sure that she had heard it somewhere before.","However, she couldn’t remember where she had heard that voice.","She looked at the wooden bucket under her feet and decided to get back to work.","Princess Rao was used to the work, but what she didn’t know was that the prince would see her when she worked.","The prince had brought Little Zhao here to look after his father as Feng Wu had instructed.","The king could get out of bed now, so the prince and Little Zhao helped him out. They were going to walk around in the courtyard when they saw someone scrubbing the floor.","The king didn’t recognize her at first, but Little Zhao did. “Isn’t that...”","Only then did the king look in that direction. One look and he was dumbfounded.","By then, he had recognized the person scrubbing the floor inch by inch. It was none other than his precious Princess Rao.","Scrubbing the floor?","Although it wasn’t a shameful thing to scrub the floor for the Patriarch, after all, she was here to serve the master. The king recalled what Rao Xi said earlier.","She said,","“The Patriarch likes me a lot. He often lets me go into the tower, saying that it’s full of spiritual essence and good for my health.","“He likes me a lot. He says why can’t a princess be the ruler? He’s on my side.","“The Patriarch likes me a lot. He said he would give me the Primary Heaven Pill, and I’m the only princess he likes.","“The Patriarch...","Emperor Yan looked suspicious.","Did the Patriarch like her, dote on her, and care for her as she said?","Before, the king didn’t think much of it, but now, he felt that something wasn’t right.","The prince felt he couldn’t add insult to injury, so he said, “Is the Patriarch letting her use this method to train her body? Isn’t she in poor health?” “Is that so?” The king wasn’t convinced.","“Let’s go back.” The king didn’t go to the princess. He let the other two walk him back to his stone room.","Just then, Feng Wu came out of another refinery room.."]},{"number":3870,"title":"Chapter 3870: Take You to the Patriarch (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3870: Take You to the Patriarch (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","That was the master’s refinery room, and he was the only one allowed in, not even the giant eagle. But now, Feng Wu had walked out of that room.","Seeing the king, Feng Wu nodded at him and greeted him in a familiar tone.","“You can walk around now?”","It was like a normal conversation between ordinary people.","The prince didn’t know what to say. She was talking to his father, the king of Northern Yan. Young lady, was it appropriate to talk to him like that? Did she think that his father wouldn’t hold grudges against her?","He kept winking at Feng Wu, but Feng Wu couldn’t read his mind and only gave him a confused look.","The prince was speechless.","However, the king didn’t think that Feng Wu had offended him at all. Instead, he was excited by Feng Wu’s attitude.","“Yes. I can walk around now. Thank you for the medicine, Master-Aunt.” The king was very respectful toward Feng Wu-","He had heard Patriarch Huyan address Feng Wu as “Junior Sister”, which meant that she had to be an old woman over 100 years old. He had to show her some respect. The king even bowed to her.","The prince was astonished.","He had never been so shocked before.","Aunt-Master? A bow? What...","To the prince, his father had always been an authoritative figure. Sometimes, he didn’t even dare to breathe loudly in front of his father. But now... He couldn’t understand it anymore.","Wasn’t Feng Wu just a girl from the Junwu Empire? At most, she was a genius girl that had been rising day by day. There were so many unattainable geniuses out there that a ruler didn’t need to bow at her at all.","The look on the prince’s face kept changing, and Feng Wu was amused.","But she didn’t say anything. She only nodded at the king and said indifferently, “I’m glad that you can get out of bed. But your condition is quite serious this time. I don’t think you’ll be able to make a full recovery with the help of medicine. Let me treat your acupoints for you.”","The king was elated and nodded.","The prince was there the whole time when Feng Wu treated the king.","He was shocked at first when he saw how skillful Feng Wu was, but he soon fell into deep thought.","She was a top refiner and a top medicine refiner?","Although she was a good-for-nothing with zero cultivation level... Wait!","The prince suddenly sensed Feng Wu’s spiritual essence, and his eyes widened. He stared at Feng Wu.","No, that couldn’t be...","How could she...","Feng Wu had been hiding her spiritual essence, but because she was going to treat the king, she let it show, and the prince immediately sensed it.","“That’s...” The prince stared at Feng Wu in disbelief.","Feng Wu wasn’t a cripple!","Not only wasn’t she useless, but she was also more capable than him!","What level was she?","At that thought, the prince felt like crying.","He wanted to say, “How’s that possible? I don’t believe it!”","But it was the truth!","He saw with his own eyes that Feng Wu had refined a Semi-divine weapon. He saw how Feng Wu treated his father and how she used her spiritual essence. He almost lost control.","Feng Wu let out a breath of relief after putting away the needles.","The king looked expectantly at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded and smiled. “Your Majesty, don’t worry. Your energy channels are all working. You’ll be fine for a while..”"]},{"number":3871,"title":"Chapter 3871: Take You to the Patriarch (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3871: Take You to the Patriarch (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Although Emperor Yan’s symptoms were similar to a stroke, it wasn’t as simple as that. Feng Wu had used her own potion. Of course, she wasn’t going to tell anyone about it. She wanted to save herself the trouble and make a good impression on the king.","Feng Wu knew that her sixth senior brother preferred a quiet environment. Now that the father and son were in the tower, he didn’t even want to come out.","Hence, she said to the king, “You’re fine now. You can go back to the palace today.”","The prince was dumbfounded.","so...","Since when did Feng Wu’s words work so well for Patriarch Huyan?","Was this girl even human?","Was she that likable?","Feng Wu looked at him, gave it some thought, and said, “Follow me, then.” After that, she was ready to take the king there.","The king felt uneasy. “The Patriarch doesn’t like to see other people. Are you sure about that?”","The prince looked at his father and recalled how serious the latter usually looked. It was a stark contrast.","Feng Wu nodded matter-of-factly. “Of course.”","She Imocked on the door.","Patriarch Huyan said, “Come in.”","Feng Wu turned to the king. “I’ll go in first. Please wait a moment.” The king nodded.","Not only was the Patriarch a formidable cultivator, but he was also very perceptive. The king wanted to ask the Patriarch about the heir to the throne.","And that was also why Feng Wu had brought the king here.","After all, Northern Yan was a major kingdom. If Princess Raoxi took the throne, she might abuse her power and turn the entire kingdom against Feng Wu, which would be a lot of trouble for the latter.","Feng Wu knew that the grudge between her and Princess Raoxi would never be resolved.","Therefore, she would never let Princess Raoxi take the throne.","Moreover...","To the current Feng Wu, that was a piece of cake.","She went up to the Patriarch and whispered something in his ear.","Patriarch Huyan frowned a little. “Of course not! Why would I choose her? She’s just a maid who cleans my floor.”","Feng Wu chuckled.","She wondered how the princess would feel if she knew that she was only a hard-working maid to Patriarch Huyan.","Feng Wu was glad that she could ruin Princess Raoxi’s plan.","Feng Wu asked, “What do you think of the eldest prince, Huyan Junchen?” Patriarch Huyan was confused.","Feng Wu asked, “That’s the young man who came to see me earlier.”","The Patriarch asked Feng Wu, “What do you think of him?”","Recalling her recent interactions with the prince, Feng Wu told the truth. “He’s a warm and powerful man. He’s calm and rational. I think he’s a good candidate.”","Patriarch Huyan nodded, indicating that he understood.","After sabotaging Princess Raoxi’s future without hesitation, Feng Wu opened the door and welcomed the two men in.","After all, it was a matter of the Northern Yan Kingdom. She left the room after showing them in and closed the door behind her.","Although she didn’t know what they talked about, Feng Wu knew that Patriarch Huyan would like the prince.","As expected..."]},{"number":3872,"title":"Chapter 3872: A Thousand-year-Old Woman","paragraphs":["Chapter 3872: A Thousand-year-Old Woman","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The eldest prince came out first.","Seeing Feng Wu cultivating in the stone room, he went up to her in a hurry. He was excited, but he didn’t dare to disturb her, so he had to walk around her in circles. Feng Wu almost felt dizzy from his running around. She smiled wryly and asked, “What are you getting at?”","Turning around, the prince saw that Feng Wu had opened her eyes. He ran to her side and sat down in front of her, looking very excited.","“I’ve met the Patriarch!” The prince was excited.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. Was that supposed to be an impossible task?","The prince said, “It’s so hard to meet him. Look, even my father found it very difficult. If you hadn’t spoken up for him, he probably wouldn’t have been able to meet the Patriarch this time. As for us princes and princesses... Before, only Raoxi had spent time with him alone, and I only watched from afar.","“But this time, I’m sitting right opposite the Patriarch and only a meter away from him!” The prince was thrilled. “Do you know how excited I am now? No words can describe my feeling!”","He suddenly turned serious. “Xiao Wu, thank you. Thank you so much...”","Tears welled up in the prince’s eyes as he spoke, and he sounded a little choked up, but more than that, he sounded aggrieved.","Feng Wu looked at him in resignation. “What’s there to cry about? You’re a grown man...”","Wiping away his tears, the prince said excitedly, “The Patriarch patted me on the shoulder and said that he had faith in me. He said that he had faith in me.","Xiao Wu, what did that mean?”","Xiao Wu looked at him in resignation. “What do you think?”","There was a hopeful look in the prince’s eyes. “Do you think he thinks I’m better than Raoxi?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course.”","The prince asked, “So, I’m more likely to win than Raoxi now?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s an understatement.”","As long as the Patriarch was around, the prince would definitely become the heir to the throne.","That was what the prince wanted to hear.","“Thank you! Xiao Wu, thank you!” The prince grabbed Feng Wu’s hand and couldn’t hide his excitement.","Feng Wu waved him off. “Don’t worry about it. It’s not a big deal.”","However, the prince wiped away his tears and said seriously, “One word from you is enough to change my life.”","Seeing the serious look on the crown prince’s face, Feng Wu became more serious as well. She said indifferently, “Actually, you’ll still be the future heir to the throne if I don’t speak up for you in front of your Patriarch. After all, you’ve seen it yourself. Raoxi has been putting on an act this whole time, and your Patriarch isn’t behind her.”","However, the prince shook his head and said, “It’s not the same. She has been using the Patriarch’s fame for so many years, and it has always worked because no one else can get in touch with the Patriarch. If you hadn’t brought me here, I wouldn’t know anything, and neither would my father.”","Feng Wu agreed with him.","“You owe me one, then. I’ll ask you to help me in return when I want it,” Feng Wu said casually.","“Alright!” The prince said generously.","He had no idea what that favor would be.","“By the way, are you really...” ???????????????????? looked at Feng Wu in amazement. “Are","you really the Patriarch’s junior sister?”","Feng Wu asked, “Did your father tell you that?”","The prince said, “Father also said that you must be a thousand-year-old woman...”"]},{"number":3873,"title":"Chapter 3873: Secret of Raoxi (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3873: Secret of Raoxi (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu stared at him. “What did you say?!”","Seeing that Feng Wu looked like she was going to cut someone up, the prince waved his hands. “It was my father. I didn’t say it. I really didn’t...” Feng Wu snorted.","The crown prince explained in a hurry. ‘Well, you’re the Patriarch’s junior sister, so you should be quite old... I think that’s what my father thinks.” Feng Wu snorted again.","The prince was confused. “So, are you the Patriarch’s junior sister or the teenage girl of the Junwu Empire?”","Feng Wu asked, “Can’t I be both?”","The prince said, “How can you be both? How old is the Patriarch? How old must his master be? How is that possible?”","Feng Wu raised an eyebrow. “Why isn’t it possible? I’m right here, aren’t I?”","The prince said, “So... so... you really are... You!” Feng Wu nodded.","The prince looked shocked and frustrated.","Feng Wu glanced at him curiously. “I understand that you’re shocked, but why are you upset?”","The prince heaved a long sigh and sat down on a stone bench.","Feng Wu sat down next to him, rested her elbows on the stone table, and looked curiously at the crown prince.","The prince sighed and said, “The Junwu Empire’s era has come.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What do you mean?”","The prince gave Feng Wu a resentful look. “Isn’t it obvious? Jun Linyuan is a prominent figure in the Junwu Empire. Don’t tell me you don’t know what he’s like.”","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","The prince said quietly, “I was so arrogant when I was little that I wanted to compete with Jun Linyuan. I thought that I would be able to catch up with him if I worked as hard as I could. But as it turned out, I was left behind.’","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","The prince gave Feng Wu another resentful look and said, “Fine, I’ll admit it.","I’m not as good as him. But has the Junwu Empire been blessed by the gods?","Why do they also have you?!”","Feng Wu wouldn’t accept it. “What about me?","The more the prince said, the more frustrated he became. “Don’t you know what you’re like? In terms of cultivation level, you’re at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage! By the way, how old are you?”","Feng Wu said, “I’m yet to turn fifteen.”","The prince didn’t want to talk to Feng Wu anymore...","“You’re not even fifteen yet... My dear lady, you’re not even fifteen yet! How can you be so amazing? Not only are you at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, but you’re also so terrifying in refining weapons and medicines! What are the rest or us supposea to aor!”","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","Despite the prince’s complaints, Feng Wu still felt a little satisfied. She couldn’t let her imagination run wild! Feng Wu reminded herself.","The prince didn’t know her achievement in formations yet!","The prince glanced at Feng Wu and said aggrievedly, “Do you know what’s the most terrifying thing?”","Feng Wu was confused. “What is it?”","The prince said, “The most terrifying thing is that you and Jun Linyuan, the two most outstanding teenagers in the world, are almost husband and wife. If the two of you get married, no other countries will be your match!”","Feng Wu tried to deny it. “Well, it’s not like that. Jun Linyuan and I... It’s not what you think..”"]},{"number":3874,"title":"Chapter 3874: Secret of Raoxi (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3874: Secret of Raoxi (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The prince snorted. “It’s not what I think? Is there something else? Are you not going to marry Jun Linyuan?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “I don’t know if I’ll marry Jun Linyuan, but... why are you so concerned? Do you want to marry me or something?” Thump!","What Feng Wu said almost frightened the prince to death!","He fell off the chair and almost broke his leg.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. “Do you have to be so scared?”","The prince wanted to cry. “Even my father addresses you as Aunt-Master, okay?”","Judging by their seniority, the prince really was supposed to call her “grandma”.","Feng Wu chuckled. “Chenchen, be a good girl. Say hello, and I’ll give you a welcome gift.”","The prince wanted to hit someone.","Just then, the king came out with Patriarch Huyan.","He was surprised to see the prince chatting happily with Feng Wu. However, he soon greeted Feng Wu as well.","Feng Wu nodded in return.","She didn’t try to be polite at all. The prince was amazed by how tough she was.","Just then, the king threw a dirty look at the prince. “Shouldn’t you be bowing to your senior now?”","The prince was dumbfounded...","Feng Wu chuckled.","The king looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment, not knowing what she was laughing at.","Feng Wu finally stopped laughing. Seeing the prince’s flushed face, she wanted to laugh again.","She could understand his feelings.","Back in the shop when the first time the prince met her, she was just an ugly girl with no background. Later, she told him that she was Feng Wu, but even so, she was only a promising teenage girl in the Junwu Empire, whereas he was the eldest prince of Northern Yan.","But now, he... Feng Wu could only imagine how frustrated ??????????????????? felt.","sne smiled at tne King. “Juncnen IS tne best. you nave to treat mm well.”","“Yes, he’s always been a nice kid!”","He was elated to hear Feng Wu’s praise.","However, he saw that the Patriarch didn’t look too happy and realized that he had been here for too long. Hence, he immediately led the prince out of the tower.","Feng Wu saw them off.","“Where’s Raoxi?” the prince asked curiously.","Feng Wu said, “She’s never been qualified to go inside. She always leaves after she cleans the floor. That’s why she’s not here.”","Feng Wu noticed that the corner of the king’s eyes twitched. Yes!","The two of them went back to the palace.","The study had been repaired, but some of the missing files weren’t that easy to repair, especially some precious books on the shelf. The king was furious.","“Get to the bottom of it!”","Before long, Little Zhao came back and whispered something in the king’s ear.","The king was shocked and furious.","He turned around and glared at the prince.","Frightened by the look in his eyes, the crown prince dropped to his knees.","“Father...”","Had his father found out about the mosquito burning down the study? That shouldn’t be the case...","The king only gave him one look before looking away. He waved at the prince and said, “You can leave now.”","The prince bowed respectfully before leaving the room, closing the door behind him.."]},{"number":3875,"title":"Chapter 3875: Secret of Raoxi (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","As soon as the prince left, the king lost his temper. “That bastard!”","The prince’s stomach lurched. Could it be that his father...","The king went on. “How dare she?! Does she really think the Patriarch cares that much about her?!”","Hearing that, the prince was relieved and left in a hurry.","According to Zhao, they had been able to control the young eunuch, who was the one who started the fire. They then traced it back to Concubine Mei and found out that Princess Rao had something to do with it.","“Find out everything!” The king didn’t want Princess Rao and the queen to have something to do with his illness.","But if they did... The king clenched his fists.","Meanwhile...","The princess had no idea that the king was already suspecting her.","She was happily preparing for her birthday party.","It was the following day.","When Princess Rao went to see the king, he was talking to the prince in the study.","The king patted his son on the shoulder and said, “Join the Ministry of Revenue first and work hard. I’m not the only one watching you. The Patriarch is watching you as well.”","The prince was thrilled. He knew that the Patriarch must have taken his side when the king met him, so his father made this choice.","It was all because of little Feng Wu! At the thought of that stunning face, the prince felt a warm sensation in his chest.","“What are you thinking?” The king asked curiously.","The prince said, “I’m thinking about Feng...","He then explained, “I mean, the Patriarch’s junior sister...”","“Don’t even think about it!” Before he could finish, the king smacked him on the head. “You already know she’s the Patriarch’s junior sister, and you’re still thinking about her? Do you have a death wish?!”","Ahem...","The prince was so frustrated that he almost choked on his own breath.","He said hastily, “Father, I didn’t mean it that way. I mean... I think it’s all because of her recommendation that you’re willing to see me. I’m so grateful.”","Only then did the king nod. “Befriending that senior lady is indeed an opportunity for you. Make good use of it. Understood?” The prince nodded immediately. “Of course.”","However... the so-called senior lady...","She wasn’t fifteen yet.","He was about to explain to the king that Feng Wu was the girl of the Junwu Empire and Jun Linyuan’s fiancee. However, before he could say anything, he heard a voice outside.","Zhao said, “Your Majesty, Her Majesty the queen and Princess Rao are outside.” Zhao was a smart man.","Before, it was unclear who would take the throne, so he couldn’t put his money on either side. However, now that he had investigated the burning of the imperial study and His Majesty’s apoplexy, he knew everything.","There was also the interaction between His Majesty and the prince. The two of them hadn’t been like this before.","Before, the prince would treat the king with great respect, but for a moment just now, Little Zhao felt they were real father and son.","To suppress the prince, Princess Rao and the queen did a lot of things to alienate the king and the prince, which created a big estrangement between them. But now, it seemed that the ice had broken...","At that thought, Zhao smiled.."]},{"number":3876,"title":"Chapter 3876: Secret of Raoxi (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","It seemed that he would have to ask his pupil what happened in the tower these days.","His pupil was none other than Little Zhao himself.","The king had no idea that Zhao had been thinking so much. Hearing that","Princess Raoxi and the queen were here, he frowned and looked displeased.","However, he quickly adjusted his facial expression and said indifferently, “Let them in.”","For now, he didn’t have any evidence to prove that the queen and the princess were behind everything. After all these years, he couldn’t stop liking them all of a sudden.","The queen and Princess Raoxi soon came in.","Nothing seemed to have changed in eyes.","The queen was as gentle as ever with a smile on her face.","Princess Rao took the king’s arm and chatted with him.","The prince’s mother had passed away, and he seemed to be redundant and couldn’t join them no matter what.","Similar things had happened countless times for as long as he could remember. He was sad at first, but then he pretended that he didn’t care, and gradually, he became numb... But things seemed to be different now.","The prince thought, “I think that’s because I’m more confident now.” Because Feng Wu was on his side.","With that confidence, he didn’t feel envious when he saw them like this. Instead, he could tell that Raoxi and the queen had put on an act.","Raoxi held the king’s arm and was almost hanging onto him.","Princess Raoxi said, “Father, my birthday is tomorrow. Have you forgotten?”","The king didn’t let his real emotions show. He rubbed Princess Raoxi’s head and said affectionately, “Of course not.”","Princess Raoxi was elated, and she sounded as innocent as a teenage girl. “Really?”","The king tapped her nose. “Of course. When did I lie to you?”","Princess Raoxi was very happy, so she asked, “Father, what do you want to give","The king said, “I’ll give you whatever you want.”","Princess Raoxi smiled. “Father, how about you give me this kingdom?”","A hush fell over the crowd at those words, and the air seemed to freeze for a moment.","A short distance away, all the eunuchs lowered their eyes and didn’t dare to breathe loudly.","It was so terrifying!","The king was surprised as well. Before he could say anything, Princess Raoxi chuckled. She then turned to the queen and said, “Mother, my father took it seriously. How funny!”","Everyone let out a breath of relief when they saw her smile.","The king smiled as well and tapped Princess Raoxi on the forehead. “You’re so naughty.”","The prince was watching the whole thing, so he realized something. The princess was trying to sound out his father, but his attitude didn’t please her.","Raoxi was displeased, but it only lasted for a split second.","So did her father.","Princess Raoxi acted as if nothing had happened and went back to holding the king’s arm. “Father, I’m celebrating my birthday tomorrow.”","The king nodded with a smile.","Princess Raoxi said, “Father, do you remember? The Patriarch said that he would give me a gift for my 18th birthday. It’s going to be the Primary Heaven Pill..”"]},{"number":3877,"title":"Chapter 3877: Secret of Raoxi (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3877: Secret of Raoxi (5)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Raoxi was lost in her story. “The Primary Heaven Pill is the best pill in the world. I’ll be in great shape after I take it. With my talent, I’ll be able to make great progress in my cultivation. Father, are you happy?","The king asked, “Did he really say that?”","Princess Raoxi said, “Of course. You were there before, weren’t you? The Patriarch said that he had a Primary Heaven Pill for his junior sister. It’ll expire if she doesn’t take it now.”","The king did know about it because the Patriarch had talked about it, but they only heard about it by accident.","“Did the Patriarch say that he was going to give it to you?” The king asked suspiciously.","Princess Raoxi panicked. What was going on with her father? He had never questioned her words before and would believe anything she said.","Princess Raoxi exchanged a stern look with the queen. After that, she threw a dirty look at the prince, which was filled with hatred and rage. Her dear brother must have complained to her father!","The prince rubbed his nose and didn’t try to explain himself. His father knew what was going on.","Princess Raoxi looked at the king again.","“Father, I’ve been to the tower a lot, haven’t I? The Patriarch said once that he was going to give me the pill, and it would be on my 18th birthday. I understand why you didn’t know because only the Patriarch and I were there, and I never told you about it.” As she spoke, she smiled shyly. “The Patriarch not only wanted to give me the pill, but he also taught me all kinds of things. He said that I had brought him a lot of joy...”","Princess Raoxi told the king how the Patriarch liked her, doted on her, and treated her well.","The king was speechless.","So was the prince.","The father and son looked at each other, and their faces twitched. The image of the princess wiping the floor appeared in their heads...","“Really?” The king looked at her.","She was his favorite princess, and he had brought her up by his side. How could she lie to him?","He thought about how Princess Raoxi used to make him happen when she was little. She would cry when other people carried her and laugh when she saw him. She would hold his father’s hand and cry as if he was the only one she cared about in the world. It pained the king to see her like this.","At that thought, the king softened a little and decided to give Raoxi another chance.","“Really? Is the Patriarch really that nice to you?”","Princess Raoxi’s stomach lurched. She could sense something different about her father. Did he know something?","“Father, did the Patriarch say something?” Princess Raoxi asked tentatively.","The king smiled. “He’s so busy, and I hardly ever see him, let alone talk to him. I was just thinking that you haven’t come to see me in the tower these days.”","Princess Raoxi let out a breath of relief. She knew it. The Patriarch was too unattainable to chat with her father.","Princess Raoxi immediately said, “I wanted to come in and take care of you, but the Patriarch said that you were too sick to be disturbed, so I had no choice but to stay outside. Then, something came up with my mother, and you came out as soon as I arrived. It really wasn’t like that...”","The more she said, the more anxious she became.."]},{"number":3878,"title":"Chapter 3878: The Complaint against Feng Wu (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3878: The Complaint against Feng Wu (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing that Raoxi was getting more and more anxious, the king smiled brightly and patted her on the shoulder. “I know that.”","Seeing that the king wasn’t angry, Princess Raoxi let out a breath of relief. She didn’t want her father to know the truth. As long as he didn’t, she could do whatever she wanted.","This had been going on for the past decade or so, and no one had ever seen through her act. Therefore, Princess Raoxi felt that it wouldn’t happen now.","As it turned out, her father had no idea.","If he had known, he would have been furious and wouldn’t have been so nice. At that thought, Princess Raoxi wasn’t worried at all.","Princess Raoxi changed the subject. “Father, you haven’t told me about the gift yet. Are you not going to give it to me?”","Seeing Princess Raoxi like this, the king was no longer interested. He only smiled and asked, “What kind of gift do you want?”","Princess Raoxi pouted and mumbled, “I hate someone. Father, can you please help me?”","The king asked, “How?”","Princess Raoxi said, “Catch her and turn her into my toy. Can I do that?”","A toy?","The king frowned. This princess had crossed the line.","Princess Raoxi went on. “Father, that person has been offending me. She knows that I’m a princess, but she still won’t give in. She doesn’t respect the royal family at all. I won’t have it.”","The prince’s stomach lurched, and he gave Princess Raoxi a strange look. Could it be what he had guessed?","“Who offended you?” The king frowned. With his daughter’s behavior, that person had to be a decent person to offend her.","Princess Raoxi went on acting like a spoiled child. “Father, please don’t ask me for more details. Can you lend me some men? I’ll go catch her myself.”","The look he gave her gave her the creeps.","“Fine, fine. If you want to hear it, I’ll make it very clear.”","Princess Raoxi was going to do something about Feng Wu under the guise of celebrating her birthday.","Now that her father had recovered, if the office head of the Punishment Office sent in his memorial... She might as well put the blame on Feng Wu first. Therefore, she took the opportunity and said, “Father, I went to Stingy Shop a few days ago and found a new weapon..","Princess Raoxi told the king what had happened, contorting the truth. Naturally, she changed the subject to how polite she was and how aggressive and arrogant that ugly girl was. The girl was said to have crossed the line and disrespected the princess completely.","Princess Raoxi changed the subject. “Later, I couldn’t stand it anymore, so I made a stupid move. I wanted to kidnap that ugly girl in the middle of the night and teach her a lesson. I wanted to show her that the princess of the Northern Yan Kingdom isn’t to be trifled with!”","The prince gave her a strange look. To be honest, he would be anxious if he didn’t know who Feng Wu was, but now...","Princess Raoxi had no idea of Feng Wu’s background. So far, she had only addressed the girl as the “ugly girl”, which was why the king didn’t know who she was talking about.","Princess Raoxi looked frustrated. “I only wanted to teach her a lesson, so I sent some capable cultivators over. I didn’t expect to run into my brother.. He thought I was going to do something to Huyan Yichen, so he killed all the capable cultivators I sent!”"]},{"number":3879,"title":"Chapter 3879: The Complaint against Feng Wu (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3879: The Complaint against Feng Wu (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Father, they were all capable cultivators you gave me. There were seven Spiritual Overlords, and my brother killed them all by mistake. Not only didn’t they apologize to me, but they also tried to frame me for trying to assassinate Huyan Yichen and his family. Father, that’s so frustrating!”","The king frowned a little. He knew about it because Zhao had mentioned it when he investigated the incident earlier. All seven Spiritual Overlords under Raoxi had indeed died in the shop, and the culprits were the crown prince’s men.","“Is that true?” The king stared at the prince.","The prince nodded. “Father, it’s true.”","Princess Rao Xi gave him a suspicious look. He was supposed to explain himself, but he didn’t say a word... There had to be something behind it.","The king frowned. “Do you admit your crime?","The prince said affirmatively, “No.”","The king said, “You killed all seven Spiritual Overlords. How can you say that you won’t admit your crime?”","The prince went down on one knee. “Father, Raoxi sent people to assassinate that girl first. Am I going to let her kill the girl?” The king frowned. “Seven Spiritual Overlords? How dare you?!”","The prince pursed his lips and didn’t say a word.","Seeing that her father had taught the prince a lesson for her, Princess Raoxi was pleased. She felt she was the only one who could turn a bad thing into a good one. This time, she was determined to destroy her brother’s dignity! The king pointed at Princess Raoxi. “Go back first. I’ll deal with it.” Princess Raoxi and the queen left happily, leaving the father and son alone in the study.","The king still hadn’t let go of his frown. “I don’t care who that girl is. You’ve gone too far! Seven Spiritual Overlords...”","However, the prince said a name before the king could finish. Feng Wu.","The king was confused. “What?”","The prince looked into the king’s eyes and enunciated each word clearly. “Father, Raoxi sent seven Spiritual Overlords into the shop in the middle of the night to assassinate Feng Wu!”","The king said, “I don’t care who she is...”","However, he was interrupted once again.","The prince’s eyes darkened. “Father, you’ve heard of Feng Wu. She’s the newest talent with the phoenix blood from the Junwu Empire. She’s a genius, and she’s rumored to be Jun Linyuan’s fiancée...”","“Oh, it’s her...” Realization dawned on the king, and he mumbled, “If she gives birth to a baby with Jun Linyuan, it’ll have incredible talent.”","The king glanced at the prince, implying that it would be better if Raoxi could kill such a talented girl. Why would he want to save Feng Wu?","Thinking of this, the king glared at the prince, blaming him for being a","busybody.","The prince looked at the king and reminded him, “The Patriarch’s junior sister’s name is... Feng Wu.”","The Patriarch’s junior sister...","“Her?!” The king jumped to his feet. He was so excited that he almost knocked over the table.","The prince nodded.","The king was speechless.","He walked back and forth in the room in astonishment, mumbling to himself, “That’s impossible! That’s impossible!”","The prince watched his exasperated father in silence..."]},{"number":3880,"title":"Chapter 3880: The Complaint against Feng Wu (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3880: The Complaint against Feng Wu (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The king turned around and stared at the prince. “Are you telling the truth?!”","The prince nodded.","The king was dumbfounded.","“So, she’s Jun Linyuan’s unmarried wife?” The king wanted to cry.","The prince nodded again.","The king said, “That’s impossible. Isn’t she a thousand-year-old woman?”","The prince rubbed his forehead. “Father, Feng Wu isn’t even fifteen yet.”","The king was astonished.","The prince nodded. “Yup.”","The king was a little shaken today. He paced back and forth in the study with his hands behind his back and whined, “Is fate going to bring prosperity to the","Junwu Empire?”","Just then, Zhao came in to report that Huyan Yichen was here to see him.","Huyan Yichen had a token and was given the privilege of entering the palace.","Huyan Yichen? The king hesitated. It had been years since he last saw the kid in court. He used to like the kid a lot, but after his sister died in an accident, he never came back.","“Let him in,” said the king.","Huyan Yichen soon came in. He wasn’t as lively as he used to be. Instead, he was very polite and well-behaved.","The king sighed inwardly and chatted with Huyan Yichen about his grandfather for a while before talking about his purpose in coming to court.","“Princess Raoxi wants to kill us.” Huyan Yichen told the king what happened that night. “If the prince hadn’t been here, we would have been killed. Your Majesty, please help us.”","To protect Feng Wu, Huyan Yichen didn’t mention her name. He only said that Princess Raoxi wanted to kill him and his grandfather.","Moreover, Huyan Yichen said his grandfather had sent a memorial but never got a reply, so he was here to ask the king if he remembered what happened by the lake many years ago.","“By the lake?” The king looked nostalgic.","Back when the king was living by the lake, old Huyan had saved him, and the old man himself almost died. He hadn’t mentioned it when his granddaughter died, but now, he had brought it up. Was it to save Feng Wu?","So, he must have no idea of Feng Wu’s relationship with the Patriarch. The king turned to look at his son.","The prince nodded affirmatively.","The king didn’t know what to say. He couldn’t wait to see how shocked the old man would be when he learned who Feng Wu really was.","Just then, someone stuck her head into the room. “Hey, are you talking about","When the king and the prince turned around and saw who it was, they were both surprised.","The king was about to greet Feng Wu when he saw the dazed look on Huyan Yichen’s face.","Feng Wu knocked Huyan Yichen on the head. “Hey, stop drooling.”","Huyan Yichen wiped his mouth involuntarily, only to find that he wasn’t drooling. Embarrassed, he glared at Feng Wu.","But the girl was so pretty that Huyan Yichen couldn’t look away. He even forgot to get angry.","Jun Linyuan gave Huyan Yichen a sympathetic look and thought, “Brother, be careful. She’s not someone you can dream about. Even I don’t dare to think about her in that way.”","Feng Wu said grumpily, “What are you looking at?”"]},{"number":3881,"title":"Chapter 3881: The Complaint against Feng Wu (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3881: The Complaint against Feng Wu (4)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu said grumpily, “What are you looking at?” Huyan Yichen’s eyes widened in astonishment.","That look, that tone, that voice... That was...","“You are her!” Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu, too amazed to say anything","Feng Wu glanced at him. “It’s only been a few days. Don’t you recognize her?”","Huyan Yichen said, “You’re that ugly girl? Seriously?!” Feng Wu smiled at him.","That smile... Huyan Yichen finally recognized her!","“You...” Huyan Yichen was filled with regret.","“She’s so pretty! Why bother hiding her face?” If he knew how pretty she was, he wouldn’t have waited. He could have just courted her...”","“So, is Feng a made-up name as well?” Huyan Yichen gave Feng Wu a resentful look.","Feng Wu gave him an apologetic look and nodded. “I’m Feng Wu.”","Huyan Yichen snorted. “Feng Wu it is. That’s not a well-known name. Why do you want to hide it? Wait, Feng Wu!”","Huyan Yichen turned around and stared at Feng Wu. “Feng Wu of the Junwu","Empire?!”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Why, have you heard of my name before?”","Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu. “Of course I know your name! I’ve heard it for a long time! Feng Xun wrote me a letter to tell me how beautiful a girl is in the Junwu Empire, saying that we don’t have such a beauty here. I’m so jealous!” Feng Wu cleared her throat. She didn’t expect Feng Xun to be so goofy.","Huyan Yichen said, “He also said that Jun Linyuan, his buddy, was in love with the girl, but he was stubborn and wouldn’t speak, but he was jealous all the time. By the way, he also said in his letter that one day when he interacted more with you, Jun Linyuan challenged him to a duel in the middle of the night!”","What kind of person was Jun Linyuan?","No, it wasn’t like he hadn’t met Jun Linyuan before. That guy was supposed to be the proud, arrogant, lonely, invincible, and unapproachable type. How could he be so childish? The prince wouldn’t believe it!","Feng Wu blushed and glanced at Huyan Yichen. “I don’t know what you’re talking about.”","Huyan Yichen had no idea what secret he had revealed. He was thrilled by the coincidence and almost waved his hands in excitement. “And he also said in his letter that little Feng Wu is a genius. Not only is she pretty, but she’s also talented in formations and medicine. She’s amazing in everything!”","Feng Wu cleared her throat uneasily.","Huyan Yichen said, “I can’t take his word for it. He said you were talented and capable, but you didn’t have any spiritual essence at all.","“Wait...” Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu and was baffled. “Your energy doesn’t feel the same as before... Your spiritual essence... How’s your cultivation level?”","Feng Wu didn’t want to keep it from him anymore, so she told him her cultivation level. “I’m a peak Spiritual Overlord...” Huyan Yichen said, “A Spiritual Overlord?!”","Feng Wu said, “...Yes.”","Huyan Yichen said, “You have no family in the Northern Yan Kingdom. Don’t worry. I’ll take care of you!”","The two of them talked back and forth, ignoring the king completely.","The next moment, Huyan Yichen saw the prince go up to Feng Wu and greet her with a bow. “Greetings, Senior Grandaunt.”","Huyan Yichen’s eyes widened, and he stared at the prince.","After that, the prince glanced at Huyan Yichen and nodded.","“Wait.. What?”"]},{"number":3882,"title":"Chapter 3882: Don’t Tell Other People (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3882: Don’t Tell Other People (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“No, what...” Huyan Yichen was so shocked that he couldn’t speak. He only stared at the prince coldly. “What did you just call her?”","The prince asked, “What do you think?”","Huyan Yichen scratched his ear. “Am I hearing things? Did you just call her Senior Grandaunt?”","The prince put his hands behind his back and nodded confidently. He didn’t feel ashamed at all. Instead, he was very proud of himself.","Huyan Yichen gave the king a strange look.","By then, the king had realized what had happened.","The genius teenage girl of the Junwu Empire was Feng Wu, and Feng Wu was the Patriarch’s junior sister...","Just then, the king heard an authoritative voice.","It belonged to the Patriarch!","Hearing that, the king nodded immediately.","Everyone looked at him.","The king told Feng Wu, “The master told me not to tell anyone about you being his junior sister. Otherwise, you’ll be in danger. Please keep it a secret.”","Feng Wu nodded earnestly. She recalled what the old master said about the feud between his senior and junior brothers, as well as the fact that her master had kept him from the others. All in all, there had to be more to it!","Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Wu in astonishment. “No, no way!”","What did he just hear? The Patriarch’s junior sister? Feng Wu? How was that possible?","Just then, the king turned his cold gaze on Huyan Yichen. The look in his eyes was so indecipherable that it gave Huyan Yichen the creeps. He stumbled back and wanted to run away.","He felt a fatal fear!","Huyan Yichen’s muscles tensed up, and his heart raced.","He wasn’t stupid. On the contrary, he was very smart. He could tell from the king’s words that the Patriarch wanted the king to keep it a secret, and he might be killed because of it.","Feng Wu glanced at the king and shook her head. “I have faith in him.” The look in the kings eyes was still very stern.","Feng Wu became serious as well. She turned to the king and said, “If Huyan Yichen becomes the leak, I’ll talk to your Patriarch. Your Majesty, please do me a favor.”","Seeing that Feng Wu insisted, the king nodded. “Alright.”","Huyan Yichen’s clothes were soaked with sweat, and he felt as if he had been pulled out of the water.","Feng Wu calmly said goodbye to the king and dragged Huyan Yichen out.","“I was so scared...” Huyan Yichen was almost in tears. Holding Feng Wu’s hand, he looked touched. “If it hadn’t been for you, I would have died here today. His Majesty really wanted to silence me, and he didn’t try to hide it...","Huyan Yichen could understand that. Everyone in the Northern Yan Kingdom would do whatever the Patriarch said, but he had almost become the sacrifice.","Feng Wu was curious as well. “I see that my senior brother is a very prominent figure in the Northern Yan Kingdom.”","Huyan Yichen immediately covered her mouth. “My dear girl, please don’t call him your senior brother. I’m going to get killed.”","Feng Wu smiled bitterly. “Fine, fine. I won’t mention him. But it’s true. If word gets out, it’ll be very dangerous for me.”","Once other people found out that she was Mu Jiuzhou’s last pupil, they would do anything to get what they wanted. Back then, the secret manual alone was enough to wipe out the Zuo and Hua families.."]},{"number":3883,"title":"Chapter 3883: Don ‘t Tell Other People (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3883: Don ‘t Tell Other People (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Let’s go back to the shop.”","Feng Wu and Huyan Yichen were about to go back to the shop when they heard a shrilling voice.","“Oh my, who are they? They’re fighting in the imperial palace. What kind of place do they think this is?”","Feng Wu and Huyan Yichen turned around involuntarily and saw a large group of people walking toward them, and they all surrounded the two people in the front.","Feng Wu recognized the leader right away. It was Princess Rao.","As for the person who had spoken, it was the seventh princess.","She knew how to fawn on Raoxi since she was little and had been using Raoxi as an excuse to bully other people.","“Oh my, I was wondering who it was. Isn’t it Huyan Yichen? You’re finally willing to step into the imperial palace. What did you say back then? You swore","that you would never set foot in the imperial palace again.”","The seventh princess covered her mouth and smirked.","Huyan Yichen wouldn’t let her win. He smirked and said, “I was wondering who it could be. So, it’s the ‘vanguard princess’ that Princess Raoxi was talking about.”","Many people didn’t understand it, but Princess Raoxi narrowed her eyes and stared at Huyan Yichen. How did he know that?","The seventh princess frowned. “What vanguard? I don’t get it.”","Huyan Yichen chuckled. “That’s easy. The poem says ‘the king’s vanguard’. Princess Raoxi is the ‘king’ , and you’re the vanguard.”","Feng Wu laughed.","That was to say...","Seeing that everyone on Princess Raoi’s side was staring at her, Feng Wu immediately waved her hands. “I’m sorry. I couldn’t help it.”","The seventh princess didn’t get it, so she couldn’t say anything. She only stared at Feng Wu. “What does he mean? What does that phrase mean?”","Princess Raoxi gave Feng Wu a warning look, but Feng Wu acted as if she didn’t see it. She said to the seventh princess, “Isn’t that obvious?","“It’s from the poem ‘Boxi,’ and the whole line goes like this: My noble husband is now martial-like! The hero of the country! My husband, grasping his halberd, is in the leading chariot of the king’s host.”","Staring at Feng Wu, the seventh princess frowned and asked, “What’s that supposed to mean? Explain it! ”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Huyan Yichen smirked. “Can’t you understand? In other words, you’re the most capable warrior in our country. With a weapon in your hand, you’re the king’s pawn. Charge!”","Feng Wu chuckled again.","But the seventh princess’s face was scarlet red.","“How dare you?!” The seventh princess couldn’t stand it and wanted to hit Feng wu.","However, Huyan Yichen only smiled at her and wasn’t intimidated at all.","Maybe he didn’t dare to offend the princess before, but now... Xiao Wu was the junior sister of the Patriarch. Why should he be afraid?","Raoxi frowned and gave Huyan Yichen a suspicious look. She felt that Huyan Yichen had changed. He seemed to have become more confident all of a sudden. Whose power did he rely on?","Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen was trying to lure Princess Raoxi into his trap. He said to the seventh princess, “There’s no use yelling at me. I dare you to yell at your ‘king’.”","“You!” The seventh princess was furious. She wanted to slap Huyan Yichen.","However, Huyan Yichen wasn’t someone to be trifled with. He grabbed the princess’s raised hand.."]},{"number":3884,"title":"Chapter 3884: Feng Wu vs. Princess Raoxi (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3884: Feng Wu vs. Princess Raoxi (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Huyan Yichen grabbed the seventh princess’s hand.","“Huyan Yichen, how dare you!” The princess was furious. However, Huyan Yichen only sneered at her. “What do you think?”","‘You!”","The seventh princess turned around and shouted, “Are you all dead? Get over here! Take him and her down!”","She pointed at Feng Wu, trying to grab her as well.","Huyan Yichen glanced at her and smirked inwardly. “She has no idea what she’s doing.”","“Wait,” said Princess Raoxi.","Instantly, all eyes were on her.","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi moved closer and stopped in front of Feng Wu. There was a cold look in her eyes when she asked, “You look familiar. May I ask who you are?”","Feng Wu smiled at her. Her gaze was sharper than Princess Raoxi’s, and she didn’t show any weakness.","Next to her, the seventh princess was a little intimidated by Feng Wu’s demeanor and wondered who could outshine Raoxi.","Princess Raoxi smiled. “Why do I feel that you don’t look like someone from the","Northern Yan Kingdom?”","Feng Wu said indifferently, “Is that so?”","Princess Raoxi asked, “Are you from the Junwu Empire?”","That was to say, Princess Raoxi had recognized Feng Wu.","She was able to remain calm after recognizing Feng Wu. That was how shrewd Princess Raoxi was.","Feng Wu nodded. “Princess Raoxi, have we met before?”","Princess Raoxi smiled. “Someone showed me your portrait. That’s all.”","Feng Wu chuckled. “So, you went after me with my portrait?”","Princess Raoxi frowned.","She had recognized the person as Feng Wu, the one she was going to kill, for Feng Wu was so unparalleled and easy to recognize!","Princess Raoxi gritted her teeth.","She couldn’t wait to see Feng Wu dead, but in a public place like this, she had to behave like a princess. Yes, she wasn’t as pretty as Feng Wu, but she didn’t want to lose to Feng Wu either.","Princess Raoxi chuckled. “Miss Feng Wu, you’re so funny. I don’t know where you heard that.”","Feng Wu kept her unblinking gaze on Raoxi without saying a word.","Her stare made Raoxi furious. That look made her feel like a criminal!","Since that was the case, Princess Raoxi decided not to maintain her elegance anymore. She glanced at Huyan Yichen and frowned. “This isn’t the place for you. Apologize to Seven and get out of here.”","Apologize? Huyan Yichen gave her a contemptuous look and pretended that he didn’t hear her.","Princess Raoxi didn’t want to lose face in front of Feng Wu, but Huyan Yichen’s attitude made her feel utterly humiliated.","She glared at Huyan Yichen. “Do you know what crime you’ve committed by disrespecting me?”","Huyan Yichen said, “You’re not the king. Why should I be accused of disrespecting you? Don’t flatter yourself.”","Princess Raoxi smirked. “You’ve disrespected the princess of the royal family, which is the same as disrespecting my father. Isn’t that disrespectful? Wang","Wang Yi was Princess Raoxi’s guard.","Hearing that, Wang Yi walked up to Huyan Yichen.","He was ready to take Huyan Yichen down.","Of course, Huyan Yichen wouldn’t let that happen. He fought back right away.","However, Wang Yi was an exceptional cultivator. Feng Wu saw that he had reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage.."]},{"number":3885,"title":"Chapter 3885: Feng Wu vs. Princess Raoxi (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","With Feng Wu’s help, Huyan Yichen had only just become a junior Spiritual Overlord. How could he possibly be Wang Yi’s match?","With one strike, Wang Yi caught Huyan Yichen’s arm and was going to pin it behind his back.","Princess Raoxi and the seventh princess looked at each other, and both saw satisfaction in each other’s eyes.","However, the seventh princess still held some grudges against Princess Raoxi because of the whole “king and vanguard” thing.","While Raoxi was gloating, someone charged at Huyan Yichen.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","The next moment, there was a scream and a figure smashed into Princess Raoxi.","The person who screamed wasn’t Huyan Yichen, but Wang Yi.","Feng Wu grabbed Wang Yi and threw him at Princess Raoxi’s face.","Ordinary people wouldn’t be able to handle that momentum.","As expected!","At that close distance, Princess Raoxi didn’t have time to react. She screamed.","The next second, both she and Wang Yi flew backward and fell to the ground.","By then, everybody saw that Wang Yi and Princess Raoxi had their arms around each other. Wang Yi was on top, and Princess Raoxi was on the bottom.","They didn’t stop after falling and kept sliding forward.","The seventh princess was so shocked that she couldn’t do anything. Oh god, was that still that Raoxi she feared the most? Raoxi had been knocked over, and her guard was on top of her while everybody was watching! Oh god!","Princess Raoxi’s perfect image seemed to shatter a little.","After sliding for over ten meters, they smashed into a thorny fence.","“Ah!” Princess Raoxi screamed in pain. She was almost in tears.","They finally stopped.","She asked Huyan Yichen, “Are you alright?”","Wang Yi had grabbed his wrist just then, and Feng Wu saw that it was red and swollen.","However, all Huyan Yichen could see was what had happened to Princess Raoxi.","“Gosh... Feng Wu, you’re amazing!”","He had said that he was going to protect her, but as it turned out, he was the one being protected.","On second thought, he realized that the Patriarch’s junior sister was nothing but a powerful patron for him.","“Are you really that capable?” Huyan Yichen looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu nodded.","Huyan Yichen was almost in tears.","A peak Spiritual Overlord... She was only in her teens, but she was already a peak Spiritual Overlord. How could anyone compare to her?","“Are you alright?” Feng Wu glanced at Huyan Yichen’s hand again.","Huyan Yichen waved his hand. “I’m fine. Of course, I’m fine. But I can’t say the same for Princess Raoxi.”","Feng Wu said calmly, “It was self-defense, wasn’t it?”","As expected, Zhao, the king’s most capable servant, was standing behind Feng wu.","Zhao had seen it when the king addressed Feng Wu as his Aunt-Master. He knew what he should do.","He nodded when he heard the question.","By then, Princess Raoxi was finally helped to her feet.","She had never been mistreated like this before. She walked up to Feng Wu, threw off the help of the others, and raised her hand to slap the latter.","She was furious!","She had always been willful, so she decided to stop pretending.","However..."]},{"number":3886,"title":"Chapter 3886: Against Princess Raoxi (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Raoxi raised her hand, trying to slap Feng Wu. However...","Feng Wu was too capable to sit still and let other people slap her.","Therefore, when Raoxi was about to slap Feng Wu, the latter followed Raoxi’s momentum and struck down.","The next second, Raoxi spun around like a top.","She spun over and over again...","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","She couldn’t stop spinning.","The seventh princess opened her eyes wide and stared at the scene in disbelief. No, it couldn’t be... Oh god, even the aloof Raoxi would end up in such a sorry state. She must want to stop now. How embarrassing...","But no.","Under everyone’s gaze, Raoxi kept spinning.","10, 20, 30... She didn’t stop until she became dizzy and fell to the ground.","Everyone was speechless.","“How dare you?!”","Raoxi’s maids bellowed at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu recognized them. They were Caixia and Muli. Feng Wu still remembered how Caixia tried to kill her that night. Right now, she was slapping Caixia’s master for fun.","Feng Wu smiled a little.","Caixia found the girl rather familiar.","She found the ugly girl at Huyan Yichen’s place familiar, and this stunning girl looked just as familiar. What was going on?","By then, Raoxi had finally recovered. She stared at Feng Wu and smirked. “Do you really think no one can stop you?”","Feng Wu shrugged without saying a word.","Raoxi turned to Zhao. “Zhao, why should we leave such a person alive?! ”","Zhao smiled bitterly at Raoxi.","Kill her?","His Majesty would probably kill the princess first.","However, Zhao was too smart to say such hurtful words. He would only smile at Raoxi and ask her to calm down.","It just so happened that he had been standing by Feng Wu’s side the whole time as if he was guarding her.","Raoxi was furious.","The palm print on Raoxi’s face was swollen. She stared at Zhao with a grim look on her face. “Zhao, don’t you want to see the future?”","“The future?” Zhao thought, “Do you mean after you, Princess Raoxi, take the throne? I don’t think so...","Zhao smiled at Raoxi, pretending that he couldn’t understand her.","Raoxi had made it very clear, but Zhao still didn’t seem to understand her. She realized that Zhao wasn’t going to help her.","“Fine!” Raoxi pointed at Feng Wu and Zhao. “I’m going to see my father!” Feng Wu and Zhao exchanged looks, and Feng Wu shrugged.","Just then, Raoxi turned around and pointed at Feng Wu. “Just wait and see! Just you wait!”","After that, Raoxi picked up her skirt and rushed toward the study.","She needed her father’s help.","Caixia and the others sneered at Feng Wu, thinking that she was doomed.","The seventh princess smirked. “So, you’re Feng Wu of the Junwu Empire. I’ve heard of your name before, and I know you’re famous in the Junwu Empire..”"]},{"number":3887,"title":"Chapter 3887: Against Princess Raoxi (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3887: Against Princess Raoxi (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“But this is the Northern Yan Kingdom, and the person you’ve beaten up is one of the future heirs to the throne!” The seventh princess smirked. “How bold of you... I’d like to see how you’re going to get out of this after my father arrives!” However, Feng Wu only glanced at her and remained unperturbed.","“Gosh, are we just going to stand here? My legs are a little tired.” Feng Wu looked at Zhao in grievance.","The seventh princess glanced at Feng Wu and smirked. “Get tired just by standing there? You’re a Spiritual Overlord who can beat Raoxi up! Stop lying!","“Moreover, everyone here is more prestigious than a nobody from the Junwu Empire. Do you think you’ll get a chair?”","However, with a wave of his hand, a young eunuch showed up and crouched down in front of Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked from the obedient eunuch to Zhao and shook her head.","Of course, she knew what Zhao meant, but she couldn’t sit on a eunuch’s back like everyone else in the imperial palace. Zhao immediately took Feng Wu’s hint.","Luckily, he was well-prepared.","As soon as the young eunuch knelt, Zhao told another eunuch to fetch a chair. As expected, the young eunuch returned shortly afterward.","He didn’t dare to breathe loudly when he put the chair down in front of Feng Wu. He only caught his breath after he stepped back.","Zhao straightened his chair and invited Feng Wu to sit down. “Miss Feng, please have a seat.”","Feng Wu nodded and sat down.","The seventh princess’s eyes widened.","Her eyes were big and round to begin with, and they almost popped out now.","What was going on? She couldn’t understand it.","She couldn’t understand why Feng Wu, a nobody from the Junwu Empire, could be treated like this by Zhao, who was her father’s most trusted servant. The king never said anything, so Zhao represented how the king felt about Feng Wu. In that case...","Was it because she was pretty?","Was it because her father liked Feng Wu and wanted to make her his consort? Was that it?","Ahhh!!!","At that thought, the seventh princess wanted to scream. Why? Why? She wouldn’t have it!","Hence, the look she gave Feng Wu became even more fierce.","Feng Wu was confused. What was this princess doing? Why did she look like she was going to lose her mind?","By then, Raoxi had reached the king.","“Father...","Raoxi sobbed like a poor girl.","The king was going through the memorials to the throne when he saw a person kneeling in front of him and crying like a poor kitten.","Who else could it be but his Raoxi?","“How did you...”","The king helped Raoxi to her feet. Seeing her crying, he softened a little and wasn’t as displeased with her anymore.","“What’s going on?” The king frowned.","Raoxi happened to look up at that moment.","Her cheeks were swollen, and it was obvious that she had been slapped. Her clothes were also smeared with dirt...","“You...” The king couldn’t believe his eyes.. Why did Raoxi look like she had been beaten up?"]},{"number":3888,"title":"Chapter 3888: Against Princess Raoxi (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3888: Against Princess Raoxi (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Wasn’t she supposed to be the one beating people up? No one in the imperial palace could touch her.","The prince was there as well, and he was surprised to see Raoxi like this. How could it have been? No human being would dare to pick on her.","‘What happened?” The king frowned and looked displeased.","After all, she was his daughter. He could teach her a lesson himself, but other people... Of course, the king wasn’t happy.","“Father, please help me...” Raoxi wailed and held the king’s hand.","The king’s face darkened. “Speak. Who did this to you?”","As she sobbed, Raoxi said, “Someone hit me just because she’s a Spiritual Overlord...","The king said, “You have more than one Spiritual Overlord to protect you.”","Raoxi said, “That person is a peak Spiritual Overlord...”","Raoxi didn’t want to reveal Feng Wu’s cultivation level, because she felt too humiliated.","Raoxi considered herself to be the most talented girl in the kingdom. After cultivating for so long and using so many spiritual medicines from the Northern Yan Kingdom, she was only a Spiritual Overlord at most. However, Wang Yi had just told her that Feng Wu was at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage, which almost made Raoxi jealous.","The king frowned. “Only a handful of people are at the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage in the palace. Who would dare to pick on you? Go get them. I’ll talk to them!”","He could teach Princess Raoxi a lesson, but if someone tried to pick on her because they were too powerful, he wouldn’t let it happen.","Hearing that, Raoxi was elated.","She had thought that Feng Wu had something to depend on, which was why she had been so arrogant. As it turned out, she didn’t!","“Father, I’ll go get her now! A nobody from the Junwu Empire can’t behave so arrogantly in Northern Yan!” After that, Raoxi quickly walked away, feeling very pleased.","“Stop!”","Hearing that, the king rose to his feet and stared at Raoxi. “Did you just say the Junwu Empire... Are you talking about Feng Wu?!”","Raoxi nodded. “That’s right.”","Seeing the look on her father’s face, Raoxi suddenly felt uneasy. She asked gingerly, “Father, what’s wrong?”","The kin didn’t answer her. Instead, he said with a straight face, “I’ll go with you!”","Raoxi was elated, and all her doubts were gone. She smiled through her tears.","“Yes.”","When the king and Raoxi arrived, Feng Wu was sunbathing in boredom and almost fell asleep.","The others didn’t know what to say when they saw how calm Feng Wu was.","The prince came with Emperor Yan as well. He was just a bystander.","However, his heart skipped a beat when he saw her exquisite profile.","No, no, no...","The prince looked away and tried to remind himself not to look at her or think about her...","However, he couldn’t help but steal a glance at Feng Wu. He couldn’t control himself... How could there be such a woman in this world? Why did she look so attractive even when she was dozing off? “Father!” The seventh princess greeted the king.","The others followed suit.","Feng Wu woke up in a daze when she heard the noise, but she still wiped the corner of her mouth.","The sun was a little dazzling, so Feng Wu raised a hand to block the light. Her gaze then landed on Princess Raoxi, who was standing behind the king.","She saw..."]},{"number":3889,"title":"Chapter 3889: Oh God (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3889: Oh God (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu rubbed her sleepy eyes and saw that the emperor was standing right in front of her. Behind him was... Princess Raoxi.","Right now, she was staring at Feng Wu.","She stared at Feng Wu with a malicious look in her eyes and smirked as if she thought that Feng Wu was doomed.","Feng Wu glanced at the king impatiently when she saw him.","Everyone’s stomach lurched when they saw the look on Feng Wu’s face.","Impatient?","Impatient with a king? That couldn’t be. They had to be mistaken.","Seeing Feng Wu’s darkened face, the king panicked.","The eldest prince didn’t know, but the king had heard a rumor that their Patriarch was Mu Jiuzhou’s pupil.","Although it was only a rumor and wasn’t widespread, the king believed it.","His father was the one who had spread the rumor!","The rumor passed down in the royal family might not be a rumor but a secret history!","The king was already convinced when he saw how close the Patriarch and his junior sister were.","If she really was the final pupil of Master Mu Jiuzhou... The king’s knees buckled, and he almost dropped to the ground.","Meanwhile, Raoxi gave Feng Wu a sidelong glance and curled her little finger. “Kneel and kowtow to me.”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, the king bellowed, “Raoxi!”","That voice made Raoxi jump, and she stared at the king in bewilderment.","The king shouted, “Kneel!”","Princess Raoxi was speechless.","Things had happened so fast...","Raoxi didn’t realize what had happened. She only stared at the king in bewilderment.","All she could think of was the same question.","Why? Why? Why?","Feng Wu glanced at Raoxi but didn’t say anything. She only crossed her arms and watched her quietly.","The look in the king’s eyes had never been so stern and fierce. His intimidating power swept toward Raoxi like a mountain pressing down on her, making her tremble, and her Imees buckled.","She had seen her father losing his temper before, but she had never been the target.","Raoxi knew very well that when her father was infuriated if she went against him, she would end up in a miserable state. She had seen with her own eyes how her father’s favorite concubine had talked back to him and ended up getting killed!","“F- Father...” Without hesitation, Raoxi dropped to her knees. She was trembling from fear.","When infuriated, her father would do anything. Raoxi trembled inwardly.","“Not at me.” Although the king’s voice was calm, it was bone-chillingly cold.","Princess Raoxi was astonished.","So were the others.","Zhao, the eunuch on Feng Wu’s side, didn’t think much of it. Although he Imew who Feng Wu really was, he didn’t realize that he had underestimated her. As for Raoxi’s people, they were almost driven crazy by the news.","It was so terrifying.","Who on earth was this person? Why did Princess Raoxi have to kneel down and apologize to her?","Even an ordinary princess shouldn’t be asked to do that, not to mention that Raoxi was the crown prince-to-be. This wasn’t something she could take lightly!","In the crowd, only..."]},{"number":3890,"title":"Chapter 3890: Oh God (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3890: Oh God (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","In the crowd, only the seventh princess nodded. Yes, it had to be what she had guessed.","At that moment, Raoxi finally realized that her father meant it.","Tears welled up in her eyes, and she felt so wronged!","But in the end, she still whispered something to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at her and smiled. “Princess Raoxi, what did you say?”","Raoxi gritted her teeth, but she had to raise her voice. “I’m sorry!”","Feng Wu smiled at her. “Who are you apologizing to?”","Raoxi knew that Feng Wu did it on purpose, but with her father’s support, Feng Wu would win no matter what!","Raoxi thought, “Forget it. It’s never too late for me to take my revenge! Feng","Wu, just wait and see!”","As expected of Princess Raoxi. Once she changed her attitude, she could speak much more freely. Tears welled up in her eyes, and she looked very aggrieved.","“Miss Feng Wu, I don’t know what I did to offend you, but since you’ve said that I was wrong, I’m sorry.” After that, Raoxi glanced at her father and burst into tears.","The king felt sorry for Raoxi.","However, Feng Wu only smiled at her. “Don’t you know what you’ve done to offend me? Didn’t you want to kill me?”","Raoxi’s stomach lurched. “She knew!”","However, Raoxi still looked as if she had been wronged. She said aggrievedly, “Miss Feng Wu, where did you hear that rumor? I’ve never met you before, so why should I feel resentful? Why should I want you?”","The king also looked at Feng Wu suspiciously.","Rubbing her chin, Feng Wu said calmly, “I want to know why you want to kill me, too. You can tell me when you’ve made up your mind.”","Feng Wu rose to her teet after that.","Raoxi shouted after Feng Wu, “Miss Feng Wu, I’ve never sent anyone after you. I’m afraid you’ve misunderstood. If there really is such a rumor, someone is trying to frame me, and he’ll get the greatest benefit. Miss, please be wise, and don’t let other people fool you.”","Was that a hint that either Feng Wu had slandered her or the eldest prince had done it?","The prince was furious.","“Do you think I need to slander a kid like you?” Feng Wu waved at Raoxi impatiently and left.","Raoxi was furious.","Feng Wu was treating Raoxi as if the latter was an annoying kid of the family. That was so frustrating!","The king threw a dirty look at Raoxi.","After the others left, the seventh princess walked up to Raoxi and whispered, “I Imow why father is biased toward her.”","Raoxi frowned and glanced at her.","The seventh princess whispered something in Raoxi’s ear. The next second, Raoxi frowned.","“That’s impossible!” She shook her head.","But the seventh princess said affirmatively, “It has to be. Look, Feng Wu is so pretty. Have you seen anyone like her before? Right?”","Raoxi threw a dirty look at her and turned to leave.","But the seventh princess ran after her and said, “So, I think father is definitely infatuated with her and wants to make her his concubine.. She’s so pretty... If she’s like this before she goes to court, our father will believe everything she says in the future...”"]},{"number":3891,"title":"Chapter 3891: Feng Xun (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3891: Feng Xun (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Raoxi pushed the seventh princess away before she could finish. Seeing that Raoxi had left, the seventh princess smirked.","“Raoxi, I won’t let you use me anymore!”","Feng Wu had no idea that she could sow dissatisfaction between the seventh princess and Princess Raoxi with just a few words. Right now, she had already left with Huyan Yichen.","Feng Wu went back to the tower, while Huyan Yichen went back to the shop.","All of a sudden, Huyan Yichen stopped Feng Wu. “Wait.”","Feng Wu looked back at him in bewilderment.","“You...” Huyan Yichen suddenly whispered, “Do you have someone you like?” The eldest prince smacked Huyan Yichen on the head.","Huyan Yichen glared at the prince. “What are you doing? That hurts!”","The prince thought, “I’d rather you die from the pain than get killed by Jun","Linyuan.”","He dragged Huyan Yichen to the side and whispered something to him.","Soon, Feng Wu heard Huyan Yichen’s surprised voice.","“What?!","“Really?!","“That’s impossible!","“I don’t believe it!","Five minutes passed before they returned, and Feng Wu realized that Huyan Yichen looked very awkward when he saw her.","Feng Wu looked at him in bewilderment.","However, after throwing a dirty look at Feng Wu, Huyan Yichen went back into the shop and locked the door behind him.","Feng Wu was confused.","She looked at the tightly shut door of the shop before turning to the prince.","“Did I offend him?”","The prince smiled bitterly.","He couldn’t explain to her, but with Huyan Yichen’s temper, he should be able to figure it out in no time.","The prince was about to speak to Feng Wu when someone rushed toward them.","Instead of looking at Feng Wu and the prince, the person knocked on the door of the shop.","Thump, thump, thump!","Thump, thump, thump!","If one didn’t know better, they would think that he was here for a fight.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded when she saw the person standing outside the shop.","He was an old acquaintance.","However, the person didn’t even look around. He just stood outside the shop and banged on the door with all his strength.","Inside, Huyan Yichen was already angry, and he was even more agitated now. He opened the door abruptly.","He was astonished when he saw who it was.","“You!” Huyan Yichen glared at the man. “What are you doing here?”","The person that was supposed to be the least likely to show up here was right outside his house.","“Why are you here?” Huyan Yichen stared at Feng Xun.","Yes.","The visitor was none other than Feng Xun.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded as well, but Feng Xun hadn’t spotted her yet. Feng Xun rolled his eyes at Huyan Yichen. “I’m here to see you. What? You don’t welcome me?”","Huyan Yichen was in a bad mood. He was heartbroken before he could make any achievements... Why did that happen to him? According to the prince, Feng Wu and Jun Linyuan of the Junwu Empire...","wait!","Feng Xun was Jun Linyuan’s childhood friend, wasn’t he? Huyan Yichen was even more frustrated. He pushed Feng Xun away. “Go away. You’re not welcome here.”","Feng Xun had no idea what was going on here.. He thought that Huyan Yichen was like this because of that lousy iron all those years ago..."]},{"number":3892,"title":"Chapter 3892: Feng Xun (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3892: Feng Xun (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun chuckled and put his right hand on Huyan Yichen’s shoulder. “Gosh, what’s wrong with you? It’s been so many years. Why are you still holding grudges?”","Feng Xun patted Huyan Yichen on the chest as he spoke. “You’re a man. Don’t be so petty. I don’t remember anything from the past.” Huyan Yichen grumbled, “Of course you don’t.”","Wait!","Huyan Yichen’s eyes lit up.","That didn’t make sense. He had indeed been tricked by Feng Xun and had paid a lot of money for a pile of useless iron. However, didn’t Feng Wu turn it into an invaluable weapon? And what happened afterward had taught Raoxi such a lesson.","Feng Xun looked at Huyan Yichen in bewilderment. Why did his eyes suddenly light up?","Huyan Yichen kept staring at Feng Xun with a smile, which gave Feng Xun the creeps.","“Why are you laughing?” Feng Xun was suspicious.","Huyan Yichen guffawed.","Feng Xun was confused. “Hey, why are you laughing?”","Huyan Yichen finally stopped laughing, but he pointed at Feng Xun and gloated. “That piece of junk... Hahaha, who told you that was junk? Feng Xun, you have poor taste.”","Feng Xun was perplexed.","It was definitely a piece of junk.","Huyan Yichen said, “That piece of junk has been refined into an arm of discipline. Have you heard of it before?”","Feng Xun shook his head.","Huyan Yichen gloated at Feng Xun. “The arm of discipline is a semi-divine weapon. Do you know what that means? The so-called useless iron is actually divine iron. ”","Feng Xun said, “Really? I don’t believe you!”","Huyan Yichen clicked his tongue.","Feng Xun said, “I don’t believe you unless you show me that weapon.”","Huyan Yichen grumbled. Before, he could go to Feng Wu for help, but now that he decided he wouldn’t talk to Feng Wu for a day, he couldn’t bring himself to ask for her help.","Seeing that he couldn’t come up with the weapon, Feng Xun thought he was bragging, so he waved Huyan Yichen off and said seriously, “Enough with that.","I know you’re very capable. Can you help me find someone?”","Huyan Yichen glanced at Feng Xun. “No.”","Feng Xun threw an arm over his shoulder. “Why? Why won’t you help me?”","From afar, Feng Wu was amazed. Feng Xun was really good at making friends.","Huyan Yichen was mad at Feng Xun at first. After all, Feng Xun had tricked him for so many years, but that was exactly what Feng Xun was capable of. As soon as Feng Xun showed up, he behaved like Huyan Yichen’s best friend.","Huyan Yichen was too young and soft-hearted to chase Feng Xun away.","Feng Xun seemed to decide to stay in the shop for a while. Not only that, but he had asked Huyan Yichen to look for someone.","Huyan Yichen sat angrily at the desk and rested his face on his hands. “I’m not helping you... I’m not...”","Feng Xun nudged him and repeated the same words. “Help me. Help me. Help me...”","Feng Wu and the prince were walking in when they saw this, and she almost burst out laughing.","Feng Xun was the cutest teenager in the world.","“Fine, fine. You’re so annoying. Now, who are you looking for? Get lost as soon as you find them!” Huyan Yichen feigned an angry tone.","Feng Xun wanted to say something.","Just then, Feng Xun looked up and saw...","“Little Feng Wu!” Feng Xun’s eyes widened in surprise.."]},{"number":3893,"title":"Chapter 3893: You I re So Amazing (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3893: You I re So Amazing (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Little Feng Wu!” Feng Xun’s eyes widened in surprise.","He stared at the person in disbelief.","Little Feng Wu?","Was it really the person he was looking for?","What was going on?","He had searched high and low for her, but she just so happened to be there!","Feng Xun left Huyan Yichen behind and quickly walked toward Feng Wu.","Meanwhile, Huyan Yichen had raised his chin and was waiting for Feng Xun to beg him again before he said yes.","“Hey, you...”","Huyan Yichen cried out involuntarily when he saw Feng Xun run off.","Feng Xun ignored Huyan Yichen, for all his attention was on Feng Wu.","“Why are you here? Are you really here? That’s really...” Feng Xun cried out in surprise. “Did you wait here because you knew I was coming?”","Huyan Yichen moved closer. “Did you find...”","However, Feng Xun pushed him away. “I’ve found her. I don’t need you anymore.”","He knew it. He knew it. That scumbag Feng Xun was relentless.","Huyan Yichen grumbled, “You weren’t like this when you begged me...”","Feng Xun grabbed Feng Wu’s arm. “Kiddo, I heard that you were being chased. I was so...”","Feng Wu was amused. “Are you not mad anymore?”","Feng Xun suddenly realized something. He had only left because he had fallen out with Feng Wu.","What happened on the boat...","Feng Xun blushed.","“Of course I’m mad! I’m so mad! Hmph!” Crossing his arms, Feng Xun threw a dirty look at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu chuckled.","She knew that Feng Xun wouldn’t stay mad for long.","It wouldn’t do him any good to keep their conflict to himself, so she said it on purpose to tease Feng Xun and let it drop.","“Stay bad, then. I’m going to see Princess Raoxi now.”","“Do you have a death wish?!”","As soon as he heard that Feng Wu was going to see Princess Raoxi, Feng Xun, who had been pretending to be angry, turned into a roaring dog. “Go to see her? Do you have a death wish? Don’t you know that she’s after you? Why do you want to see her?!”","Feng Wu smiled at Feng Xun. “Fine, fine. I won’t go to her. But how did you know that she was after me?”","Feng Xun said grumpily, “Boss Jun said so.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “He knows? How?”","Feng Xun nodded. “What doesn’t he know about you? He also told me to come here and protect you.","“And...” Feng Xun took a letter out of his chest pocket and handed it to Feng Wu. “He can’t come here yet, so he asked someone else to do it.”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Who?”","“Northern Yan’s king,” said Feng Xun. “Technically, it’s a letter of credence. I think the king will scold Princess Raoxi after he gets it.”","Feng Wu frowned. “If it’s a letter of credence, It’s a big deal, and the Junwu Empire will have to pay a price, won’t we?”","Jun Linyuan would have to pay a price if he wanted to ask for the king’s help.","Feng Xun nodded. “Of course. He...”","Feng Xun suddenly stopped talking. He waved his hand and said, “That’s not important. We just need to give Boss Jun time. When he’s free, he can take care of Princess Raoxi in no time. Don’t worry. It’ll be alright.”","Feng Xun had faith in Jun Linyuan.."]},{"number":3894,"title":"Chapter 3894: You ‘re So Amazing (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3894: You ‘re So Amazing (2)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu was curious... What did Jun Linyuan promise the king with this letter? Was that why he was so confident that the emperor would discipline Raoxi? Huyan Yichen snorted.","Feng Xun glanced at him over his shoulder. “Huyan Yichen, what are you doing? Do you want to sneeze?”","Huyan Yichen snorted. “You don’t need His Majesty to discipline Raoxi. That’s just unnecessary. Your crown prince’s letter is so redundant!”","Feng Xun frowned at Huyan Yichen. “What’s that supposed to mean? Why do I feel that you’re a little displeased with Boss Jun?”","Of course, Huyan Yichen was displeased. Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu...","But...","Jun Linyuan could write a letter directly to the king, whereas the king could silence Huyan Yichen whenever he wanted to... Huyan Yichen sighed inwardly, but he couldn’t be stubborn anymore.","He said grumpily, “He really doesn’t need to do that. You’d better ask your dear sister. ”","He then turned around.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in bewilderment. “Xiao Wu, what’s going on?”","Feng Wu smiled, nodded at Feng Xun, and said, “Huyan Yichen is right. We don’t need to ask the king for help because we have a more powerful patron now.”","Feng Xun was confused. “A more capable patron? Someone better than the king?”","Feng Wu nodded matter-of-factly.","Feng Xun said, “Really? I don’t believe you. The king is the ruler of Northern Yan, and he’s the sovereign that calls the shots. Who would dare to challenge him?”","Feng Wu smiled. “So, tell me, is there really no one better in the Northern Yan Kingdom?”","Tilting his head, Feng Xun gave it some thought and said, “You can’t say that. Patriarch Huyan is such a prominent figure that even the king can’t surpass him. But... isn’t he supposed to be very unapproachable and elusive? Can we find him?","“Even if we can find him and ask him for help, it’ll be almost impossible, right?” Feng Xun found the idea unreliable.","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Do you still remember why we’re here in Northern Feng Xun said, “To treat your injury, then travel the world...’","“Hey, wait!” Feng Xun’s eyes widened. He took a step back and studied Feng Wu as he walked around her.","He rubbed his chin, and his eyes lit up. “Why do I feel that... You’re moving swiftly now and aren’t as weak as before.”","Feng Wu smiled at him. “Take another guess.”","Seeing that Feng Wu was teasing Feng Xun, Huyan Yichen was elated. “Feng","Xun, it’s your turn!”","No wonder they said that no matter how capable one was, there would always be someone who could control them. As it turned out, Feng Wu was that person who could control Feng Xun. How lucky.","Huyan Yichen was only infatuated with Feng Wu for a brief moment. After Feng Xun’s quips, his feelings for her had long dissipated.","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu. ‘Your spiritual essence... Remove the Concealing","Jade and let me see what level you are.”","Feng Xun thought, “No matter how capable you are, you’ll be a junior Spiritual","Overlord at most.”","However, after Feng Wu removed the Concealing Jade, Feng Xun felt a tremendous amount of spiritual essence rushing toward him, which made him stumble back involuntarily!"]},{"number":3895,"title":"Chapter 3895: You’re So Amazing (3)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“No, this isn’t right!”","Feng Xun’s eyes widened, and he stared at Feng Wu. “You’re definitely not a junior Spiritual Overlord! I know what a junior Spiritual Overlord is like! I’m a","junior Spiritual Overlord myself!”","Feng Wu smiled at him and nodded.","Feng Xun gritted his teeth and asked, “Are you telling me that you’re already an intermediate Spiritual Overlord?”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Feng Wu was still smiling at him.","Feng Xun asked, “Are you a Level-5 Spiritual Overlord?” Feng Wu shook her head.","Feng Xun took a deep breath. “Level-6 Spiritual Overlord?”","Feng Wu was still smiling and shaking her head.","Feng Xun’s stomach lurched...","“Y- you’re not a Level-7 Spiritual Overlord, are you?” Feng Xun didn’t dare to guess anymore. “You were only a junior Spiritual Overlord when we parted.","Please don’t scare me like that.”","However, Feng Wu chuckled and kept smiling at him.","Huyan Yichen darted a look at Feng Xun, his eyes filled with satisfaction. “Oh my, Feng Xun, I didn’t know you could be shocked by a genius. Do you know how resentful I was when you used your talent to bully me?”","Huyan Yichen couldn’t help but laugh. It was so satisfying!","He found it so satisfying to hang out with Feng Wu. Hence, he decided that he and Feng Wu were friends again.","Feng Wu had no idea how Huyan Yichen’s mind had changed.","Feng Xun waved at Huyan Yichen. “Go away. You know nothing.”","After that, Feng Xun chased Huyan Yichen away and stared at Feng Wu. “If you’re not a Level-7 Spiritual Overlord, what level are you now?”","Feng Wu smiled. “I’m a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord.”","Feng Xun stared at her with widened eyes.","Feng Wu gave a perfect guileless look and nodded. “Not only am I a Level-9 Spiritual Overlord, but I’m also a peak one.”","Feng Xun was astonished.","Seeing how shocked Feng Xun was, Feng Wu beamed at him. She knew it.","Feng Xun rubbed his face. “Well... Sister, are you joking with me? It’s not funny at all.”","“I’m not joking! Xiao Wu has reached the peak of Level 9 of the Spiritual Overlord stage, and that’s what she is now. Feng Xun, you can’t question a talented person just because you don’t have the talent.”","Huyan Yichen retorted without hesitation.","It was so satisfying to talk back to Feng Xun. He had never felt so good in his life. Little Feng Wu was like a little angel that had lit up his world.","Feng Xun threw a dirty look at Huyan Yichen before turning back to Feng Wu.","“Is that true?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes.”","Feng Xun didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Feng Xun said, “I, I... I don’t think this world is real. Huyan Yichen, pinch me... Ah! Did you really do that?!”","Since Huyan Yichen had such a rare opportunity, of course, he wouldn’t hold back.","The pain almost brought tears to Feng Xun’s eyes, but he did feel the pain.","“So, it’s true? You’re really a peak Spiritual Overlord now?” Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu with a long face.."]},{"number":3896,"title":"Chapter 3896: You’re So Amazing (4)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu nodded with a perfectly guileless look on her face. “Yes.”","Feng Xun sobbed. He was so sad and jealous...","He felt abandoned.","He used to be much more capable than Feng Wu, but ever since Feng Wu regained her ability, she began to make rapid progress and surpassed him. However, she soon fell ill and lost her cultivation ability again.","Feng Xun felt that he could be a good, protective brother to his sister now.","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","As it turned out...","The next time they met, the girl had improved again!","“Do you not need to train at all? Do you just sit there and get stronger?” Feng Xun said with a long face. He was so envious. Feng Wu chuckled. ‘What are you talking about? I’ve been working very hard.”","Feng Xun thought, “Like hell, I’ll believe you.”","However, if he could make so many breakthroughs in such a short time, he would be willing to do anything.","“By the way, how are you doing? I see that you’ve had an adventure as well.” Feng Wu looked curiously at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun had only just made a breakthrough to the Spiritual Overlord stage when they parted, but now, he was already a Level-3 Spiritual Overlord. Not bad.","He had indeed had a little lucky encounter. He had thought that he would be able to get closer to Feng Wu’s cultivation level, but that wasn’t the case.","How sad.","Feng Wu patted Feng Xun on the head as if he was a wounded puppy. “There, there. Don’t be sad. I’ll take you to...”","Feng Wu was going to say “Senior Brother”, but she then remembered that she had to keep their relationship a secret for her own safety, so she changed her mind. “I’ll take you to see the Patriarch and see if he has any other pills for you.”","Feng Xun asked curiously, “Did you take some pills? Wait, Patriarch, you...’ Feng Wu answered Feng Xun’s first question.","“That’s right. I took the Primary Heaven Pill.” Feng Wu winked at Feng Xun.","Feng Xun had to have heard of the famous pill.","As expected, Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu in astonishment. “The Primary","Heaven Pill? Is it the one that can revive the dead? Have you taken it?!”","Feng Wu said, “Can it revive the dead? I don’t know, but it can indeed strengthen one’s body. After taking it, I’ve reached the stage where I can enhance my bone marrow.”","“That stage?” Feng Xun almost fell to the ground again.","He had been refining his body since he was little, but after over a decade...","“You... Forget it. Let’s not talk about your cultivation anymore... The Patriarch? As in Patriarch Huyan, who’s more prestigious than the Northern Yan’s king?” Feng Xun was intrigued.","Feng Wu nodded. “That’s right.”","Feng Xun was confused. “Why did you come to him? Wait... how can you see him? It’s supposed to be very hard to see him.”","Huyan Yichen said grumpily, “What do you mean by ‘very difficult’? It was very easy for her to meet him. Not only did she meet the Patriarch, but she has also taken his Primary Heaven Pill.”","Feng Xun stared at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu nodded.","Feng Xun said, “Wait, wait. Let me think it through... I’m so shocked that I can’t think straight.”","Only then did Feng Xun turn his gaze on Feng Wu. “So, you’re saying that not only did you meet the legendary top cultivator of the Northern Yan Kingdom, but you’re also very close to him? You even took the legendary Primary Heaven Pill and reached the peak of the Spiritual Overlord stage?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right.”","Feng Xun smacked his forehead.. “If we knew how capable you are, we wouldn’t have been so worried!”"]},{"number":3897,"title":"Chapter 3897: Compared to Boss Jun (1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Wu mumbled, “You didn’t have to worry about me. I’m so smart...”","Feng Xun didn’t hear her. “What did you say?”","Feng Wu immediately fawned on him. “I was just saying. Brother, I’m so touched by how worried you all are about me.”","Feng Xun rubbed Feng Wu’s head and gloated. “Isn’t it my duty to care about you? And you have to thank Jun Linyuan. Ever since he found out that you were being hunted by all those people, he was so mad that he went off to destroy those people’s forces!”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “What do you mean by that?”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Feng Xun smiled. “Haven’t you noticed that no one in the Zuo and Hua families has bothered you recently?”","Feng Wu tilted her head and gave it some thought. That was true. Ever since she came to the imperial capital, she didn’t feel like she was being watched anymore. She had always thought that it was because those people weren’t watching Northern Yan.","“Of course, it’s not like that. That old man has been watching you the whole time, and he couldn’t wait to stew you. You have the Divine Phoenix Blood.” Feng Xun gloated. “They stopped watching you because Boss Jun has made them cry.”","Feng Wu was amazed. “Cry?”","Feng Xun waved his hand. “Yes, it’s an exaggeration, but it’s more or less the same because Boss Jun went to the old Zuo family manor in Jingyang Province first and severely injured the old master there!”","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Wasn’t the Zuo family’s old master already...”","Feng Xun said, “It’s not the same one. The one in the imperial capital has been destroyed by you and is in a semi-paralyzed state. I don’t know where he went after that, but we haven’t found him yet. However, there’s another one in the old Zuo family manor in Jingyang Province. He’s the last old master of the Zuo family, but this time... Boss Jun has destroyed his cultivation ability!”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Huyan Yichen said, “If I remember it correctly, the elders of the Junwu Empire are Spiritual Saints, right?”","Feng Xun crossed his arms. “That’s right.”","Huyan Yichen said, “Then you’re lying.”","Feng Xun frowned and stared at him. “Why am I lying? Tell me. When did I lie?”","Huyan Yichen said, “You said that Jun Linyuan has crippled the head of the Zuo family, who was a Spiritual Saint. As far as I know, he’s more than a junior Spiritual Saint. How was Jun Linyuan going to fight him? Is he more powerful than a junior Spiritual Saint?”","Feng Xun patted Huyan Yichen on the shoulder in satisfaction. “Hey, buddy, you were right.”","Huyan Yichen twisted his shoulder, stared at Feng Xun, and said grumpily, “I’m not your buddy! Keep bragging! I don’t believe Jun Linyuan can be that capable!”","Feng Xun glanced at Huyan Yichen in bewilderment. “I think... you don’t like","Boss Jun.”","Huyan Yichen snorted and looked away.","Feng Xun’s eyes widened as if he had just discovered a new land. “You used to follow Boss Jun everywhere and wouldn’t leave. Why are you jealous now? Huyan Yichen, are you comparing yourself to Boss Jun?”","Huyan Yichen threw a dirty look at Feng Xun.."]},{"number":3898,"title":"Chapter 3898: Compared to Boss Jun (2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun made a big deal out of it. “Oh my! What did I find? Huyan, are you really comparing yourself to Boss Jun? Why are you doing this to yourself? I don’t even dare to compare myself to Boss Jun because I don’t stand a chance.","How dare you... you’re incredible!”","Feng Xun cupped his hands at Huyan Yichen as he spoke, infuriating the teenager. Huyan Yichen’s face went scarlet red.","Seeing that Huyan Yichen was furious, Feng Wu tried to mediate the situation.","“Do you want to go in and look around?”","<font <=\"\" div=\"\">","Feng Wu pointed at the tower behind them as she spoke.","Huyan Yichen said grumpily, “That’s the master’s tower. We can’t get in...”","Feng Xun’s eyes lit up. “Really? I can go in?!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Maybe he has hidden something nice inside. Right?”","Feng Xun nodded immediately. “That’s right. I don’t mind coming out empty-handed, but what if there’s some good stuff inside? We’ll be so lucky!” He took Feng Wu’s hand in a hurry. “Show me inside. Quickly.”","Huyan Yichen gave Feng Xun a strange look. “I can’t believe you just said that.” He had never seen Feng Xun like this before.","In Huyan Yichen’s mind, Feng Xun was the naughty teenager who had bullied him so much that he used to cry.","Feng Xun glanced at him and raised his chin. “So what if I begged my sister? Do you have a sister? Do you?”","Huyan Yichen said, “I don’t know who you are anymore!”","Feng Xun said, “You’re just jealous! You’re jealous that I have such a wonderful sister! ”","Feng Xun put a hand on Feng Wu’s shoulder as he spoke.","He thought to himself, “1 need to get closer to little Feng Wu while Boss Jun isn’t around. Otherwise, when Boss Jun gets here, I won’t even be able to stand next to her!” At that thought, Feng Xun leaned his head on Feng Wu’s shoulder. Huyan Yichen couldn’t stand it anymore. “You...”","Feng Xun snorted and thought, “You have no idea how much Boss Jun has been guarding against all males when he and Feng Wu are together! You’re so lucky to be so close to her now! Huyan, you know nothing!”","Feng Wu gave in as well. She knocked Feng Xun on the head and said, “There. Let’s go.”","“Hey, this is...” Only then did Feng Xun seem to notice someone else was there, and he pointed at the young man next to Feng Wu.","He had noticed from the very beginning that the young man was with his sister and appeared to be quite close to her.","He didn’t say anything because he wanted to leave that young man hanging.","Feng Xun didn’t expect the young man to be so mild-tempered. He just stood there and listened without saying a word, which rendered Feng Xun speechless.","“Him? He’s Huyan Junchen, the eldest prince of Northern Yan,” Feng Wu introduced him.","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in amazement. “The eldest prince?”","Why was the prince so nice? Why did he just stand there and wait? Was he secretly in love with Feng Wu?","Feng Xun stared at the prince with eyes as sharp as daggers!","The prince was a smart man, and he immediately sensed Feng Xun’s hostility.","Sensing the strange atmosphere between them, Feng Wu wanted to intervene, but Feng Xun spoke first.","“Your Royal Highness, may I have a word?”","“That’s what I was thinking.” The prince nodded and went to a corner with Feng Xun. The two of them then started chatting.."]},{"number":3899,"title":"Chapter 3899: Compared to Boss Jun (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3899: Compared to Boss Jun (3)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Feng Xun was alarmed at first, but the prince said something, and Feng Xun beamed at him. He even patted the prince on the shoulder.","When they came back, they looked like best buddies.","It was mainly because Feng Xun could befriend anyone, and the prince only smiled bitterly.","They were about to leave when Huyan Yichen spotted his grandfather.","Seeing that the group was heading for the tower, old Huyan scolded them. “Where are you going?”","Huyan Yichen said excitedly, “Grandpa, Grandpa, we’re going into the tower.”","Old Huyan’s face darkened, and he said grumpily, “Do you think you can disturb the Patriarch just like that? Do you think you can go straight in? Other people may not know this, but you’ve lived here for so many years. Have you seen anyone else go in?”","Huyan Yichen said, “But Grandpa...”","Old Huyan said, “There’s no ‘but’! If you disturb the Patriarch, you’re going to die a miserable death! Now, come back with the prince and the others!”","Huyan Yichen said anxiously, “But Grandpa, we have people inside! We can go in! ”","Old Huyan was so angry that he laughed. “You have people inside? The Patriarch and the giant eagle are the only ones inside. Are they your men? Use your brain, even if you’re lying!”","Infuriated, old Huyan jabbed a finger in Huyan Yichen’s forehead as he spoke, trying to drag him away.","However, at that moment...","The protective wall that had always been sealed opened, and a giant eagle stood in front of them.","Seeing the giant eagle, old Huyan immediately became very respectful as if he was meeting the Patriarch. He even kicked Huyan Yichen, hinting at him to stand at attention and bow.","However, at that moment, Feng Wu greeted the giant eagle with a grin. “You came out before I knocked on the door. Did you know I was coming?","The giant eagle gave Feng Wu an aggrieved look and said grumpily, “You’ve been gone for so long, and the Patriarch is worried sick. He’s asked about you more than ten times a day, and I couldn’t go anywhere. I’ve done nothing but wait here for you. If you don’t come back now, I’m going to fly out and look for you!”","Feng Wu gave the eagle a wry smile. “I only asked a question. Why are you throwing so many things at me?”","The giant eagle said, “Come with me, then. The Patriarch is waiting.”","Feng Wu pointed at the people behind her. “They’re here to have a look around. I don’t think the Patriarch will mind, will he?”","The giant eagle said grumpily, “Just tell him that you invited them. What can he possibly say?”","The giant eagle finally saw that she wasn’t just a junior sister at all. She was the apple of the Patriarch’s eye!","Hence, they all entered the tower under old Huyan’s astonished gaze.","Outside, old Huyan just stood there.","He only realized what had happened when the door closed. He then asked Iron Tower, “Am I hearing things? Was that an illusion?”","Iron Tower shook his head.","Old Huyan was speechless.","He no longer knew what this world was like.","Meanwhile in the imperial palace.","Princess Raoxi was standing obediently in front of the king when he threw a teacup at her face.","She didn’t dare to dodge.","The tea splashed all over her face, and the cup made a bloody gash on her forehead.."]},{"number":3900,"title":"Chapter 3900: The End of Princess Rao (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 3900: The End of Princess Rao (1)","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Seeing the blood oozing out of Princess Rao’s forehead, the king was still furious.","He pointed at Princess Raoxi. “How dare you?!”","Princess Raoxi had no idea what she had done wrong, so she stubbornly knelt on the ground. Next to her, the queen was so anxious that she tried to comfort the king. “Your Majesty, what did Raoxi do? Why did you hit her like this...”","The king smirked. ‘What did she do? Ask her!”","The queen panicked. Could it be...","Meanwhile, Princess Raoxi gave the queen a warning look, telling her to keep her mouth shut. She then gracefully kowtowed to the king, raised her head, and said in a tone that was neither humble nor arrogant, “Father, I don’t know what I did wrong.”","The king was so angry that he laughed. “You don’t know? Don’t make me laugh! Do I need to remind you?”","Princess Raoxi straightened her back and said calmly, “Your Majesty, I’d love to know. ”","The king was so angry that he pointed at Princess Raoxi. “You’re unbelievable! How dare you do that? I can’t believe that I’ve chosen you to be one of my heirs!”","Princess Raoxi pursed her lips and didn’t say a word. She had a feeling that she would have a very difficult time, but...","“Father, are you talking about assassinating Feng Wu?” Princess Raoxi asked.","The king only sneered at her without saying a word.","Princess Raoxi sighed and looked at the emperor. “Father, if I had another chance, I would still go after her. I have to kill her!”","The king narrowed his eyes and stared at her like a wolf king.","Princess Raoxi said calmly, “Everyone says that she has the Divine Phoenix Blood and that she’s Jun Linyuan’s fiancee. Everyone says that she has a promising future. But Father, will it benefit the Northern Yan Kingdom to have such a person around? Will it benefit us if she marries Jun Linyuan and has a wonderful baby?","“Therefore, Feng Wu has to die!","“Once she’s dead, there will be no Divine Phoenix Blood anymore! The Junwu Empire won’t be a problem for the Northern Yan Kingdom. Once I become the ruler of our kingdom, I’ll join hands with the Dongsang Kingdom and rise above the Junwu Empire in the future!","“That’s why I don’t understand. Father, why are you so short-sighted? You actually like Feng Wu! She’s pretty, but she’s poisonous!","“Father, please make the right decision!”","After that, she kowtowed three times and felt that she had done a great service.","That was so much information that the queen didn’t know how to react.","Even the king..","He was so angry that he almost had a heart attack.","Did Raoxi just say he fancied Feng Wu?","She believed that he had given Feng Wu preferential treatment because he wanted Feng Wu to be his woman? She was the junior sister that the Patriarch protected and even might be the last pupil of Mu Jiuzhou!","How ridiculous...","The king was hoth an?rv and frightened","Seeing the grim look on the king’s face, Princess Raoxi thought that she had hit the nail on the head, so she went on.. “Father, the war between the Junwu Empire and the Dongsang Kingdom is going on in the Peace Grassland...”"]}]);
